(1303091, 167525, 31307, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I wonder what this shot looked like before the filter(s) had been applied.</td>', 'Interesting.  I wonder what this shot looked like before the filter(s) had been applied.', '2005-04-19 06:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
