(1303232, 163404, 23394, '<td valign="top">this image looks like it has a lot of potential, but is too small to fairly evaluate (and i''m sure you''ll get a ton of comments to that effect).  don''t take it personally.  i don''t know if you use photoshop or not, but if you do, here''s a <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tutorial</a> that will help you out.  if you aren''t using photoshop, simply ask on the forums ''how to size images'' and you''ll get the info you need.  good luck in the future!</td>', 'this image looks like it has a lot of potential, but is too small to fairly evaluate (and i''m sure you''ll get a ton of comments to that effect).  don''t take it personally.  i don''t know if you use photoshop or not, but if you do, here''s a tutorial that will help you out.  if you aren''t using photoshop, simply ask on the forums ''how to size images'' and you''ll get the info you need.  good luck in the future!', '2005-04-19 08:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303237, 168233, 23394, '<td valign="top">ok, you''ve got a good subject, but the execution is falling a bit short.  the lighting is a bit harsh, and the reflections are distractions (a polarizing filter could handle this nicely).  you might consider tilting the camera just a bit more to make the lines a bit more dynamic.  i don''t mind the shallow dof, but the closer wheel could be a tad sharper.  all the same, nice effort, good luck!</td>', 'ok, you''ve got a good subject, but the execution is falling a bit short.  the lighting is a bit harsh, and the reflections are distractions (a polarizing filter could handle this nicely).  you might consider tilting the camera just a bit more to make the lines a bit more dynamic.  i don''t mind the shallow dof, but the closer wheel could be a tad sharper.  all the same, nice effort, good luck!', '2005-04-19 08:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303242, 165987, 25787, '<td valign="top">The shadow is just a bit too strong.   Takes up too much of the small foreground.  Nice scene.</td>', 'The shadow is just a bit too strong.   Takes up too much of the small foreground.  Nice scene.', '2005-04-19 08:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303246, 166057, 23394, '<td valign="top">i''m never quite sure what to make of images as this...i can''t tell what causes the glittery look.  it <i>appears</i> that you used an onboard flash and were just a little too close.  i think the colors have a lot of potential, but am not to keen on the centered composition.  all the same, nice image, good luck!<br/> <br/>also, not quite sure what the title means...</td>', 'i''m never quite sure what to make of images as this...i can''t tell what causes the glittery look.  it appears that you used an onboard flash and were just a little too close.  i think the colors have a lot of potential, but am not to keen on the centered composition.  all the same, nice image, good luck! also, not quite sure what the title means...', '2005-04-19 08:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303251, 168138, 14614, '<td valign="top">bee adds interest, white blurry background detracts a bit (IMHO)</td>', 'bee adds interest, white blurry background detracts a bit (IMHO)', '2005-04-19 08:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303254, 160934, 23394, '<td valign="top">looks like a...what?  lily with a black background?  the lighting is handled well, but i''m not too keen on the composition or the square cropping.  it''s almost as i''m looking down a funnel that is draining out the image.</td>', 'looks like a...what?  lily with a black background?  the lighting is handled well, but i''m not too keen on the composition or the square cropping.  it''s almost as i''m looking down a funnel that is draining out the image.', '2005-04-19 08:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303256, 167723, 33379, '<td valign="top">awwe how cute</td>', 'awwe how cute', '2005-04-19 08:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303258, 161043, 18191, '<td valign="top">The way that the black background goes about it, it seems as though the swan is sitting on  a black surface. I think that you could have brought out the whites a little bit more in the image. I like the use of negative space here.</td>', 'The way that the black background goes about it, it seems as though the swan is sitting on  a black surface. I think that you could have brought out the whites a little bit more in the image. I like the use of negative space here.', '2005-04-19 08:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303259, 166767, 25787, '<td valign="top">Moon overexposed with a blue halo.  A graduated ND filter would help with this.</td>', 'Moon overexposed with a blue halo.  A graduated ND filter would help with this.', '2005-04-19 08:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303260, 166943, 18191, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle/perspective. I feel that the exposure was difficult but remains satisfactory.</td>', 'Interesting angle/perspective. I feel that the exposure was difficult but remains satisfactory.', '2005-04-19 08:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303262, 162322, 33379, '<td valign="top">thats nice</td>', 'thats nice', '2005-04-19 08:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303263, 160581, 33379, '<td valign="top">great photo</td>', 'great photo', '2005-04-19 08:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303264, 168252, 18191, '<td valign="top">Cute portrait with a good expression. I do not know the exact lighting set-up used, but I think that a larger reflector (or one at all) could have been used to help fill in some of the shadows on the child''s face.</td>', 'Cute portrait with a good expression. I do not know the exact lighting set-up used, but I think that a larger reflector (or one at all) could have been used to help fill in some of the shadows on the child''s face.', '2005-04-19 08:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303266, 167794, 23394, '<td valign="top">i think this would have been stronger if the supporting colors hadn''t been so shadowed.  the greens and magentas are so relegated to the background that they aren''t really helping the image.  some images work well when caught midday, but this subject doesn''t really lend itself to that much lighting, at least not from this perspective.  the focus also appears to be a bit soft.</td>', 'i think this would have been stronger if the supporting colors hadn''t been so shadowed.  the greens and magentas are so relegated to the background that they aren''t really helping the image.  some images work well when caught midday, but this subject doesn''t really lend itself to that much lighting, at least not from this perspective.  the focus also appears to be a bit soft.', '2005-04-19 08:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303269, 167095, 18191, '<td valign="top">Good use of backlighting here. I feel that the composition is a little bit awkward and that a smudgeon of fill-flash (perhaps at 1/4 power or strongly diffused)  could have been used to bring out the details of that was underexposed due to the starkness of the background and the backlighting.</td>', 'Good use of backlighting here. I feel that the composition is a little bit awkward and that a smudgeon of fill-flash (perhaps at 1/4 power or strongly diffused)  could have been used to bring out the details of that was underexposed due to the starkness of the background and the backlighting.', '2005-04-19 08:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303272, 167563, 14614, '<td valign="top">too small for me to study the details - sorry</td>', 'too small for me to study the details - sorry', '2005-04-19 08:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303274, 166902, 14614, '<td valign="top">great use of color, busy foreground works well, nicely done</td>', 'great use of color, busy foreground works well, nicely done', '2005-04-19 08:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303276, 167993, 33379, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2005-04-19 08:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303277, 168312, 18191, '<td valign="top">This is a place with potential. I think that you have made the most of your conditions there, but try returning when there is a dark and moody sky, just after a storm with clouds and such. This will add much more impact. In this shot, the sky is bland and boring and it takes up literally 1/4 of the photo, so in that regards, 1/4 of the photo is losing its interest due to the uneventfulness of the sky. Sorry to roast, but my other criticism is that the barns have been overly dodged. But don''t be disheartened! Get back out there, brave the conditions, and shoot again!</td>', 'This is a place with potential. I think that you have made the most of your conditions there, but try returning when there is a dark and moody sky, just after a storm with clouds and such. This will add much more impact. In this shot, the sky is bland and boring and it takes up literally 1/4 of the photo, so in that regards, 1/4 of the photo is losing its interest due to the uneventfulness of the sky. Sorry to roast, but my other criticism is that the barns have been overly dodged. But don''t be disheartened! Get back out there, brave the conditions, and shoot again!', '2005-04-19 08:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303278, 167008, 23394, '<td valign="top">great colors and composition.  it''s really hard to tell how much of this was captured in camera and how much of the blur was done in post-processing.  either you did an incredible job panning, or a great job selecting.  i don''t know why, but to me it seems to be more of an added effect...</td>', 'great colors and composition.  it''s really hard to tell how much of this was captured in camera and how much of the blur was done in post-processing.  either you did an incredible job panning, or a great job selecting.  i don''t know why, but to me it seems to be more of an added effect...', '2005-04-19 08:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303279, 168228, 18191, '<td valign="top">Great shot that is minimalistic in a sense to me. The focal point jumps out at you and the composition somhow works. I know it''s cliche, but maybe having a child jumping through the shot or something of that matter, in dark clothing, would make the image have some pop to balance out the focal point. Just a suggestion. Good stuff!</td>', 'Great shot that is minimalistic in a sense to me. The focal point jumps out at you and the composition somhow works. I know it''s cliche, but maybe having a child jumping through the shot or something of that matter, in dark clothing, would make the image have some pop to balance out the focal point. Just a suggestion. Good stuff!', '2005-04-19 08:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303280, 168121, 18191, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of colors here.</td>', 'Nice contrast of colors here.', '2005-04-19 09:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303281, 168063, 2829, '<td valign="top">Does that mean you''re going to eat the kittens? hehe<br/>The title and the photo do not match. These are kittens not puppies. <br/>They look very cute but out of focus. There is just a bit of harsh light on the cover to the right from the lights (diffuse the light with some tissues/napkins/cloth/reflector) and I wish at least one of the kittens was looking up at the camera. Also, that light crossing the background is a bit distracting and doesn''t appear to serve any purpose.</td>', 'Does that mean you''re going to eat the kittens? heheThe title and the photo do not match. These are kittens not puppies. They look very cute but out of focus. There is just a bit of harsh light on the cover to the right from the lights (diffuse the light with some tissues/napkins/cloth/reflector) and I wish at least one of the kittens was looking up at the camera. Also, that light crossing the background is a bit distracting and doesn''t appear to serve any purpose.', '2005-04-19 09:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303283, 165252, 23394, '<td valign="top">what a fun capture.  too bad the lighting is so strong, it really washes out a lot of detail.</td>', 'what a fun capture.  too bad the lighting is so strong, it really washes out a lot of detail.', '2005-04-19 09:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303284, 164955, 18191, '<td valign="top">An elegant softness to this image. I feel that her face could use a tad more light (perhaps through a snoot at least on her eye or a reflector to bounce some light onto her face) . Good studio portrait.</td>', 'An elegant softness to this image. I feel that her face could use a tad more light (perhaps through a snoot at least on her eye or a reflector to bounce some light onto her face) . Good studio portrait.', '2005-04-19 09:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303286, 162216, 18191, '<td valign="top">I dont know your cameras controls, but perhaps a smaller aperture and thus a greater DOF could have been used to get more of the shot in focus.</td>', 'I dont know your cameras controls, but perhaps a smaller aperture and thus a greater DOF could have been used to get more of the shot in focus.', '2005-04-19 09:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303288, 168081, 23394, '<td valign="top">this looks suspiciously like a piotr and/or bigjohnny shot.  excellent work.  good luck!</td>', 'this looks suspiciously like a piotr and/or bigjohnny shot.  excellent work.  good luck!', '2005-04-19 09:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303290, 166096, 18191, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of tone.</td>', 'Interesting choice of tone.', '2005-04-19 09:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303291, 167164, 18191, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle for fasion. Almost makes the model look like a doll. Overall the image seems a tad flat to me.</td>', 'Interesting angle for fasion. Almost makes the model look like a doll. Overall the image seems a tad flat to me.', '2005-04-19 09:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303292, 164440, 23394, '<td valign="top">there''s not to much you can do with a shot like this.  people are either going to love it or ho-hum it.  you might consider cropping or cloning out the two flares at the bottom, and maybe boosting the contrast a bit, just to make the wing a bit sharper.  good luck!</td>', 'there''s not to much you can do with a shot like this.  people are either going to love it or ho-hum it.  you might consider cropping or cloning out the two flares at the bottom, and maybe boosting the contrast a bit, just to make the wing a bit sharper.  good luck!', '2005-04-19 09:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303293, 160041, 18191, '<td valign="top">Great colors here with a great cloud. This image in itself gets an 8 from me. However, had you thought of bringing along a ND filter? Coupled with this shot, a long exposure, thus blurring the waves and water into a misty softness, could have been very effective. Just a suggestion --- wonderful shot with an effective D&amp;B treatment to it.</td>', 'Great colors here with a great cloud. This image in itself gets an 8 from me. However, had you thought of bringing along a ND filter? Coupled with this shot, a long exposure, thus blurring the waves and water into a misty softness, could have been very effective. Just a suggestion --- wonderful shot with an effective D&B treatment to it.', '2005-04-19 09:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303295, 168325, 18191, '<td valign="top">Cool shot --- looks like he''s using his camouflage mechanism ;)</td>', 'Cool shot --- looks like he''s using his camouflage mechanism ;)', '2005-04-19 09:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303298, 168063, 23394, '<td valign="top">these are cute <i>kittens</i>, but no worries, i don''t really mark down for titles.  this subject is loaded with potential, but your execution could use a little work.  the focus is soft and the lighting is uneven.  i bet they were fun to play with!</td>', 'these are cute kittens, but no worries, i don''t really mark down for titles.  this subject is loaded with potential, but your execution could use a little work.  the focus is soft and the lighting is uneven.  i bet they were fun to play with!', '2005-04-19 09:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303299, 168275, 33379, '<td valign="top">wow nice shot and love the green!</td>', 'wow nice shot and love the green!', '2005-04-19 09:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303300, 168230, 18191, '<td valign="top">A fair attempt at a macro. I would have at least cropped out the thorn sticking out of the edge of the photo in the bottom left. Next time you try something like this, try for a striking and fresh composition. How about trying it with the stem going from the top left corner of the frame across diagonally into the bottom right? The more you play around with creative compostion in-camera, the more fun you''ll have and the more striking the image can become.</td>', 'A fair attempt at a macro. I would have at least cropped out the thorn sticking out of the edge of the photo in the bottom left. Next time you try something like this, try for a striking and fresh composition. How about trying it with the stem going from the top left corner of the frame across diagonally into the bottom right? The more you play around with creative compostion in-camera, the more fun you''ll have and the more striking the image can become.', '2005-04-19 09:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303301, 167714, 23394, '<td valign="top">this image has potential, but there could be a bit more contrast between the blossoms and the light side of the builing.  i like the basic composition.  it also appears that the focus is a bit soft.  good luck!</td>', 'this image has potential, but there could be a bit more contrast between the blossoms and the light side of the builing.  i like the basic composition.  it also appears that the focus is a bit soft.  good luck!', '2005-04-19 09:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303303, 166742, 18191, '<td valign="top">Great shot from an interesting angle. I like how the red color is reflected from the lips to the piece of cloth in the bottom right corner. The image has a pleasing softness with a good use of selective DOF. Superb.</td>', 'Great shot from an interesting angle. I like how the red color is reflected from the lips to the piece of cloth in the bottom right corner. The image has a pleasing softness with a good use of selective DOF. Superb.', '2005-04-19 09:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303304, 168070, 18191, '<td valign="top">Cute shot! Seems like you have just barely missed the focus on the critter''s eyes, but definitely a good fun shot!</td>', 'Cute shot! Seems like you have just barely missed the focus on the critter''s eyes, but definitely a good fun shot!', '2005-04-19 09:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303305, 168145, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is a pretty picture, even if the cropping is a bit uneven.  love the colors and details.  the lighting is just right.  good luck!</td>', 'this is a pretty picture, even if the cropping is a bit uneven.  love the colors and details.  the lighting is just right.  good luck!', '2005-04-19 09:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303306, 167305, 33379, '<td valign="top">great shot i would have given this a 10 but i dont like that red or pink streak</td>', 'great shot i would have given this a 10 but i dont like that red or pink streak', '2005-04-19 09:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303307, 164201, 18191, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors in the sky. I would maybe try cropping some off of the left side as it seems to be just empty space.</td>', 'Wonderful colors in the sky. I would maybe try cropping some off of the left side as it seems to be just empty space.', '2005-04-19 09:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303308, 166159, 18191, '<td valign="top">I think this image could use some contrast, it seems a little bit flat. Looks like a good shot to practice dodging and burning on! ;)</td>', 'I think this image could use some contrast, it seems a little bit flat. Looks like a good shot to practice dodging and burning on! ;)', '2005-04-19 09:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303309, 167573, 18191, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Makes us feel ever so small in this world. Good concept and good minimalistic approach.</td>', 'Interesting. Makes us feel ever so small in this world. Good concept and good minimalistic approach.', '2005-04-19 09:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303311, 167861, 23394, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful animal!  these are tough shots, as you have so little control over your subjects.  it''s too bad he''s looking off camera, as that tends to take the viewer right out of the image.  all the same, nice capture, good luck!</td>', 'what a beautiful animal!  these are tough shots, as you have so little control over your subjects.  it''s too bad he''s looking off camera, as that tends to take the viewer right out of the image.  all the same, nice capture, good luck!', '2005-04-19 09:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303316, 163973, 23394, '<td valign="top">lovely colors, definitely a moment worth capturing.  not too keen on the bordering, but that''s my personal preference.  good luck!</td>', 'lovely colors, definitely a moment worth capturing.  not too keen on the bordering, but that''s my personal preference.  good luck!', '2005-04-19 09:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303318, 166338, 18191, '<td valign="top">Like the saturation here. Intersting composition --- seems to be split up into six destinctive layers that draw the eye from the bottom to the top (don''t know if it was intentional, but it is there and effective)/ It does not stand out however as an exceptional landscape because the angle is plain boring. Okay, so you showed what the place looked like head on, but I don''t get a feeling of what the place *really* is about. Try a fresh new angle, maybe excluding some parts of the landscape, but including some local point of interest, a person or a fence or a small house, that will help tell a story of a place so that one could see it and understand it as if they had been there too.</td>', 'Like the saturation here. Intersting composition --- seems to be split up into six destinctive layers that draw the eye from the bottom to the top (don''t know if it was intentional, but it is there and effective)/ It does not stand out however as an exceptional landscape because the angle is plain boring. Okay, so you showed what the place looked like head on, but I don''t get a feeling of what the place *really* is about. Try a fresh new angle, maybe excluding some parts of the landscape, but including some local point of interest, a person or a fence or a small house, that will help tell a story of a place so that one could see it and understand it as if they had been there too.', '2005-04-19 09:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303320, 168183, 18191, '<td valign="top">Awesome, awesome bokeh. It seems slightly tilted to the right to me though.<br/></td>', 'Awesome, awesome bokeh. It seems slightly tilted to the right to me though.', '2005-04-19 09:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303323, 167494, 18191, '<td valign="top">I like the rusty tones in this shot. Quite interesting.</td>', 'I like the rusty tones in this shot. Quite interesting.', '2005-04-19 09:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303325, 166799, 18191, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors in a good floodlit shot.</td>', 'Very nice colors in a good floodlit shot.', '2005-04-19 09:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303327, 166859, 18191, '<td valign="top">Oooh that green in the sky is so luscious! Makes me jealous that I wasn''t there --- cool :)</td>', 'Oooh that green in the sky is so luscious! Makes me jealous that I wasn''t there --- cool :)', '2005-04-19 09:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303330, 168063, 17033, '<td valign="top">You can eat three! I''m full after one. Seriously, nice study but a little too yellow/red  and focus not quite perfect on the kittens.</td>', 'You can eat three! I''m full after one. Seriously, nice study but a little too yellow/red  and focus not quite perfect on the kittens.', '2005-04-19 09:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303331, 167995, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice work.  the colors and textures are well captured.  good luck!</td>', 'nice work.  the colors and textures are well captured.  good luck!', '2005-04-19 09:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303332, 166821, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame the tips of the petals on the left are cropped off. Great colours.</td>', 'Shame the tips of the petals on the left are cropped off. Great colours.', '2005-04-19 09:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303334, 168327, 18191, '<td valign="top">Nice use of mist... always making a shot extra moody and making one analyze onself. Good shot with an effective composition.</td>', 'Nice use of mist... always making a shot extra moody and making one analyze onself. Good shot with an effective composition.', '2005-04-19 09:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
