(1303360, 162322, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting backdrop for a portrait.  i can''t tell if i like it, or if the image would be stronger if the background was blurred just a bit.  the side lighting from the right looks like it could be dialed down just a hair.  don''t know why, but it also seems that the focus is a bit soft.  all the same, nice capture, good luck!</td>', 'interesting backdrop for a portrait.  i can''t tell if i like it, or if the image would be stronger if the background was blurred just a bit.  the side lighting from the right looks like it could be dialed down just a hair.  don''t know why, but it also seems that the focus is a bit soft.  all the same, nice capture, good luck!', '2005-04-19 09:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303365, 161238, 4729, '<td valign="top">Love this!!</td>', 'Love this!!', '2005-04-19 09:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303366, 166446, 8522, '<td valign="top">Would have been more effective if camera was straight. Fingernails are a weak point here.</td>', 'Would have been more effective if camera was straight. Fingernails are a weak point here.', '2005-04-19 09:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303369, 167922, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of centered compositions.</td>', 'Not a fan of centered compositions.', '2005-04-19 09:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303370, 167740, 4729, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2005-04-19 09:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303371, 167190, 23394, '<td valign="top">well, this is something <i>i</i> don''t see everyday!  nice capture.  i think your image would be stronger though, if you had cropped off the left third; that space isn''t doing anything to really strengthen the image.  good luck!</td>', 'well, this is something i don''t see everyday!  nice capture.  i think your image would be stronger though, if you had cropped off the left third; that space isn''t doing anything to really strengthen the image.  good luck!', '2005-04-19 09:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303372, 167619, 4729, '<td valign="top">Super work!</td>', 'Super work!', '2005-04-19 09:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303375, 166567, 4729, '<td valign="top">Wow..!! Great job!</td>', 'Wow..!! Great job!', '2005-04-19 09:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303376, 164955, 33379, '<td valign="top">i wouldve liked this better if it was so soft</td>', 'i wouldve liked this better if it was so soft', '2005-04-19 09:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303377, 167489, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors, nice composition, great dof.  good luck with this!</td>', 'beautiful colors, nice composition, great dof.  good luck with this!', '2005-04-19 09:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303379, 168257, 8522, '<td valign="top">Focus seems to be on background, rather than your subjects.</td>', 'Focus seems to be on background, rather than your subjects.', '2005-04-19 09:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303383, 160591, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice find.  shame the focus is soft, though.</td>', 'nice find.  shame the focus is soft, though.', '2005-04-19 09:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303384, 168128, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely balanced composition... stormy skies with foregrounds lit by sun are always a winner. Border is too distracting.</td>', 'Lovely balanced composition... stormy skies with foregrounds lit by sun are always a winner. Border is too distracting.', '2005-04-19 09:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303389, 166469, 18191, '<td valign="top">Somber shot that tells a definite story. Well done and a good example of photojournalism.</td>', 'Somber shot that tells a definite story. Well done and a good example of photojournalism.', '2005-04-19 09:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303390, 165581, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea. I would have prefered more dof covering the whole foot, and a wider crop, leaving the foot on the left.</td>', 'Lovely idea. I would have prefered more dof covering the whole foot, and a wider crop, leaving the foot on the left.', '2005-04-19 09:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303391, 166559, 18191, '<td valign="top">I may have cropped closer on this shot.</td>', 'I may have cropped closer on this shot.', '2005-04-19 09:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303394, 167525, 18191, '<td valign="top">Infrared always amkes what would be a mediocre shot crackle! Im lovin'' it :)</td>', 'Infrared always amkes what would be a mediocre shot crackle! Im lovin'' it :)', '2005-04-19 09:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303396, 160041, 8522, '<td valign="top">Looks too Photoshopped/ filtered for my taste.</td>', 'Looks too Photoshopped/ filtered for my taste.', '2005-04-19 09:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303397, 165804, 23394, '<td valign="top">while this image is loaded with potential, it will probably work better framed and printed large than as a challenge entry...images like this lose too much of the detail that really make them strong when you have to shrink them down.  you might also consider boosting your contrast just a bit.  good luck!</td>', 'while this image is loaded with potential, it will probably work better framed and printed large than as a challenge entry...images like this lose too much of the detail that really make them strong when you have to shrink them down.  you might also consider boosting your contrast just a bit.  good luck!', '2005-04-19 09:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303399, 168319, 18191, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The horizon seems slightly tilted down to the right which could be easily corrected. I think that this shot has a sense of tranquility to it. I would have experimented by placing the horizon at different parts of the image. Placing it centrally would have furthermore added to the mood of the shot.</td>', 'Nice shot. The horizon seems slightly tilted down to the right which could be easily corrected. I think that this shot has a sense of tranquility to it. I would have experimented by placing the horizon at different parts of the image. Placing it centrally would have furthermore added to the mood of the shot.', '2005-04-19 09:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303400, 168165, 15711, '<td valign="top">Reallly nice.  Silhouettes of trees in sunset can be over done, but I find this one refreshing and quite compelling.</td>', 'Reallly nice.  Silhouettes of trees in sunset can be over done, but I find this one refreshing and quite compelling.', '2005-04-19 09:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303402, 165018, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of your border, or your square crop. Compositionally not striking enough. Nice use of dof and nice colours.</td>', 'Not a fan of your border, or your square crop. Compositionally not striking enough. Nice use of dof and nice colours.', '2005-04-19 09:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303403, 167963, 18191, '<td valign="top">This shot seems out of focus. To ensure the best focus and stability you should use a tripod on shots, especially macros.</td>', 'This shot seems out of focus. To ensure the best focus and stability you should use a tripod on shots, especially macros.', '2005-04-19 09:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303404, 166380, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice! I''m always amazed that a camera can capture that exact moment.</td>', 'Nice! I''m always amazed that a camera can capture that exact moment.', '2005-04-19 09:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303405, 167422, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely!!</td>', 'Lovely!!', '2005-04-19 09:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303406, 167587, 8522, '<td valign="top">Bug and centre of flower needed to be sharp.</td>', 'Bug and centre of flower needed to be sharp.', '2005-04-19 09:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303408, 166940, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2005-04-19 09:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303410, 164671, 15711, '<td valign="top">A bit staged, but quite nice nonetheless.</td>', 'A bit staged, but quite nice nonetheless.', '2005-04-19 09:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303411, 167849, 18191, '<td valign="top">Interesting portrait. Technically, this is superb and I really cannot find much wrong about it. Nice way to fill the frame.</td>', 'Interesting portrait. Technically, this is superb and I really cannot find much wrong about it. Nice way to fill the frame.', '2005-04-19 09:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303412, 166357, 23394, '<td valign="top">while this is an interesting composition, i find the lighting just a bit too uneven.  a fair amount of the detail is blown out.  not quite sure what to make of the post-processing on this, but that''s probably just me.  all the same, you have a nice image.  good luck!</td>', 'while this is an interesting composition, i find the lighting just a bit too uneven.  a fair amount of the detail is blown out.  not quite sure what to make of the post-processing on this, but that''s probably just me.  all the same, you have a nice image.  good luck!', '2005-04-19 09:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303413, 168277, 18191, '<td valign="top">Haha... funny</td>', 'Haha... funny', '2005-04-19 09:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303414, 167452, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and great subject, effective dof. Composition lets this one down though. The eyes usually work best when following rule of thirds.</td>', 'Lovely colours and great subject, effective dof. Composition lets this one down though. The eyes usually work best when following rule of thirds.', '2005-04-19 09:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303415, 168291, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo. I''d love to see it in black and white or perhaps sepia tone.</td>', 'This is a nice photo. I''d love to see it in black and white or perhaps sepia tone.', '2005-04-19 09:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303416, 168237, 8522, '<td valign="top">Photo is wonky.</td>', 'Photo is wonky.', '2005-04-19 09:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303420, 165692, 17033, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I think it would have good to crop more off the top and bottom</td>', 'Nice shot but I think it would have good to crop more off the top and bottom', '2005-04-19 09:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303421, 161121, 5664, '<td valign="top">sorry about the eyes .. ir</td>', 'sorry about the eyes .. ir', '2005-04-19 09:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303422, 167444, 8522, '<td valign="top">WOW! Great piece of stock travel photography. Well balanced composition with great flow.</td>', 'WOW! Great piece of stock travel photography. Well balanced composition with great flow.', '2005-04-19 09:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303424, 163558, 18191, '<td valign="top">Well, you picked the right conditions to go out and shoot this. The quality of light seems very good and the blue cast is effective. I think you may have gon slightly overboard on the dodging and burning, but it is a very well done shot. THere seems to be some "jaggies" and artifacts, so I would have a second look at how you are compressing your images. If you need help in doing so, feel free to PM me.</td>', 'Well, you picked the right conditions to go out and shoot this. The quality of light seems very good and the blue cast is effective. I think you may have gon slightly overboard on the dodging and burning, but it is a very well done shot. THere seems to be some "jaggies" and artifacts, so I would have a second look at how you are compressing your images. If you need help in doing so, feel free to PM me.', '2005-04-19 09:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303426, 163269, 18191, '<td valign="top">Nice subject for a macro. I think that the background is too distracting. Try bringing along a piece of black velvet or foamcore to put behind your subject, essentially a portable background.</td>', 'Nice subject for a macro. I think that the background is too distracting. Try bringing along a piece of black velvet or foamcore to put behind your subject, essentially a portable background.', '2005-04-19 09:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303428, 161381, 23394, '<td valign="top">ok, i''m recommending this for a dq because you have blantantly ripped me off!<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=117349" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/23394/thumb/117349.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/23394/thumb/117349.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/23394/thumb/117349.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>i''m just kidding...nice shot.  a bit dark, but all the same, nice work.  good luck!</td>', 'ok, i''m recommending this for a dq because you have blantantly ripped me off!  i''m just kidding...nice shot.  a bit dark, but all the same, nice work.  good luck!', '2005-04-19 09:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303430, 162998, 18191, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot with a good use of blur. Wonder if you could have gotten a more dramatic angle on the piece. I might have flipped this horizontally so that the water was running from left to right, but that is just my tendency.</td>', 'Interesting shot with a good use of blur. Wonder if you could have gotten a more dramatic angle on the piece. I might have flipped this horizontally so that the water was running from left to right, but that is just my tendency.', '2005-04-19 09:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303435, 167444, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I loce the candid nature of the figures and their silhouettes, the reflections and everything. Only criticism is that the reds in the reflection of the sun itself seem oversatured and I would pull those back just a tad either through a color burn, or by not bumping up the saturation in that particular area.</td>', 'Beautiful. I loce the candid nature of the figures and their silhouettes, the reflections and everything. Only criticism is that the reds in the reflection of the sun itself seem oversatured and I would pull those back just a tad either through a color burn, or by not bumping up the saturation in that particular area.', '2005-04-19 09:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303436, 160446, 8522, '<td valign="top">Centered subject with harsh shadows on the face, with tree growing out of back of head and deep dof resulting in distracting background... a great example of a typical snapshot.<br/>Try waiting for a different time of day when the light is low and less harsh, use rule of thirds for your subject and try experimenting with a reflector. Make sure the background is not distracting, and try some more flattering poses and expressions without the strap around the neck.</td>', 'Centered subject with harsh shadows on the face, with tree growing out of back of head and deep dof resulting in distracting background... a great example of a typical snapshot.Try waiting for a different time of day when the light is low and less harsh, use rule of thirds for your subject and try experimenting with a reflector. Make sure the background is not distracting, and try some more flattering poses and expressions without the strap around the neck.', '2005-04-19 09:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303441, 167452, 18191, '<td valign="top">Great macro with a nice warmth to it. Stark colors and nice contrast between them. The more I look at it the more I like it.</td>', 'Great macro with a nice warmth to it. Stark colors and nice contrast between them. The more I look at it the more I like it.', '2005-04-19 09:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303442, 167963, 23394, '<td valign="top">i have an idea what you''re after, but this seems a bit chaotic to me.  hard to find a strong subject with all the competing soft elements that make up most of the image.  love the colors.  good luck!</td>', 'i have an idea what you''re after, but this seems a bit chaotic to me.  hard to find a strong subject with all the competing soft elements that make up most of the image.  love the colors.  good luck!', '2005-04-19 09:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303443, 168212, 20204, '<td valign="top">It feels like the flowers are out of focus...  The high contrast of this image seems to cancel out any soft-focus effect (if it was intended as such).  With a high contrast background I''d go for razor-sharp.  With a mid-contrats background the soft-focus may work better.  The border also give me a bit of claustraphobia.</td>', 'It feels like the flowers are out of focus...  The high contrast of this image seems to cancel out any soft-focus effect (if it was intended as such).  With a high contrast background I''d go for razor-sharp.  With a mid-contrats background the soft-focus may work better.  The border also give me a bit of claustraphobia.', '2005-04-19 09:39:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1303444, 164860, 18191, '<td valign="top">I like the starkness and contrast here, but I fear I am missing the concept.</td>', 'I like the starkness and contrast here, but I fear I am missing the concept.', '2005-04-19 09:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303445, 164257, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative shot. Great character. The uneven border works well. I like the pose.</td>', 'Very imaginative shot. Great character. The uneven border works well. I like the pose.', '2005-04-19 09:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303446, 160581, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and stunning. 9 where it is, a 10 if you had made the horizons parallel, the capital seems to be leaning to its right.</td>', 'Beautiful and stunning. 9 where it is, a 10 if you had made the horizons parallel, the capital seems to be leaning to its right.', '2005-04-19 09:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303450, 166254, 18191, '<td valign="top">Good composition and beautiful reflection.</td>', 'Good composition and beautiful reflection.', '2005-04-19 09:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303451, 167095, 20204, '<td valign="top">The detail in the flower petals is fanstastic.  Unfortunately, the background is such a harsh contrast that is overpowers the flowers and washes out some of the rich green and texture that may otherwise be found in the stems.</td>', 'The detail in the flower petals is fanstastic.  Unfortunately, the background is such a harsh contrast that is overpowers the flowers and washes out some of the rich green and texture that may otherwise be found in the stems.', '2005-04-19 09:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303452, 168181, 8522, '<td valign="top">Bear''s colour is too similar to the background.</td>', 'Bear''s colour is too similar to the background.', '2005-04-19 09:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303453, 168060, 18191, '<td valign="top">Cute shot :) I like the tonal range of the blues in it, very nice,</td>', 'Cute shot :) I like the tonal range of the blues in it, very nice,', '2005-04-19 09:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303456, 167130, 18191, '<td valign="top">Good candid that is technically well done.</td>', 'Good candid that is technically well done.', '2005-04-19 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303459, 167796, 18191, '<td valign="top">Funny candid with a priceless expression :-D</td>', 'Funny candid with a priceless expression :-D', '2005-04-19 09:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303460, 168325, 8522, '<td valign="top">Subject''s colour is too similar to background. I don''t like seeing animals in what is obviously a small zoo.</td>', 'Subject''s colour is too similar to background. I don''t like seeing animals in what is obviously a small zoo.', '2005-04-19 09:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303461, 167602, 20204, '<td valign="top">As a subject, the goose is cropped off-screen.  This is a bit distracting.  There also seems to be a focus problem in this image.  the goose isn''t sharp, and the entire background is soft was well.  You may also notice the stick which is out of focus on the left.  As it crosses through the subject, it creates another distraction.</td>', 'As a subject, the goose is cropped off-screen.  This is a bit distracting.  There also seems to be a focus problem in this image.  the goose isn''t sharp, and the entire background is soft was well.  You may also notice the stick which is out of focus on the left.  As it crosses through the subject, it creates another distraction.', '2005-04-19 09:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303462, 168202, 18191, '<td valign="top">This shot has a nice feeling of solitude to it. Good use of super wide-angle.</td>', 'This shot has a nice feeling of solitude to it. Good use of super wide-angle.', '2005-04-19 09:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303464, 163981, 18191, '<td valign="top">Nice shot with a nice warm tone. Love the sky!</td>', 'Nice shot with a nice warm tone. Love the sky!', '2005-04-19 09:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303465, 164440, 18191, '<td valign="top">I like the wide range of colors present here.</td>', 'I like the wide range of colors present here.', '2005-04-19 09:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303468, 167885, 8522, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous light, shame you didn''t have a wider lens to catch the bottom of the doorway. Not sure about taking it at eye-level though which seems a bit unimaginative.</td>', 'Gorgeous light, shame you didn''t have a wider lens to catch the bottom of the doorway. Not sure about taking it at eye-level though which seems a bit unimaginative.', '2005-04-19 09:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303472, 164586, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones and textures. I don''t like the centered horizon though.</td>', 'Lovely tones and textures. I don''t like the centered horizon though.', '2005-04-19 09:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303473, 167836, 20204, '<td valign="top">I think you could emphasize the nature aspect more in balance with the "mother" aspect by addidng a sense of depth to the image.  Perhaps putting the chair on an angle and off center...  There''s also a significant chunk of blown highlights in the hair which distracts from the overall image.</td>', 'I think you could emphasize the nature aspect more in balance with the "mother" aspect by addidng a sense of depth to the image.  Perhaps putting the chair on an angle and off center...  There''s also a significant chunk of blown highlights in the hair which distracts from the overall image.', '2005-04-19 09:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303475, 166767, 8522, '<td valign="top">A bit too surreal-looking for my taste.</td>', 'A bit too surreal-looking for my taste.', '2005-04-19 09:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303476, 168295, 18191, '<td valign="top">Nice cat portrait. I might have thought about cropping out the ears to bring more attention to the eyes which I see as the focal point of the shot.</td>', 'Nice cat portrait. I might have thought about cropping out the ears to bring more attention to the eyes which I see as the focal point of the shot.', '2005-04-19 09:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303477, 167872, 20204, '<td valign="top">Seems like the highlights went a bit too far in the upper left, but the effect overall is very cool, and the guy in the middle is a perfect compliment.  Wierd, but very cool.</td>', 'Seems like the highlights went a bit too far in the upper left, but the effect overall is very cool, and the guy in the middle is a perfect compliment.  Wierd, but very cool.', '2005-04-19 09:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303480, 159407, 20204, '<td valign="top">For this shot to work, I think you need a bigger lens.  The bird occupies such a small part of the image overall that its intricate detail is lost amongst the busy backdrop of the woods.  You may also be able to imrpove this kind of shot by shooting with a wider aperture.  Something like f/2 or f/4 on a telephoto would have a good chance of throwing that background completely out of focus and leaving a nice bokeh in its place.</td>', 'For this shot to work, I think you need a bigger lens.  The bird occupies such a small part of the image overall that its intricate detail is lost amongst the busy backdrop of the woods.  You may also be able to imrpove this kind of shot by shooting with a wider aperture.  Something like f/2 or f/4 on a telephoto would have a good chance of throwing that background completely out of focus and leaving a nice bokeh in its place.', '2005-04-19 09:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303483, 167271, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not a bad capture but this picture is lacking severly in quality, mainly sharpness and frankly it looks a bit out of focus.  There is also too much noise in the bottle itself for my taste.  If the image quality had been good I would have rated it a 6 or 7 even.</td>', 'Not a bad capture but this picture is lacking severly in quality, mainly sharpness and frankly it looks a bit out of focus.  There is also too much noise in the bottle itself for my taste.  If the image quality had been good I would have rated it a 6 or 7 even.', '2005-04-19 09:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303485, 165490, 19005, '<td valign="top">Amazing!  Very beautiful scene.</td>', 'Amazing!  Very beautiful scene.', '2005-04-19 09:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303488, 167614, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, lighting and sharpness.  Well done!</td>', 'Nice composition, lighting and sharpness.  Well done!', '2005-04-19 09:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303490, 168184, 17033, '<td valign="top">Looks like we''ve both been Island hopping this last month...only you''ve got some trees and  decent weather! Very lush and verdant yet eerie all the same. The path leads the eye although the joining path on the left distracts a little. Pinch of Neatimage?-it adds to the atmosphere well.  Excellent.</td>', 'Looks like we''ve both been Island hopping this last month...only you''ve got some trees and  decent weather! Very lush and verdant yet eerie all the same. The path leads the eye although the joining path on the left distracts a little. Pinch of Neatimage?-it adds to the atmosphere well.  Excellent.', '2005-04-19 09:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303496, 165380, 17033, '<td valign="top">Wow....this looks like the archetypal African savannah shot but you''ve done a fantastic job of capturing it so well.</td>', 'Wow....this looks like the archetypal African savannah shot but you''ve done a fantastic job of capturing it so well.', '2005-04-19 09:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303499, 161121, 24065, '<td valign="top">Refreshingly beautiful!  It certainly stands out in a pack of rather mundane photos! 10</td>', 'Refreshingly beautiful!  It certainly stands out in a pack of rather mundane photos! 10', '2005-04-19 09:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303504, 168289, 5664, '<td valign="top">To red skin tone, but nice portrait .. ir</td>', 'To red skin tone, but nice portrait .. ir', '2005-04-19 09:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303511, 167164, 23394, '<td valign="top">what a wild composition.  is that hair for real?  that is definitely a most unique pose.  good luck!</td>', 'what a wild composition.  is that hair for real?  that is definitely a most unique pose.  good luck!', '2005-04-19 09:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303513, 167241, 8860, '<td valign="top">You are leaning on your scene to deliver the interest in this shot and brought little to it photographically. You could have shot through the railings, close to the water, but instead you''ve shot it at eye level which removes any dynamism from the comp.<br/> <br/>It''s quite overexposed too, so I''d recommend a polarizer for this kind of shot.</td>', 'You are leaning on your scene to deliver the interest in this shot and brought little to it photographically. You could have shot through the railings, close to the water, but instead you''ve shot it at eye level which removes any dynamism from the comp. It''s quite overexposed too, so I''d recommend a polarizer for this kind of shot.', '2005-04-19 09:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303516, 168270, 23394, '<td valign="top">i like your idea, but am not to keen on the way you have it framed.  i also think that given the colors and the lighting, you might have a stronger image if you really pushed the contrast and the saturization to make a strong silhouette.  all the same, nice image, good luck!</td>', 'i like your idea, but am not to keen on the way you have it framed.  i also think that given the colors and the lighting, you might have a stronger image if you really pushed the contrast and the saturization to make a strong silhouette.  all the same, nice image, good luck!', '2005-04-19 09:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303517, 166009, 6668, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of him on the prowl.</td>', 'Very nice capture of him on the prowl.', '2005-04-19 09:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303520, 162916, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is a tough subject, especially considering that it is a magnet for cameras.  your horizon is a bit tilted, which throws the image off a bit.  the foreground looks like it may have some interesting elements, but it''s hard to say from the perspective that you''ve shot.</td>', 'this is a tough subject, especially considering that it is a magnet for cameras.  your horizon is a bit tilted, which throws the image off a bit.  the foreground looks like it may have some interesting elements, but it''s hard to say from the perspective that you''ve shot.', '2005-04-19 10:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303521, 165049, 23394, '<td valign="top">i''m sure there''s a story here...this is definitely one of those images where you want to keep looking for clues.  good luck!</td>', 'i''m sure there''s a story here...this is definitely one of those images where you want to keep looking for clues.  good luck!', '2005-04-19 10:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303523, 167626, 6668, '<td valign="top">I don''t care much for the composition of this shot, I would like to see less of the trees and more of the waterfall.</td>', 'I don''t care much for the composition of this shot, I would like to see less of the trees and more of the waterfall.', '2005-04-19 10:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303525, 163808, 8860, '<td valign="top">Sky is a bit overcooked and ''alien'' here, but it''s a good photo with some clearly excellent light. I''m not sure what else you have brought to the shot though apart from presenting the scene in front of you. <br/> <br/>If you had crouched down really low, the horses would have punctuated the horizon line and you could have added dynamics with some grass blades and a massive DOF.</td>', 'Sky is a bit overcooked and ''alien'' here, but it''s a good photo with some clearly excellent light. I''m not sure what else you have brought to the shot though apart from presenting the scene in front of you.  If you had crouched down really low, the horses would have punctuated the horizon line and you could have added dynamics with some grass blades and a massive DOF.', '2005-04-19 10:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303526, 161165, 23394, '<td valign="top">while i love the colors here, there''s something about the composition that seems a bit off.  i''m immediately attracted to the tree, but find myself bouncing back and forth between the tree and the cow, and unfortunately, neither has enough detail to really hold me.</td>', 'while i love the colors here, there''s something about the composition that seems a bit off.  i''m immediately attracted to the tree, but find myself bouncing back and forth between the tree and the cow, and unfortunately, neither has enough detail to really hold me.', '2005-04-19 10:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
