(1303578, 168053, 6008, '<td valign="top">Looks a little windy but certainly it looks like a place worth visiting. I like the slight curve in the beach, which is mimicked in part by the palm. Composition is good, and those puffy clouds always makes things better. Certainly postcard material.</td>', 'Looks a little windy but certainly it looks like a place worth visiting. I like the slight curve in the beach, which is mimicked in part by the palm. Composition is good, and those puffy clouds always makes things better. Certainly postcard material.', '2005-04-19 10:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
