(1303585, 167849, 23394, '<td valign="top">i though librodo was moving on to something else?  well, if this isn''t librodo, i think we have a <i>new</i> librodo amongst us!  great work!</td>', 'i though librodo was moving on to something else?  well, if this isn''t librodo, i think we have a new librodo amongst us!  great work!', '2005-04-19 10:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
