(1303589, 160707, 6008, '<td valign="top">This is a very serene image and I can certainly see the relation with your title. The reflections do look more like creases in a soft fabric than ripples in the water. I cant tell if you greyscaled the duck or just reduced saturation but the subtle color works well. I like how the pattern around the duck''s eye compliments the reflections in the water. I like it!</td>', 'This is a very serene image and I can certainly see the relation with your title. The reflections do look more like creases in a soft fabric than ripples in the water. I cant tell if you greyscaled the duck or just reduced saturation but the subtle color works well. I like how the pattern around the duck''s eye compliments the reflections in the water. I like it!', '2005-04-19 10:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303594, 161121, 27482, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, could have been even better if it had more raindrops but that´s just nitpicking, gave it an 8.</td>', 'Awesome shot, could have been even better if it had more raindrops but that´s just nitpicking, gave it an 8.', '2005-04-19 10:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
