(1303754, 164724, 24065, '<td valign="top">The colors are lovely, as is the model, and I love the backlighting of her hair.  I''m afraid the extreme soft focus may hurt the final score, but since I''ve never ribboned I''m certainly no expert! LOL!  I think if you''d kept the focus sharp on her features it would have helped.</td>', 'The colors are lovely, as is the model, and I love the backlighting of her hair.  I''m afraid the extreme soft focus may hurt the final score, but since I''ve never ribboned I''m certainly no expert! LOL!  I think if you''d kept the focus sharp on her features it would have helped.', '2005-04-19 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
