(1303821, 167489, 27482, '<td valign="top">Awesome detail on the waterdrops and the petals of the flower but it´s a bit unevenly lit for my taste.  A reflector or a fill flash for the stem itself would have improved this shot in my humble opinion but don´t get me wrong, I love this shot and could not do better myself.  8</td>', 'Awesome detail on the waterdrops and the petals of the flower but it´s a bit unevenly lit for my taste.  A reflector or a fill flash for the stem itself would have improved this shot in my humble opinion but don´t get me wrong, I love this shot and could not do better myself.  8', '2005-04-19 11:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303823, 167525, 24454, '<td valign="top">Gasp!   Man, I love these striking infrared pictures!!!   This is just beautiful!!!</td>', 'Gasp!   Man, I love these striking infrared pictures!!!   This is just beautiful!!!', '2005-04-19 11:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
