(1303901, 168292, 6900, '<td valign="top">I can''t vote on members anymore, but that''s unfortunate for you cuz this is a 10.  My favorite pic I''ve seen in a long long time and definitely going in my favorites right now.</td>', 'I can''t vote on members anymore, but that''s unfortunate for you cuz this is a 10.  My favorite pic I''ve seen in a long long time and definitely going in my favorites right now.', '2005-04-19 12:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303902, 167955, 12448, '<td valign="top">I''d have sworn I saw this shot in the Pet Portrait challenge but I guess not.  A cut shot, very cute, the expression, the set up.  But its seems off balance, slightly crooked and lacks contrast, the lighting seems a bit dull.  A 5</td>', 'I''d have sworn I saw this shot in the Pet Portrait challenge but I guess not.  A cut shot, very cute, the expression, the set up.  But its seems off balance, slightly crooked and lacks contrast, the lighting seems a bit dull.  A 5', '2005-04-19 12:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
