(1303906, 168169, 7786, '<td valign="top">wow! Amazing patterns and colors. 9</td>', 'wow! Amazing patterns and colors. 9', '2005-04-19 12:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303907, 160067, 12448, '<td valign="top">Rut Roh!  Don''t tick off that Cardinal fan, LOL! :)<br/> <br/>Very cute, nice shot but the branch cutting through the top feathers is very distracting but sadly, even though this was an advanced challenge, the entire removal of said branch might be considered a major element.  I like the composition and set up otherwise though a slightly tighter cropping on the bottom to take out all those distracting colors there might really pull the viewer to the bird.  A 6</td>', 'Rut Roh!  Don''t tick off that Cardinal fan, LOL! :) Very cute, nice shot but the branch cutting through the top feathers is very distracting but sadly, even though this was an advanced challenge, the entire removal of said branch might be considered a major element.  I like the composition and set up otherwise though a slightly tighter cropping on the bottom to take out all those distracting colors there might really pull the viewer to the bird.  A 6', '2005-04-19 12:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303914, 168265, 12448, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  Glad I''m not looking at this while drunk!  LOL!<br/> <br/>Great visual, the way the stairs take you through the whole shot, too bad about the people though, they end up being a distraction for me.  And your feet at the bottom of the frame?  But otherwise, love this shot.  An 8</td>', 'Whoa!  Glad I''m not looking at this while drunk!  LOL! Great visual, the way the stairs take you through the whole shot, too bad about the people though, they end up being a distraction for me.  And your feet at the bottom of the frame?  But otherwise, love this shot.  An 8', '2005-04-19 12:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303916, 165380, 7786, '<td valign="top">very nice! Good colors. The sun would have been better a bit further from the tree.</td>', 'very nice! Good colors. The sun would have been better a bit further from the tree.', '2005-04-19 12:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303929, 168007, 12448, '<td valign="top">Rather Creepy actually!  While a great idea, having the two hands joined at the wrist with different wines, there are just a few things that really end up being a distraction to me.  One is the bump on the bottom of the wrists slightly to the right.  Second is the hair on the wrist/arm area.  If it was more uniform on the inside wrist it might not be so distracting to me personally or better yet, a woman''s hand might have made a big difference here.  WIth the polished nails and such.  The hands here look almost to big or manly for the delicate glasses.  The lighting is okay, the refelctions in the glasses are a bit distracting overall but otherwise a very unique idea and good for you for trying something different.  A 7 for overall effort and shot :)</td>', 'Rather Creepy actually!  While a great idea, having the two hands joined at the wrist with different wines, there are just a few things that really end up being a distraction to me.  One is the bump on the bottom of the wrists slightly to the right.  Second is the hair on the wrist/arm area.  If it was more uniform on the inside wrist it might not be so distracting to me personally or better yet, a woman''s hand might have made a big difference here.  WIth the polished nails and such.  The hands here look almost to big or manly for the delicate glasses.  The lighting is okay, the refelctions in the glasses are a bit distracting overall but otherwise a very unique idea and good for you for trying something different.  A 7 for overall effort and shot :)', '2005-04-19 12:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303930, 167968, 22689, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors !</td>', 'Beautiful colors !', '2005-04-19 12:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303936, 163935, 29797, '<td valign="top">Wow!!! Just a small bump on the contrast would make this image pop right out at you even more so. Superb detail and capture!</td>', 'Wow!!! Just a small bump on the contrast would make this image pop right out at you even more so. Superb detail and capture!', '2005-04-19 12:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303940, 168063, 7786, '<td valign="top">hehe, its kittens. Good picture though</td>', 'hehe, its kittens. Good picture though', '2005-04-19 12:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303941, 168298, 22689, '<td valign="top">Interesting but too many drops are out of focus.</td>', 'Interesting but too many drops are out of focus.', '2005-04-19 12:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303947, 162974, 2764, '<td valign="top">Everyone has their pet peeve - mine is tilted pictures - i wish this didnt lean slightly to the right - Otherwise I like it.  I like the washed out look of March - I like the colors of not-quite-spring.  I like the way he matched the door, and that all the shapes are rectangles except fot the dog.</td>', 'Everyone has their pet peeve - mine is tilted pictures - i wish this didnt lean slightly to the right - Otherwise I like it.  I like the washed out look of March - I like the colors of not-quite-spring.  I like the way he matched the door, and that all the shapes are rectangles except fot the dog.', '2005-04-19 12:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303951, 161419, 6668, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2005-04-19 12:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303952, 167100, 2764, '<td valign="top">Aww - I have been taking pictures of duclings all spring and I have ye to get a good one - they move too much - this is just right and perfectly sharp.  I am jealous.</td>', 'Aww - I have been taking pictures of duclings all spring and I have ye to get a good one - they move too much - this is just right and perfectly sharp.  I am jealous.', '2005-04-19 12:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
