(1303979, 163628, 34763, '<td valign="top">A beautiful scene, silky falls and a great peek of the sun through the trees. Great work at bringing out the green color in the grass under the low lighting. Super!</td>', 'A beautiful scene, silky falls and a great peek of the sun through the trees. Great work at bringing out the green color in the grass under the low lighting. Super!', '2005-04-19 12:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
