(1304056, 168169, 17033, '<td valign="top">Stunning...but maybe more so if you had removed more foreground or cropped to include only the central ''avenue''. Well done, regardless.</td>', 'Stunning...but maybe more so if you had removed more foreground or cropped to include only the central ''avenue''. Well done, regardless.', '2005-04-19 13:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304059, 165589, 2764, '<td valign="top">Im not sure if I like your composition.  Are there too many distracting elements? if the background contributed and Idea of where you wanted to enter it would make more sense.  Also the black and whit conversion has left the sign gray and the tree (and brick post) with more contrast and therefore it draws more attention.  Is that what you intended?  are you down playing the sign in favor of the neighborhood</td>', 'Im not sure if I like your composition.  Are there too many distracting elements? if the background contributed and Idea of where you wanted to enter it would make more sense.  Also the black and whit conversion has left the sign gray and the tree (and brick post) with more contrast and therefore it draws more attention.  Is that what you intended?  are you down playing the sign in favor of the neighborhood', '2005-04-19 13:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304063, 164092, 2764, '<td valign="top">What a great portrait!  I almost know the guy.  Also I LOVE your color conversion and Hope there are detailed instructions to follow.  The closer boy is hard to identify as a human and he obscures the kid with the glasses. 9</td>', 'What a great portrait!  I almost know the guy.  Also I LOVE your color conversion and Hope there are detailed instructions to follow.  The closer boy is hard to identify as a human and he obscures the kid with the glasses. 9', '2005-04-19 13:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
