(1304294, 159459, 8522, '<td valign="top">Legs in background are very distracting. Selective desat seems a little tacky here. Groom''s expression isn''t too flattering.</td>', 'Legs in background are very distracting. Selective desat seems a little tacky here. Groom''s expression isn''t too flattering.', '2005-04-19 14:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304295, 166988, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a beauty!   There is such life and sparkle in her eyes.   You captured her so expertly!</td>', 'What a beauty!   There is such life and sparkle in her eyes.   You captured her so expertly!', '2005-04-19 14:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304296, 159459, 16829, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed shot. The back lighting is tough, but it looks like oversharpening made matters worse with aberrations along the edge o the man''s face and trouser leg.</td>', 'Nicely composed shot. The back lighting is tough, but it looks like oversharpening made matters worse with aberrations along the edge o the man''s face and trouser leg.', '2005-04-19 14:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304297, 161508, 8522, '<td valign="top">Stunning and unusual.</td>', 'Stunning and unusual.', '2005-04-19 14:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304299, 163981, 30222, '<td valign="top">a very fine composition</td>', 'a very fine composition', '2005-04-19 14:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304300, 166454, 8522, '<td valign="top">Effective pose and lighting, but the expression lets this down.</td>', 'Effective pose and lighting, but the expression lets this down.', '2005-04-19 14:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304301, 167100, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwwww.    GREAT animal portrait  :)   I love it!</td>', 'Awwwwww.    GREAT animal portrait  :)   I love it!', '2005-04-19 14:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304303, 167971, 22689, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand well what you''re trying to show us.</td>', 'I don''t understand well what you''re trying to show us.', '2005-04-19 14:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304308, 167074, 35804, '<td valign="top">Seems more contemplative...maybe if she were facing the camera with here entire body or looked at the camera  the "confidence" would come through more? She seems lost in her own thoughts.</td>', 'Seems more contemplative...maybe if she were facing the camera with here entire body or looked at the camera  the "confidence" would come through more? She seems lost in her own thoughts.', '2005-04-19 14:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304314, 162694, 8522, '<td valign="top">Photo looks overprocessed, as if bringing out shadows has been overdone in PS CS. Compositionally, the edge of the rock cuts the girl''s face in half which is not effective. The heel of the foot at the bottom of the frame gives the impression that the feet are missing my accident and not design. She needs to be more on the left of the frame, to give space in which to look into.</td>', 'Photo looks overprocessed, as if bringing out shadows has been overdone in PS CS. Compositionally, the edge of the rock cuts the girl''s face in half which is not effective. The heel of the foot at the bottom of the frame gives the impression that the feet are missing my accident and not design. She needs to be more on the left of the frame, to give space in which to look into.', '2005-04-19 14:19:40.000000', NULL, 1);
