(1304546, 168288, 23394, '<td valign="top">i love this.  this is the type of image i love to just sit back and soak in.  thanks for sharing.<br/> <br/>the one thing i wrestle with in images like this, is how much clean up do you do.  while the stuff floating on the right preserves the ''integrity'' of what you captured, don''t you sometimes feel that the image would be more enjoyable if that stuff was cleaned up?  i guess it really comes down to what you want from an image.  i can appreciate it either way.</td>', 'i love this.  this is the type of image i love to just sit back and soak in.  thanks for sharing. the one thing i wrestle with in images like this, is how much clean up do you do.  while the stuff floating on the right preserves the ''integrity'' of what you captured, don''t you sometimes feel that the image would be more enjoyable if that stuff was cleaned up?  i guess it really comes down to what you want from an image.  i can appreciate it either way.', '2005-04-19 15:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
