(1304642, 166214, 8860, '<td valign="top">Excellent viewpoint (looked like an oyster at thumb level) - very unusual. Composition is not quite there for me though. I''d like to see perfect symmetry or total offset, but this is between the two. A slightly deeper DOF would have rounded it off nicely getting the tip of the stamen in focus too. The grain is OK for me.</td>', 'Excellent viewpoint (looked like an oyster at thumb level) - very unusual. Composition is not quite there for me though. I''d like to see perfect symmetry or total offset, but this is between the two. A slightly deeper DOF would have rounded it off nicely getting the tip of the stamen in focus too. The grain is OK for me.', '2005-04-19 15:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
