(1305222, 168306, 33947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky, but it''s pretty dark where the horses are...I can only make out the tops of them. A shot from 15 minutes earlier might have been much better. Still, I like your idea.</td>', 'Beautiful sky, but it''s pretty dark where the horses are...I can only make out the tops of them. A shot from 15 minutes earlier might have been much better. Still, I like your idea.', '2005-04-19 19:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1305227, 168330, 33947, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautiful color and interesting composition. The stain on the front wall adds a lot to the picture, I''m glad you left it in.</td>', 'Wow, beautiful color and interesting composition. The stain on the front wall adds a lot to the picture, I''m glad you left it in.', '2005-04-19 19:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
