(1305294, 166338, 14476, '<td valign="top">fabulous view of Lake Titicaca.  Great weather patterns.  Blue colors in the water are pretty bright, but could be that way at that altitude...  Wonder if that''s Peru or Bolivia in the backgound.  I''ll look for this one at the end of the Challenge and hope to find out then..</td>', 'fabulous view of Lake Titicaca.  Great weather patterns.  Blue colors in the water are pretty bright, but could be that way at that altitude...  Wonder if that''s Peru or Bolivia in the backgound.  I''ll look for this one at the end of the Challenge and hope to find out then..', '2005-04-19 19:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
