(1305315, 161826, 14476, '<td valign="top">Terrific idea.  Would love to have seen that girl running into the frame instead of out if it.  Still, good one.</td>', 'Terrific idea.  Would love to have seen that girl running into the frame instead of out if it.  Still, good one.', '2005-04-19 19:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
