(1305992, 164671, 30760, '<td valign="top">Elegance at its best! I hope you don''t get deducted for partial nudity, this is both tasteful and beautiful. How she melts into the background and the cloth on the other side is very nice, and the composition is great - particularily the line that goes up on the left side of her back to her arm. Her expression is perfect too. Four points for a great capture, and three for the post processing. Three to the model :) Ten.<br/> <br/>The only thing I''d deduct for is that the "soft focus" removes some needed sharpness in her face, but I won''t. The overall is still a ten for me.</td>', 'Elegance at its best! I hope you don''t get deducted for partial nudity, this is both tasteful and beautiful. How she melts into the background and the cloth on the other side is very nice, and the composition is great - particularily the line that goes up on the left side of her back to her arm. Her expression is perfect too. Four points for a great capture, and three for the post processing. Three to the model :) Ten. The only thing I''d deduct for is that the "soft focus" removes some needed sharpness in her face, but I won''t. The overall is still a ten for me.', '2005-04-19 22:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
