(1306287, 168256, 33560, '<td valign="top">For what it is, it is probably just about ideally realized.  Technically it seems just about flawless.But the composition feels cluttered to me, and off balance.  The tension in the photo comes from the relationship between the young woman and the dog.   I wonder if there is a crop which draws our attention to this a little better?</td>', 'For what it is, it is probably just about ideally realized.  Technically it seems just about flawless.But the composition feels cluttered to me, and off balance.  The tension in the photo comes from the relationship between the young woman and the dog.   I wonder if there is a crop which draws our attention to this a little better?', '2005-04-19 23:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306301, 167444, 33560, '<td valign="top">Superb.  I thought I had finally grown tired of sunsets, that I''d never score another sunset above four or five.  This blows that theory out of the water!   I love the colors, the reflections, the silhouettes, the people and actions, and the sails.</td>', 'Superb.  I thought I had finally grown tired of sunsets, that I''d never score another sunset above four or five.  This blows that theory out of the water!   I love the colors, the reflections, the silhouettes, the people and actions, and the sails.', '2005-04-19 23:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306302, 164855, 36006, '<td valign="top">nice illusion. good photoshop, or there really is a transparent screen.</td>', 'nice illusion. good photoshop, or there really is a transparent screen.', '2005-04-19 23:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306305, 166994, 5007, '<td valign="top">Very clever shot and well done!</td>', 'Very clever shot and well done!', '2005-04-19 23:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306309, 163212, 36006, '<td valign="top">nice comp. nice texture. b&amp;w''s good.nice color. good lighting. outstanding.</td>', 'nice comp. nice texture. b&w''s good.nice color. good lighting. outstanding.', '2005-04-19 23:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306343, 168033, 33560, '<td valign="top">One of my(many minor) pet peeves at this site is the  photo of a horse standing around looking stupid.  It works well for photos of cows, because stasis and blankness is quintessential cow nature.  But horse nature - in our imaginaition - is horsesense and motion.  To capture the spirit of the horse, it must be in motion.  So when I saw this photo I had to wonder whether this is a kind of parody of photo of the horse standing around looking stupid or whether it was the real thing.  <br/> <br/>I keep trying to see something, anything, in this photo and all I see is two ears and a bunch of hair exquisitely lit and sharply in focus.  Everything else is impossible - might as well be out of focus.  Sorry, but the longer I look at this photo the less I see in it.</td>', 'One of my(many minor) pet peeves at this site is the  photo of a horse standing around looking stupid.  It works well for photos of cows, because stasis and blankness is quintessential cow nature.  But horse nature - in our imaginaition - is horsesense and motion.  To capture the spirit of the horse, it must be in motion.  So when I saw this photo I had to wonder whether this is a kind of parody of photo of the horse standing around looking stupid or whether it was the real thing.   I keep trying to see something, anything, in this photo and all I see is two ears and a bunch of hair exquisitely lit and sharply in focus.  Everything else is impossible - might as well be out of focus.  Sorry, but the longer I look at this photo the less I see in it.', '2005-04-19 23:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306344, 167444, 11756, '<td valign="top">Great shot, composition  and capturing of the moment</td>', 'Great shot, composition  and capturing of the moment', '2005-04-19 23:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306346, 160591, 11756, '<td valign="top">kinda blurry but what a capture of a wild bald eagle</td>', 'kinda blurry but what a capture of a wild bald eagle', '2005-04-19 23:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306348, 168212, 11756, '<td valign="top">out of focus somewhat</td>', 'out of focus somewhat', '2005-04-19 23:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
