(1306457, 168241, 20168, '<td valign="top">Great stop action on this gliding pelican.  I especially like the gradient blue, light to darker, bottom to top, giving the whole frame a sense of weightlessness.  Great entry.</td>', 'Great stop action on this gliding pelican.  I especially like the gradient blue, light to darker, bottom to top, giving the whole frame a sense of weightlessness.  Great entry.', '2005-04-20 00:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
