(1306813, 167120, 19672, '<td valign="top">A little blurry toward the bottom, but what a wonderful expression you''ve captured.  The detail and depth and the green of the eyes is fantastic.  This pulls and tugs on the cat lover in me.  The whiskers are magnificent.  In truth there are a few imperfections that should make me score this slightly lower (the upper right area is a touch distracting and the chest area is soft and it could use something to add some action and pose to the subject....but man the eyes are gorgeous. So I am going to give you a 10.  Although in truth it''s more a 9+<br/> <br/>Beautiful cat you''ve been blessed with...</td>', 'A little blurry toward the bottom, but what a wonderful expression you''ve captured.  The detail and depth and the green of the eyes is fantastic.  This pulls and tugs on the cat lover in me.  The whiskers are magnificent.  In truth there are a few imperfections that should make me score this slightly lower (the upper right area is a touch distracting and the chest area is soft and it could use something to add some action and pose to the subject....but man the eyes are gorgeous. So I am going to give you a 10.  Although in truth it''s more a 9+ Beautiful cat you''ve been blessed with...', '2005-04-20 01:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
