(1307629, 163935, 35044, '<td valign="top">Technically Perfect.  Truly stunning.  My only reason for giving 9, not 10, is because I am seeing it against another stunning bird shot, that I marginally prefer for compositional reasons (not to say that this is not great compositionally) and I want to distinguish between the pictures.  Purely personal preference.</td>', 'Technically Perfect.  Truly stunning.  My only reason for giving 9, not 10, is because I am seeing it against another stunning bird shot, that I marginally prefer for compositional reasons (not to say that this is not great compositionally) and I want to distinguish between the pictures.  Purely personal preference.', '2005-04-20 10:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1307633, 167120, 35044, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like cats.  But this is a great photo.  Those eyes! You have mastered the art of getting a photo looking great in 640 pixels. 9 - cannot bring myself to give a cat 10 ;)</td>', 'I don''t really like cats.  But this is a great photo.  Those eyes! You have mastered the art of getting a photo looking great in 640 pixels. 9 - cannot bring myself to give a cat 10 ;)', '2005-04-20 10:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
