(1307640, 165954, 35044, '<td valign="top">Love this photo - detail and composition are abstractly beautiful .  Guess that it may not hold enopugh interest for some to garner consistently high votes it deserves, but I really like it.</td>', 'Love this photo - detail and composition are abstractly beautiful .  Guess that it may not hold enopugh interest for some to garner consistently high votes it deserves, but I really like it.', '2005-04-20 10:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
