(1307731, 167555, 26756, '<td valign="top">I think you had a nice idea for a photo here, I like the foreground and the range of colors from the reds, to greens to the blues of the sky.  In my opinion though, it''s hurt by the time of day you chose to shoot this. The lighting is a bit harsh and flat. Looks like it was taken around mid-day.  I think if you shot this scene closer to sunset or sunrise, it would make a dramatic difference.</td>', 'I think you had a nice idea for a photo here, I like the foreground and the range of colors from the reds, to greens to the blues of the sky.  In my opinion though, it''s hurt by the time of day you chose to shoot this. The lighting is a bit harsh and flat. Looks like it was taken around mid-day.  I think if you shot this scene closer to sunset or sunrise, it would make a dramatic difference.', '2005-04-20 11:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
