(1308304, 167687, 93, '<td valign="top">Now this I like.. <br/>As much as I despise shooting landscapes, (and the fact that they are over-loved on DPC), I love to see one that is a little bit different, and this is one of those.  The line of clouds in the upper portion of the photo really makes it.</td>', 'Now this I like.. As much as I despise shooting landscapes, (and the fact that they are over-loved on DPC), I love to see one that is a little bit different, and this is one of those.  The line of clouds in the upper portion of the photo really makes it.', '2005-04-20 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308309, 161639, 35229, '<td valign="top">Very ghostly image. And it works. 7</td>', 'Very ghostly image. And it works. 7', '2005-04-20 15:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308313, 161633, 93, '<td valign="top">your processing is a little too evident for my tastes.. (and yes, I have photos in my portfolio that are exremely evidently over-processed.. so I''m not saying that you *shouldn''t* be doing it.. I just hate seeing it in challenges, personally).   Just a suggestion.. you might want to start learning how to layer mask.. it can really make a difference in getting rid of the halos that dodging/burning can cause (or other methods).   I don''t know of any tutorials off-hand, but do a search up for layer-masking or similar words on google, and start experimenting..  it''s fun!</td>', 'your processing is a little too evident for my tastes.. (and yes, I have photos in my portfolio that are exremely evidently over-processed.. so I''m not saying that you *shouldn''t* be doing it.. I just hate seeing it in challenges, personally).   Just a suggestion.. you might want to start learning how to layer mask.. it can really make a difference in getting rid of the halos that dodging/burning can cause (or other methods).   I don''t know of any tutorials off-hand, but do a search up for layer-masking or similar words on google, and start experimenting..  it''s fun!', '2005-04-20 15:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308315, 167230, 35229, '<td valign="top">Way to blurry.Would have been a great photo if it were in focus.</td>', 'Way to blurry.Would have been a great photo if it were in focus.', '2005-04-20 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308317, 160288, 24330, '<td valign="top">clone out straps</td>', 'clone out straps', '2005-04-20 15:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308323, 168063, 93, '<td valign="top">Your white balance and focus are really off here.  Your AF may have been tricked by the low lighting, or you were perhaps going hand-held with too slow a shutter speed?  It looks as though you were shooting with tungsten or flourescent lighting with white-balance set to daylight as well, but I can''t be sure, of course.   Too much of a yellow/orange cast.<br/>Cute, funny composition though.</td>', 'Your white balance and focus are really off here.  Your AF may have been tricked by the low lighting, or you were perhaps going hand-held with too slow a shutter speed?  It looks as though you were shooting with tungsten or flourescent lighting with white-balance set to daylight as well, but I can''t be sure, of course.   Too much of a yellow/orange cast.Cute, funny composition though.', '2005-04-20 15:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
