(1308329, 165581, 93, '<td valign="top">This is really great!  Great DOF work,  the floweres and toes are tack-sharp, the heel drops off just a touch, which really helps lead you down into the body and sweepeing back up. They cyan, while a *touch* overpowering, sells the flowers, and the composition is different, but strong.  Not just another flower shot.. which gives you high marks.</td>', 'This is really great!  Great DOF work,  the floweres and toes are tack-sharp, the heel drops off just a touch, which really helps lead you down into the body and sweepeing back up. They cyan, while a *touch* overpowering, sells the flowers, and the composition is different, but strong.  Not just another flower shot.. which gives you high marks.', '2005-04-20 15:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
