(1308349, 163048, 14476, '<td valign="top">If this was mine, (and I know it isn''t) I''d probably crop about the lower 1/3 out of this image.  The circle and flaring petals, etc. are quite exciting.  The bottom petal is a touch ''hot'' and perhaps doesn''t add much to the overall effect.</td>', 'If this was mine, (and I know it isn''t) I''d probably crop about the lower 1/3 out of this image.  The circle and flaring petals, etc. are quite exciting.  The bottom petal is a touch ''hot'' and perhaps doesn''t add much to the overall effect.', '2005-04-20 15:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308355, 167555, 14476, '<td valign="top">Great subject.  Tough to get those wildflowers to brighten up - even when you know they are brillliant, they sometimes don''t show up that way.  Might try boosting the hue/saturation a touch on just the field (advanced rules, you know).  Still, a lovely image.</td>', 'Great subject.  Tough to get those wildflowers to brighten up - even when you know they are brillliant, they sometimes don''t show up that way.  Might try boosting the hue/saturation a touch on just the field (advanced rules, you know).  Still, a lovely image.', '2005-04-20 15:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
