(1308399, 163212, 9295, '<td valign="top">I am not a member and therefore can''t vote, but I saw the thumbnail and took a closer look. This is an extraordinary photo. It''s going into my favorites right away. I love everything about it from the the lighting to the shadows to the negative space to the subdued colors. I do hope you make this available as a print and I can remember to order a copy if you do. Simply fantastic work.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I am not a member and therefore can''t vote, but I saw the thumbnail and took a closer look. This is an extraordinary photo. It''s going into my favorites right away. I love everything about it from the the lighting to the shadows to the negative space to the subdued colors. I do hope you make this available as a print and I can remember to order a copy if you do. Simply fantastic work.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2005-04-20 15:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
