(1309509, 166988, 23394, '<td valign="top">woo-hoo, you nailed this one!  excellent work.  the only thing i would suggest would be to zoom in a heal the veins in her eyes.  well, that, and the background to the right being a little distracting, but, all the same, what a killer image!  love the expression!  good luck!</td>', 'woo-hoo, you nailed this one!  excellent work.  the only thing i would suggest would be to zoom in a heal the veins in her eyes.  well, that, and the background to the right being a little distracting, but, all the same, what a killer image!  love the expression!  good luck!', '2005-04-20 22:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309515, 167782, 23394, '<td valign="top">love this.  expertly seen.  not a thing to do with an image like this but to sit back and enjoy it.  this is definitely one to ponder.  who''s coat is he holding?  where''s his wife?  in some ways, this seems to be a metaphor for taking off the layering melancholy of winter in anticipation of a new spring.<br/> <br/>thanks for sharing, good luck!</td>', 'love this.  expertly seen.  not a thing to do with an image like this but to sit back and enjoy it.  this is definitely one to ponder.  who''s coat is he holding?  where''s his wife?  in some ways, this seems to be a metaphor for taking off the layering melancholy of winter in anticipation of a new spring. thanks for sharing, good luck!', '2005-04-20 22:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309519, 168304, 23394, '<td valign="top">i guess they''d prefer GIMP ;-)<br/> <br/>interesting shot.  the blurriness adds to the anxiety the image conveys.  nice work.  good luck!</td>', 'i guess they''d prefer GIMP ;-) interesting shot.  the blurriness adds to the anxiety the image conveys.  nice work.  good luck!', '2005-04-20 22:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309522, 165875, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors.  the focus seems a little soft, and you''ve started to lose your highlights.  how''s that for a conumdrum?  higher tv <i>and</i> a tighter av...  good luck!</td>', 'beautiful colors.  the focus seems a little soft, and you''ve started to lose your highlights.  how''s that for a conumdrum?  higher tv and a tighter av...  good luck!', '2005-04-20 22:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309530, 166902, 23394, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful place to be.  simply incredible.  you have a nice image here, but it could stand to have a deeper dof.  also, the hazy backdrop of the mountains and clouds seems to weigh heavy on the image.  in a situation as this, you might consider shooting from a different perspective (either much higher or much, much lower) so that you can get the commanding detail without the distractions.  all the same, nice work, and good luck!</td>', 'what a beautiful place to be.  simply incredible.  you have a nice image here, but it could stand to have a deeper dof.  also, the hazy backdrop of the mountains and clouds seems to weigh heavy on the image.  in a situation as this, you might consider shooting from a different perspective (either much higher or much, much lower) so that you can get the commanding detail without the distractions.  all the same, nice work, and good luck!', '2005-04-20 22:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309534, 166567, 3306, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.</td>', 'Awesome shot.', '2005-04-20 22:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
