(1309579, 162927, 23394, '<td valign="top">so, ya like livin on the edge.  tell me, honestly, what type of score did you expect from this image?  don''t get me wrong...i absolutely LOVE it, it''s the type of image i like to shoot, and kinda in line with what i enter.  but, i only enter for myself, and really, really don''t care about the scores.  but, i also really wish more people would be willing to get out of the dpc comfort zones and explore imagery as this.  thanks for sharing--keep it up!  good luck!</td>', 'so, ya like livin on the edge.  tell me, honestly, what type of score did you expect from this image?  don''t get me wrong...i absolutely LOVE it, it''s the type of image i like to shoot, and kinda in line with what i enter.  but, i only enter for myself, and really, really don''t care about the scores.  but, i also really wish more people would be willing to get out of the dpc comfort zones and explore imagery as this.  thanks for sharing--keep it up!  good luck!', '2005-04-20 22:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
