(1310110, 166174, 24330, '<td valign="top">I dont know if everyone see''s the pics in the same order, but yours follows an absoloutly stunning pic of 3 hot air balloons, my first reaction to yours was to mark it down without thought, so dont be disappointed if others feel the same.<br/>Its a point I never considered, that your score depends on what the viewer saw before.Maybe thats why some of my pics bombed out so badly.<br/>Score 5, it was 3. sorry to rant</td>', 'I dont know if everyone see''s the pics in the same order, but yours follows an absoloutly stunning pic of 3 hot air balloons, my first reaction to yours was to mark it down without thought, so dont be disappointed if others feel the same.Its a point I never considered, that your score depends on what the viewer saw before.Maybe thats why some of my pics bombed out so badly.Score 5, it was 3. sorry to rant', '2005-04-21 02:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
