(1310227, 167592, 32602, '<td valign="top">Why do I like this? The colours, the warmth in the yellows and oranges against the grey. The proportions, the house takes up just the right amount of space, the roof slopes away to give a pleasant balance of sky. There is just enough information, a sprinke of snow on the ground, fog in the sky, wet roof,  and that joyous line of chairs. Well observed!</td>', 'Why do I like this? The colours, the warmth in the yellows and oranges against the grey. The proportions, the house takes up just the right amount of space, the roof slopes away to give a pleasant balance of sky. There is just enough information, a sprinke of snow on the ground, fog in the sky, wet roof,  and that joyous line of chairs. Well observed!', '2005-04-21 03:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310237, 168184, 30857, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite pictures of this challenge. Love the green saturation, the crispy look, and the little path that takes you by the hand through the picture. Thanks for sharing it with us :)</td>', 'This is one of my favorite pictures of this challenge. Love the green saturation, the crispy look, and the little path that takes you by the hand through the picture. Thanks for sharing it with us :)', '2005-04-21 04:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
