(1310361, 163376, 6999, '<td valign="top">This so clearly has the look of a hyper-active dodge tool that it''s bound to be just real. It has a really odd sensation of being tilted to the right a touch, although it''s an optical illusion, checking with the edges of a window - but it''s one that won''t go away, for me, and adds a weird dynamic to it: can''t work out what''s causing it.<br/> <br/>Beautiful shot, for sure.</td>', 'This so clearly has the look of a hyper-active dodge tool that it''s bound to be just real. It has a really odd sensation of being tilted to the right a touch, although it''s an optical illusion, checking with the edges of a window - but it''s one that won''t go away, for me, and adds a weird dynamic to it: can''t work out what''s causing it. Beautiful shot, for sure.', '2005-04-21 04:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
