(1310364, 163625, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice work. Personally, I think i''d have tried to get a touch more detail into the real figure - drifts a little close to the silhouette end of things around his upper body - to increase the effect of the contrast between him and his shadow. A nice study.</td>', 'Nice work. Personally, I think i''d have tried to get a touch more detail into the real figure - drifts a little close to the silhouette end of things around his upper body - to increase the effect of the contrast between him and his shadow. A nice study.', '2005-04-21 04:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310366, 167187, 24330, '<td valign="top">red tires?</td>', 'red tires?', '2005-04-21 04:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310367, 165619, 6999, '<td valign="top">Love the sense of surveillance photography here - those foreground leaves. the fframing is difficult - the obvious suggestion is to get the bird more strongly in frame, but if you cut off the more in-focus of the yellow grass elements image right, those foregound out-of-forus bits become simply a distraction: this way they have a point of origin, which makes them understandable and thus <i>not</i> a distraction (for all i can imagine the other comments). I wonder if you''ve got slightly too much blue on the thing''s head? Has a slight look of colour clipping, confusing the sense of texture there for me.</td>', 'Love the sense of surveillance photography here - those foreground leaves. the fframing is difficult - the obvious suggestion is to get the bird more strongly in frame, but if you cut off the more in-focus of the yellow grass elements image right, those foregound out-of-forus bits become simply a distraction: this way they have a point of origin, which makes them understandable and thus not a distraction (for all i can imagine the other comments). I wonder if you''ve got slightly too much blue on the thing''s head? Has a slight look of colour clipping, confusing the sense of texture there for me.', '2005-04-21 04:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310369, 159359, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fun image. I think I would have cropped in as closely on the left, to balance the edge of frame on the right (so lose a bit of the elbow, basically) to make it look more deliberate and even. Keeping the sand is understandable, but you''ve got all the information about ''beach'' in those reflections in the shades.</td>', 'Fun image. I think I would have cropped in as closely on the left, to balance the edge of frame on the right (so lose a bit of the elbow, basically) to make it look more deliberate and even. Keeping the sand is understandable, but you''ve got all the information about ''beach'' in those reflections in the shades.', '2005-04-21 05:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310370, 163429, 6999, '<td valign="top">Should be a contender, I would think. Obviously perfect. The only thing I could imagine preventing this doing ribbon, would be that it is just a bird shot: it perhaps lacks mood, if you understand me. But as a bird shot, it''s perfect.</td>', 'Should be a contender, I would think. Obviously perfect. The only thing I could imagine preventing this doing ribbon, would be that it is just a bird shot: it perhaps lacks mood, if you understand me. But as a bird shot, it''s perfect.', '2005-04-21 05:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310371, 166338, 24330, '<td valign="top">is this one image</td>', 'is this one image', '2005-04-21 05:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310372, 168265, 22459, '<td valign="top">Very nice I really like the symmetrical composition and the people on the stairs adds a lot of perspective to the overall image but  what appears to be the photographers legs should have been avoided.</td>', 'Very nice I really like the symmetrical composition and the people on the stairs adds a lot of perspective to the overall image but  what appears to be the photographers legs should have been avoided.', '2005-04-21 05:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310373, 167445, 22459, '<td valign="top">I like the effect you have given this image it certainly has lifted what otherwise would be a dull subject. The sky hasn''t come up to well on my monitor?</td>', 'I like the effect you have given this image it certainly has lifted what otherwise would be a dull subject. The sky hasn''t come up to well on my monitor?', '2005-04-21 05:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310374, 160041, 6999, '<td valign="top">Lovely work. To be hugely picky (but then the standard''s so high in this challenge) - the top of the clouds looks bizarre, like you''ve taken too much of the punch of light out of them to get that definition, and that removes some impact from the darkness of beneath the storm. The boat gets too lost in the surf-line, also - i think ti would help for it to be a little fuller in frame, certainly at the available resolution here, which restricts detail so much. I think i''d have tried to get closer and lower, to get more boat and still the tops of the clouds. As I said, hugely picky though, those points.</td>', 'Lovely work. To be hugely picky (but then the standard''s so high in this challenge) - the top of the clouds looks bizarre, like you''ve taken too much of the punch of light out of them to get that definition, and that removes some impact from the darkness of beneath the storm. The boat gets too lost in the surf-line, also - i think ti would help for it to be a little fuller in frame, certainly at the available resolution here, which restricts detail so much. I think i''d have tried to get closer and lower, to get more boat and still the tops of the clouds. As I said, hugely picky though, those points.', '2005-04-21 05:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310375, 167573, 6999, '<td valign="top">Another fine photograph. ther seems a lack of sharpness/focus around the horizon - well, that ship/whatever - perhaps a little close work with the clone tool could have tidied up the edges of it. Great balance of it and the little con-trail though. Good vision, and good shooting.</td>', 'Another fine photograph. ther seems a lack of sharpness/focus around the horizon - well, that ship/whatever - perhaps a little close work with the clone tool could have tidied up the edges of it. Great balance of it and the little con-trail though. Good vision, and good shooting.', '2005-04-21 05:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310378, 162322, 22459, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the girl is absolutely first class and her demeanour is captivating. The only slight nit pick in my view is that I would have preferred to see the rocky background a little lighter.</td>', 'The lighting on the girl is absolutely first class and her demeanour is captivating. The only slight nit pick in my view is that I would have preferred to see the rocky background a little lighter.', '2005-04-21 05:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310379, 167092, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like this. Great light, colours, exposure. For me, the feel of the sky might be atouch out of place with the hyper-sharp feel of the ground; I wonder if adding a little noise (something quite even, gaussian) might bring it into the same visual territory? Fine work.</td>', 'Like this. Great light, colours, exposure. For me, the feel of the sky might be atouch out of place with the hyper-sharp feel of the ground; I wonder if adding a little noise (something quite even, gaussian) might bring it into the same visual territory? Fine work.', '2005-04-21 05:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
