(1310440, 167555, 23394, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful place to be shooting.  compositionally, your image is fine.  there are some things that could make a difference, though.  the details in the image just aren''t that sharp.  also, the harsh, midday lighting doesn''t give it the same drama you''d find earlier or later in the day.  sometimes, you don''t have a choice:  you''re there now, and you won''t have a chance to get back to it at a different time.  but, when you do have a choice, try to get your shots when the lighting can do more than wash out the natural beauty that''s in front of you.  all the same, nice image.  good luck!</td>', 'what a beautiful place to be shooting.  compositionally, your image is fine.  there are some things that could make a difference, though.  the details in the image just aren''t that sharp.  also, the harsh, midday lighting doesn''t give it the same drama you''d find earlier or later in the day.  sometimes, you don''t have a choice:  you''re there now, and you won''t have a chance to get back to it at a different time.  but, when you do have a choice, try to get your shots when the lighting can do more than wash out the natural beauty that''s in front of you.  all the same, nice image.  good luck!', '2005-04-21 06:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
