(1310448, 167104, 23394, '<td valign="top">yee-ha!  love the capture, but not too keen on the composition.  the subject is a bit too far into the image.  a vertical or square crop would make it stronger.  it also appears that you could boost the contrast just a hair more to take some of the softness off the edges.  on the other hand, i love the treatment.  good luck!</td>', 'yee-ha!  love the capture, but not too keen on the composition.  the subject is a bit too far into the image.  a vertical or square crop would make it stronger.  it also appears that you could boost the contrast just a hair more to take some of the softness off the edges.  on the other hand, i love the treatment.  good luck!', '2005-04-21 07:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
