(1310457, 167307, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent work!  this is one of those shots that are so easy to take for granted, until you try to do it yourself.  the composition is fantastic and the capture is priceless.  i really hope this isn''t overlooked, and that others will take the time to appreciate this.  good luck!</td>', 'excellent work!  this is one of those shots that are so easy to take for granted, until you try to do it yourself.  the composition is fantastic and the capture is priceless.  i really hope this isn''t overlooked, and that others will take the time to appreciate this.  good luck!', '2005-04-21 07:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
