(1310465, 165515, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice composition, and fun colors.  the focus is a bit soft, giving this a bit of a hand-held field.  i think for a shot like this to really work, it either should be razor sharp, or the blurring should be accentuated to take advantage of the colors and lighting.  all the same, hope this does well for you.  good luck!</td>', 'nice composition, and fun colors.  the focus is a bit soft, giving this a bit of a hand-held field.  i think for a shot like this to really work, it either should be razor sharp, or the blurring should be accentuated to take advantage of the colors and lighting.  all the same, hope this does well for you.  good luck!', '2005-04-21 07:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310466, 168329, 11078, '<td valign="top">a very nice image great focus and colour nice work</td>', 'a very nice image great focus and colour nice work', '2005-04-21 07:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
