(1310535, 166988, 20204, '<td valign="top">There is something odd...  It seems like the eyes are slightly out of focus, or perhaps were moving at the time this image was shot  it may be the large reflectios in them as well - can''t tell without blowing it up.  I like the composition and lighting, and the natural expression is excellent.  But, in a portrait the eyes are everything.</td>', 'There is something odd...  It seems like the eyes are slightly out of focus, or perhaps were moving at the time this image was shot  it may be the large reflectios in them as well - can''t tell without blowing it up.  I like the composition and lighting, and the natural expression is excellent.  But, in a portrait the eyes are everything.', '2005-04-21 08:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310539, 168256, 20204, '<td valign="top">Highlights are blown on the dog''s chest and the girl''s face.  Probably nothing you could do without diffusers and assistants, but they are a distraction.  There''s also a bit too much contrast in the dog''s fur; detail is lost both in the highlights and shadows.</td>', 'Highlights are blown on the dog''s chest and the girl''s face.  Probably nothing you could do without diffusers and assistants, but they are a distraction.  There''s also a bit too much contrast in the dog''s fur; detail is lost both in the highlights and shadows.', '2005-04-21 08:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310543, 165739, 20204, '<td valign="top">This image seems to scream out for a sepia treatment.  Interesting composition.  I think I''d like to see a bit more contrast, but it''s a cool shot none the less.</td>', 'This image seems to scream out for a sepia treatment.  Interesting composition.  I think I''d like to see a bit more contrast, but it''s a cool shot none the less.', '2005-04-21 08:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310544, 162916, 20204, '<td valign="top">The whole image seems to be tilted clockwise.  Also seeme like it''s blurry, perhaps hend-held at a low shutter speed?</td>', 'The whole image seems to be tilted clockwise.  Also seeme like it''s blurry, perhaps hend-held at a low shutter speed?', '2005-04-21 08:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310545, 165380, 26464, '<td valign="top">amazing shot, the title can be taken the wrong way though ... 8<br/></td>', 'amazing shot, the title can be taken the wrong way though ... 8', '2005-04-21 08:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310546, 161112, 20204, '<td valign="top">Wow - if you panned that shot you''ve got some steady hands!  Cool composition, and definitely a great use of motin blur effect.</td>', 'Wow - if you panned that shot you''ve got some steady hands!  Cool composition, and definitely a great use of motin blur effect.', '2005-04-21 08:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310547, 168219, 20204, '<td valign="top">I bet you get some interesting comments on this one!  My only complaint is that the subject seems to be obstructed too much by the hairs.  At a minimum I''d want to see a sharp view of its head, but 50% of that head is clouded in shadow.</td>', 'I bet you get some interesting comments on this one!  My only complaint is that the subject seems to be obstructed too much by the hairs.  At a minimum I''d want to see a sharp view of its head, but 50% of that head is clouded in shadow.', '2005-04-21 08:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310548, 161407, 20204, '<td valign="top">Good overall exposure, depth of field, and saturation feels just right.  I think I''d prefer a composition that shows more profile of the birds while maintaining the rear view.</td>', 'Good overall exposure, depth of field, and saturation feels just right.  I think I''d prefer a composition that shows more profile of the birds while maintaining the rear view.', '2005-04-21 08:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310550, 164011, 20204, '<td valign="top">Seems like the saturation may have an over-boost, but a beautiful landscape.</td>', 'Seems like the saturation may have an over-boost, but a beautiful landscape.', '2005-04-21 08:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310551, 163269, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but I would like to see this a bit sharper.</td>', 'Nice composition, but I would like to see this a bit sharper.', '2005-04-21 08:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310552, 168320, 20204, '<td valign="top">I love the camera angle - it makes the shot.  Perfect lighting as well.  Very well executed.</td>', 'I love the camera angle - it makes the shot.  Perfect lighting as well.  Very well executed.', '2005-04-21 08:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310553, 165581, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure this shot works with the dirty heal.  Details, details :)</td>', 'I''m not sure this shot works with the dirty heal.  Details, details :)', '2005-04-21 08:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310554, 163981, 20204, '<td valign="top">Feels like you are dancing on the edge of blown highlights in this shot.  A ND filter would have helped.  I like the open skies and composition.</td>', 'Feels like you are dancing on the edge of blown highlights in this shot.  A ND filter would have helped.  I like the open skies and composition.', '2005-04-21 08:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310555, 163197, 20204, '<td valign="top">The butterfly is gorgeous, but you needed a bit more depth of field to keep the flower in focus (foreground).  The petals on it also seem to have blown highlights (frame right).  Still, a very cool documentary image I''d be happy to have in my portfolio.</td>', 'The butterfly is gorgeous, but you needed a bit more depth of field to keep the flower in focus (foreground).  The petals on it also seem to have blown highlights (frame right).  Still, a very cool documentary image I''d be happy to have in my portfolio.', '2005-04-21 08:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310556, 167929, 20204, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity, but the negative space isn''t working for me.  I think a slightly tighter crop would help, but still maintaining your concept.</td>', 'I love the simplicity, but the negative space isn''t working for me.  I think a slightly tighter crop would help, but still maintaining your concept.', '2005-04-21 08:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310557, 165380, 20204, '<td valign="top">If you could have moved to either separate the sun from the tree, or perhaps frame the sun in the tree''s crotch is would help.</td>', 'If you could have moved to either separate the sun from the tree, or perhaps frame the sun in the tree''s crotch is would help.', '2005-04-21 08:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310559, 164148, 20204, '<td valign="top">By giving even treatment to the sky and land, this image seems to have an identity crisis.  I think you would have a stronger subject if you had chosen to emphasize one or the other more significantly.</td>', 'By giving even treatment to the sky and land, this image seems to have an identity crisis.  I think you would have a stronger subject if you had chosen to emphasize one or the other more significantly.', '2005-04-21 08:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310561, 160330, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture - they''re so bizarre when they''re flying :-)</td>', 'Wonderful capture - they''re so bizarre when they''re flying :-)', '2005-04-21 08:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310562, 165688, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great rainbow!  I think I''d have preferred a slightly slower shuter to smooth out the water, but otherwise this is very well done with foreground and background elements.</td>', 'Great rainbow!  I think I''d have preferred a slightly slower shuter to smooth out the water, but otherwise this is very well done with foreground and background elements.', '2005-04-21 08:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310563, 167305, 20204, '<td valign="top">Perfect exposure, but I''m not diggin'' the streak in the water.  It just looks out of place.  If you were goign for that, I think it would work if you''d cropped for portrait, but in this context it just distracts from the skyline.</td>', 'Perfect exposure, but I''m not diggin'' the streak in the water.  It just looks out of place.  If you were goign for that, I think it would work if you''d cropped for portrait, but in this context it just distracts from the skyline.', '2005-04-21 08:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310564, 166392, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice composition; I think i would, for this site at least, have tried to work the sky into a more solid blue: this seems a bit washed out (as it probably was, in fact). It could simply be a matter of pulling the overall exposure down some in conversion/processing - there''s enough light in the contrails to cope with that for sure.</td>', 'Nice composition; I think i would, for this site at least, have tried to work the sky into a more solid blue: this seems a bit washed out (as it probably was, in fact). It could simply be a matter of pulling the overall exposure down some in conversion/processing - there''s enough light in the contrails to cope with that for sure.', '2005-04-21 08:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310565, 165599, 20204, '<td valign="top">A little busy composition, but beautiful subject.</td>', 'A little busy composition, but beautiful subject.', '2005-04-21 08:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310566, 166567, 20204, '<td valign="top">W O W!!!  When did Art Morris join DPC?  I have nothing constructive for you - this image is perfect in every conceivable way.  I''m jealous of this shot in a big way!!!</td>', 'W O W!!!  When did Art Morris join DPC?  I have nothing constructive for you - this image is perfect in every conceivable way.  I''m jealous of this shot in a big way!!!', '2005-04-21 08:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310567, 163808, 20204, '<td valign="top">Not sure if its a sharpening or depth of field problem, but the image feels a bit too soft to me, especially in the foreground.</td>', 'Not sure if its a sharpening or depth of field problem, but the image feels a bit too soft to me, especially in the foreground.', '2005-04-21 08:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310568, 167258, 20204, '<td valign="top">The toning on this shot has a greenish tint that feels strange to me.  The top-center has a distracting element as well that I''d suggest cropping out.</td>', 'The toning on this shot has a greenish tint that feels strange to me.  The top-center has a distracting element as well that I''d suggest cropping out.', '2005-04-21 08:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310569, 165987, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like the basis of this - bot sure about your placing of the horizon line, it would perhaps have more impact for being either higher or lower in frame; and of course you have problems with compression, particularly in the ksy areas - which could also happily have been toned down somewhat compared to the land. But as I said, that basic composition, the curving road, the dog, the whatever on the horizon, I like very much.</td>', 'I like the basis of this - bot sure about your placing of the horizon line, it would perhaps have more impact for being either higher or lower in frame; and of course you have problems with compression, particularly in the ksy areas - which could also happily have been toned down somewhat compared to the land. But as I said, that basic composition, the curving road, the dog, the whatever on the horizon, I like very much.', '2005-04-21 08:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310571, 164685, 20204, '<td valign="top">Softness / blurring on that leaf is distracting.</td>', 'Softness / blurring on that leaf is distracting.', '2005-04-21 08:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310572, 167424, 20204, '<td valign="top">This image feels like its out of focus, but the composition is great.</td>', 'This image feels like its out of focus, but the composition is great.', '2005-04-21 09:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310573, 161826, 6999, '<td valign="top">Solid, neat, strong composition. even that darkening of the sky is pretty well done. Good colours throughout. Just lacks an edge for me to take it into the world of wow.</td>', 'Solid, neat, strong composition. even that darkening of the sky is pretty well done. Good colours throughout. Just lacks an edge for me to take it into the world of wow.', '2005-04-21 09:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310574, 164817, 20204, '<td valign="top">Image is tilted.  I''d suggest not having your subject dead-center, and avoiding a 50/50 split with the sky and land.</td>', 'Image is tilted.  I''d suggest not having your subject dead-center, and avoiding a 50/50 split with the sky and land.', '2005-04-21 09:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310575, 167488, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Typically you want to leave cropping space in front of the direction your subject''s head is looking, rather than behind.  I would also like to see the depth of field reduced (larger aperture) so that the background buildings were less prominent, but still identifiable.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Typically you want to leave cropping space in front of the direction your subject''s head is looking, rather than behind.  I would also like to see the depth of field reduced (larger aperture) so that the background buildings were less prominent, but still identifiable.', '2005-04-21 09:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310576, 166431, 20204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.  Seems like some highlights blew on the middle right, but a great shot overall.</td>', 'Beautiful composition.  Seems like some highlights blew on the middle right, but a great shot overall.', '2005-04-21 09:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310580, 165005, 20204, '<td valign="top">With warmer lighting, this would be an amazing landscape.</td>', 'With warmer lighting, this would be an amazing landscape.', '2005-04-21 09:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310581, 166392, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''m just not seeing anything in this image that tells me about your creative style.  Seems like a plane went overhead and you snapped an image.</td>', 'I''m just not seeing anything in this image that tells me about your creative style.  Seems like a plane went overhead and you snapped an image.', '2005-04-21 09:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310584, 164724, 20204, '<td valign="top">This would be so beautiful if it weren''t so heavily post-processed.  It looks like a combination of gaussian blur and neat image with blown highlights.  If you could have taken this when the sun was lower, and used a subtle soft-focus or subtle gaussian blur it would feel more natural.  Also, a soft fill flash, maybe -2/3 compensation would remove the shadows from the eyes.</td>', 'This would be so beautiful if it weren''t so heavily post-processed.  It looks like a combination of gaussian blur and neat image with blown highlights.  If you could have taken this when the sun was lower, and used a subtle soft-focus or subtle gaussian blur it would feel more natural.  Also, a soft fill flash, maybe -2/3 compensation would remove the shadows from the eyes.', '2005-04-21 09:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310585, 166567, 6999, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what to make of this at all. The light seems terribly false (looking at reflections in eyes. A hell of an image though. No idea what score to give you.</td>', 'Don''t know what to make of this at all. The light seems terribly false (looking at reflections in eyes. A hell of an image though. No idea what score to give you.', '2005-04-21 09:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310588, 168333, 20204, '<td valign="top">Wow...  If you could pull off this kind of imagery about 10 more times you could put together a stunning modern twist to Henri Cartier Bresson''s style.  This is am absolutely brilliant shot, and the title is the icing on the cake.  Can''t wait to see who did this!</td>', 'Wow...  If you could pull off this kind of imagery about 10 more times you could put together a stunning modern twist to Henri Cartier Bresson''s style.  This is am absolutely brilliant shot, and the title is the icing on the cake.  Can''t wait to see who did this!', '2005-04-21 09:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310593, 162238, 20204, '<td valign="top">Image feels too soft overall.</td>', 'Image feels too soft overall.', '2005-04-21 09:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310594, 163935, 20204, '<td valign="top">Man, it seems like the bird photographers came out in full force in thie challenge.  You and the Turkey vulture shot seem tied for a ribbon in my book.  Amazing!  You''re insane if you don''t already have a print uploaded.</td>', 'Man, it seems like the bird photographers came out in full force in thie challenge.  You and the Turkey vulture shot seem tied for a ribbon in my book.  Amazing!  You''re insane if you don''t already have a print uploaded.', '2005-04-21 09:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
