(1310995, 168330, 35739, '<td valign="top">The only thing that bothers me, and I may be wrong, is the tree.  It takes away from this beautiful building. A little cropping at the bottom may be a idea.  To me the buiding is the centerpiece and not the stain on the wall and the tree.  My thoughts.</td>', 'The only thing that bothers me, and I may be wrong, is the tree.  It takes away from this beautiful building. A little cropping at the bottom may be a idea.  To me the buiding is the centerpiece and not the stain on the wall and the tree.  My thoughts.', '2005-04-21 13:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310996, 167069, 12962, '<td valign="top">Nice echoing ... just wish you didn''t cut the head in the background.  The # 30 button also distracts.  But the composition is beautiful and actually is difficult to achieve (the echoing of the main element).  Next time you do it, you might want to consider a plain backdrop.  But good job!</td>', 'Nice echoing ... just wish you didn''t cut the head in the background.  The # 30 button also distracts.  But the composition is beautiful and actually is difficult to achieve (the echoing of the main element).  Next time you do it, you might want to consider a plain backdrop.  But good job!', '2005-04-21 13:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
