(1311254, 164008, 31167, '<td valign="top">I really like the photo, but the title suggests something other than a modern looking ski lift..</td>', 'I really like the photo, but the title suggests something other than a modern looking ski lift..', '2005-04-21 16:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311260, 168151, 25787, '<td valign="top">Dandelion would be better further from the center of the picture.  Similarly, the stick, dividing the picture in half, takes away from the composition.</td>', 'Dandelion would be better further from the center of the picture.  Similarly, the stick, dividing the picture in half, takes away from the composition.', '2005-04-21 16:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311265, 167258, 25787, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped the top of the photo.  I find it distracting,  I like the "texture" of the water.</td>', 'I would have cropped the top of the photo.  I find it distracting,  I like the "texture" of the water.', '2005-04-21 16:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311315, 164213, 6999, '<td valign="top">Oh no! It''s that bloody rock! Run away! Run away!</td>', 'Oh no! It''s that bloody rock! Run away! Run away!', '2005-04-21 16:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311324, 166483, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''m never sure how to compose shots of circular things - this is as good as anything, I think.</td>', 'I''m never sure how to compose shots of circular things - this is as good as anything, I think.', '2005-04-21 16:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311335, 162964, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think scenes like this require, I think, that you find some compositional eleents to give it strength in that large foreground area - to emphasise the vastness of it, if you like. I like your having the good foreground detail, but not that it dashes out of frame so very quickly - I would perhaps have tried to organise that line so that it lead the eye more into frame than out of it. Also you have those whell tracks to use, but you''ve placed those in a very weak area of frame.</td>', 'I think scenes like this require, I think, that you find some compositional eleents to give it strength in that large foreground area - to emphasise the vastness of it, if you like. I like your having the good foreground detail, but not that it dashes out of frame so very quickly - I would perhaps have tried to organise that line so that it lead the eye more into frame than out of it. Also you have those whell tracks to use, but you''ve placed those in a very weak area of frame.', '2005-04-21 16:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311349, 167723, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, great detail, strong composition. That high-key backgroudn is well done - doesn''t seem to have the smack-you-in-the-teeth whiteness of some, which spares the eye a little.</td>', 'Nice shot, great detail, strong composition. That high-key backgroudn is well done - doesn''t seem to have the smack-you-in-the-teeth whiteness of some, which spares the eye a little.', '2005-04-21 17:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311350, 162542, 35098, '<td valign="top">Very awesome!</td>', 'Very awesome!', '2005-04-21 17:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311357, 168277, 6999, '<td valign="top">:-) First thought was that it''s a little overdone on the contrast, but actually it really suits this mad kind of image. All the detail is there, anyway. I see some noise in the ''sky'', which really des not suit such a scene - it''s no big thing, just something to add even more style, but it could so easily have been smoothed out - careful selection and blurring, or Neatimage (but used carefully!)</td>', ':-) First thought was that it''s a little overdone on the contrast, but actually it really suits this mad kind of image. All the detail is there, anyway. I see some noise in the ''sky'', which really des not suit such a scene - it''s no big thing, just something to add even more style, but it could so easily have been smoothed out - careful selection and blurring, or Neatimage (but used carefully!)', '2005-04-21 17:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311358, 168145, 35098, '<td valign="top">You think you''re sooooo cool......</td>', 'You think you''re sooooo cool......', '2005-04-21 17:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311365, 164855, 20066, '<td valign="top">Extra ordinary monitor I must say but perhaps you should have taken that picture outside or with more interesting things to see through the monitor</td>', 'Extra ordinary monitor I must say but perhaps you should have taken that picture outside or with more interesting things to see through the monitor', '2005-04-21 17:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311370, 162238, 20066, '<td valign="top">that bus is popular in this challenge or what?</td>', 'that bus is popular in this challenge or what?', '2005-04-21 17:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311371, 167305, 6999, '<td valign="top">San Diego, huh? (Not hard, seeing as there''s a bunch of shots like this floating round a thread right now). A neat shot, and I especially like that red line. the sensation of a slight tilt goes away after a moment, so I''ll presume that''s an optical illusion.</td>', 'San Diego, huh? (Not hard, seeing as there''s a bunch of shots like this floating round a thread right now). A neat shot, and I especially like that red line. the sensation of a slight tilt goes away after a moment, so I''ll presume that''s an optical illusion.', '2005-04-21 17:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311372, 167276, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nicely done . 9</td>', 'Nicely done . 9', '2005-04-21 17:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311381, 168336, 20066, '<td valign="top">I wonder if it was supposed to be out of focus.  Some out of focus pctures can be good in my opinion but I don''t get this one.</td>', 'I wonder if it was supposed to be out of focus.  Some out of focus pctures can be good in my opinion but I don''t get this one.', '2005-04-21 17:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311384, 161121, 20315, '<td valign="top">I love the color and composition of this photo. I scored it a 10 but then I was admiring it again and noticed in the left side of the frame there is some weird stuff going on with the rain and the umbrella. bummer.</td>', 'I love the color and composition of this photo. I scored it a 10 but then I was admiring it again and noticed in the left side of the frame there is some weird stuff going on with the rain and the umbrella. bummer.', '2005-04-21 17:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311389, 167444, 20066, '<td valign="top">This one is a good one and the best sunste photo I have seen in this challenge now.</td>', 'This one is a good one and the best sunste photo I have seen in this challenge now.', '2005-04-21 17:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311404, 167337, 25890, '<td valign="top">The type of landscape that appeals to me the most; multi-layered scene shot preferably from a relatively low angle/point of view with interesting foreground elements, dimensions of which are sometimes exagerrated by the use of wide-angle lens, and good DoF, which gives the image a 3-dimensional feel. I just wish that the middle layer (land between foreground rocks and the distant mountains) had more light/detail so that I could "travel" across the scene savoring every step instead of jumping from the rocks directly to the mountains. That''s to say that the picture somewhat falls short of its full potential, in my opinion. Good work nevertheless.</td>', 'The type of landscape that appeals to me the most; multi-layered scene shot preferably from a relatively low angle/point of view with interesting foreground elements, dimensions of which are sometimes exagerrated by the use of wide-angle lens, and good DoF, which gives the image a 3-dimensional feel. I just wish that the middle layer (land between foreground rocks and the distant mountains) had more light/detail so that I could "travel" across the scene savoring every step instead of jumping from the rocks directly to the mountains. That''s to say that the picture somewhat falls short of its full potential, in my opinion. Good work nevertheless.', '2005-04-21 17:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311424, 168280, 8139, '<td valign="top">expressive portrait. I like it.</td>', 'expressive portrait. I like it.', '2005-04-21 17:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311434, 166446, 36538, '<td valign="top">great photo</td>', 'great photo', '2005-04-21 17:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311438, 167993, 36538, '<td valign="top">Love the photo ..  !!</td>', 'Love the photo ..  !!', '2005-04-21 17:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311472, 168339, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very artistic and well composed.</td>', 'Very artistic and well composed.', '2005-04-21 17:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311477, 165071, 22734, '<td valign="top">Soaring to perfection. This capture is on the money.</td>', 'Soaring to perfection. This capture is on the money.', '2005-04-21 17:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311478, 166454, 22734, '<td valign="top">Semi naughty and very mildly enticing.</td>', 'Semi naughty and very mildly enticing.', '2005-04-21 17:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311480, 161122, 35739, '<td valign="top">Not sure but try cropping a little off the bottom and more off the top. Try it, it may present itself as a better photo.  Just a thought.  I like the colors.</td>', 'Not sure but try cropping a little off the bottom and more off the top. Try it, it may present itself as a better photo.  Just a thought.  I like the colors.', '2005-04-21 17:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311486, 162322, 22734, '<td valign="top">My only negative observation is the blown skin tones on the wrist of the right hand. Outside of this, this is a glorious image because the pink and skin tones are so aptly enshrined with the dark glorious background. The model is otherwise will light and her looks and expression speak of a gentle poise.</td>', 'My only negative observation is the blown skin tones on the wrist of the right hand. Outside of this, this is a glorious image because the pink and skin tones are so aptly enshrined with the dark glorious background. The model is otherwise will light and her looks and expression speak of a gentle poise.', '2005-04-21 17:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311490, 165107, 22734, '<td valign="top">A real beauty.</td>', 'A real beauty.', '2005-04-21 17:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311494, 162677, 22734, '<td valign="top">Cute, adorable and loving capture.</td>', 'Cute, adorable and loving capture.', '2005-04-21 17:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311497, 168272, 22734, '<td valign="top">Lovely everything in this image. The floral framing, the gentle ripples and the colors lend such a pleasing and soothing feeling.</td>', 'Lovely everything in this image. The floral framing, the gentle ripples and the colors lend such a pleasing and soothing feeling.', '2005-04-21 17:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311501, 167994, 22734, '<td valign="top">A real cute puff ball and very well captured.</td>', 'A real cute puff ball and very well captured.', '2005-04-21 18:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311508, 160934, 22734, '<td valign="top">Beautiful with delicate shadings.</td>', 'Beautiful with delicate shadings.', '2005-04-21 18:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311513, 163627, 22734, '<td valign="top">What a capture! Impressive.</td>', 'What a capture! Impressive.', '2005-04-21 18:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311522, 168259, 6999, '<td valign="top">Oh marvellous - we haven''t had one of these subdued masterpieces in a while - and this one''s special. It has a quality of Escher-like draughtsmanship to it: I don''t mean weirdness, obvisouly, but that pure facility he had with technique. One day i''ll take grown-up photographs like this.</td>', 'Oh marvellous - we haven''t had one of these subdued masterpieces in a while - and this one''s special. It has a quality of Escher-like draughtsmanship to it: I don''t mean weirdness, obvisouly, but that pure facility he had with technique. One day i''ll take grown-up photographs like this.', '2005-04-21 18:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311535, 168259, 12962, '<td valign="top">Right on!  Groovy, far out.  Ten, man!</td>', 'Right on!  Groovy, far out.  Ten, man!', '2005-04-21 18:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311552, 164237, 12962, '<td valign="top">Pity the sky is so washed out, this would have been sooo great, framed !</td>', 'Pity the sky is so washed out, this would have been sooo great, framed !', '2005-04-21 18:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311555, 166127, 12962, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but where are the colors?  Levels, curves and saturation would really punch those colors!</td>', 'Beautiful, but where are the colors?  Levels, curves and saturation would really punch those colors!', '2005-04-21 18:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311565, 159649, 24486, '<td valign="top">Excellant contrasts</td>', 'Excellant contrasts', '2005-04-21 18:38:34.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1311569, 166862, 6999, '<td valign="top">And poor use of the apostrophe seems pretty universal, too.</td>', 'And poor use of the apostrophe seems pretty universal, too.', '2005-04-21 18:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311570, 168336, 3102, '<td valign="top">Um... whoa...?</td>', 'Um... whoa...?', '2005-04-21 18:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311591, 168257, 12962, '<td valign="top">Good story, wonderful models, colors are great, but the focus is in the trees behind.</td>', 'Good story, wonderful models, colors are great, but the focus is in the trees behind.', '2005-04-21 18:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311593, 161121, 8860, '<td valign="top">I like your composition here, but the colours and contrast don''t quite do it for me. I think a tighter crop just below the logo on the umbrella would be more powerful though. <br/> <br/>Her expression is lovely but I''ll be honest, I don''t really know what this is supposed to do for me. It''s a nice portrait of a girl but I don''t really connect with her and I find myself viewing this more as a piece of stock art rather than a human study. If she was looking downwards I would feel more like an observer which, for me, I would prefer. I''m also not convinced by the ''rain'' which does look quite isolated to the left.<br/> <br/>It is however, a well taken shot bya proficient photographer.</td>', 'I like your composition here, but the colours and contrast don''t quite do it for me. I think a tighter crop just below the logo on the umbrella would be more powerful though.  Her expression is lovely but I''ll be honest, I don''t really know what this is supposed to do for me. It''s a nice portrait of a girl but I don''t really connect with her and I find myself viewing this more as a piece of stock art rather than a human study. If she was looking downwards I would feel more like an observer which, for me, I would prefer. I''m also not convinced by the ''rain'' which does look quite isolated to the left. It is however, a well taken shot bya proficient photographer.', '2005-04-21 18:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311596, 165599, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice textures and a beautiful wisteria. Comp is good if a little busy.</td>', 'Nice textures and a beautiful wisteria. Comp is good if a little busy.', '2005-04-21 18:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311597, 167993, 6999, '<td valign="top">Ah, familiar territory; I''ve stayed at the lodge/gatehouse/whatever it''s called. I love this place.</td>', 'Ah, familiar territory; I''ve stayed at the lodge/gatehouse/whatever it''s called. I love this place.', '2005-04-21 18:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311603, 164011, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and scene. I do think that the editing has spoiled this a little though - and I also think that, apart from the observation, it''s difficult to see what you have delivered here that someone else with the same camera couldn''t. I''d like to have seen more of a focal point or some foreground interest which would lift this out of the ordinary.</td>', 'Beautiful light and scene. I do think that the editing has spoiled this a little though - and I also think that, apart from the observation, it''s difficult to see what you have delivered here that someone else with the same camera couldn''t. I''d like to have seen more of a focal point or some foreground interest which would lift this out of the ordinary.', '2005-04-21 18:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311605, 161186, 8860, '<td valign="top">Striking portrait indeed. Sensitively processed and well composed (if a little too far left). Don''t like your title though, which is too flippant for your high quality photo.</td>', 'Striking portrait indeed. Sensitively processed and well composed (if a little too far left). Don''t like your title though, which is too flippant for your high quality photo.', '2005-04-21 18:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
