(1312344, 159559, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice image, great colors.  could stand to be a bit sharper, but i''m not complaining.  good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'nice image, great colors.  could stand to be a bit sharper, but i''m not complaining.  good luck in the challenge!', '2005-04-21 23:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312345, 163763, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice capture.  i love images that seem to have a story to tell, or at least lead my imagination that way.  it could stand to be a bit sharper, but i''m not complaining.  good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'nice capture.  i love images that seem to have a story to tell, or at least lead my imagination that way.  it could stand to be a bit sharper, but i''m not complaining.  good luck in the challenge!', '2005-04-21 23:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312346, 167727, 34481, '<td valign="top">The color of the eyes look too artificial to me.</td>', 'The color of the eyes look too artificial to me.', '2005-04-21 23:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312347, 166336, 23394, '<td valign="top">not really sure what to make of this.  the lighting and focus seem a bit uneven, which makes it hard to appreciate.</td>', 'not really sure what to make of this.  the lighting and focus seem a bit uneven, which makes it hard to appreciate.', '2005-04-21 23:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312349, 168050, 32792, '<td valign="top">Seems oversharpened. Some artifacts, like halos, can be seen on the edges. It might be because of the snow!</td>', 'Seems oversharpened. Some artifacts, like halos, can be seen on the edges. It might be because of the snow!', '2005-04-21 23:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312350, 168143, 23394, '<td valign="top">pretty wild image you''ve served up here...looks like somebody had a good time.  you might consider accentuating the tilt just a bit more--that really goes well with the ''what-the-hell-happened-after-i-left'' feeling that oozes through the image.  good luck!</td>', 'pretty wild image you''ve served up here...looks like somebody had a good time.  you might consider accentuating the tilt just a bit more--that really goes well with the ''what-the-hell-happened-after-i-left'' feeling that oozes through the image.  good luck!', '2005-04-21 23:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312351, 167727, 32792, '<td valign="top">Her eyes are extremelly beautiful. The only thing is that the rest of the image looks a bit dull, her skin for example, it looks like a rubber character, kinda fake!</td>', 'Her eyes are extremelly beautiful. The only thing is that the rest of the image looks a bit dull, her skin for example, it looks like a rubber character, kinda fake!', '2005-04-21 23:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312352, 168268, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice image, but it looks kinda lonely.  you might consider getting some companion shots and putting together a triptych.  good luck!</td>', 'nice image, but it looks kinda lonely.  you might consider getting some companion shots and putting together a triptych.  good luck!', '2005-04-21 23:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312355, 163982, 32792, '<td valign="top">It looks very good! The only thing I dislike is that it''s underexposed! Too dark. Not sure if it was intentional. Also a higher speed to freeze the water, or even give the "splash" look. I don''t know. I like it anyways!</td>', 'It looks very good! The only thing I dislike is that it''s underexposed! Too dark. Not sure if it was intentional. Also a higher speed to freeze the water, or even give the "splash" look. I don''t know. I like it anyways!', '2005-04-21 23:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312356, 168322, 23394, '<td valign="top">this has a very odd feel to it.  those yellows come across almost the way posters and prints from the 20''s do.  not that it''s bad, but not quite sure how it would be received by the voting masses.  very interesting processing, to say the least.  good luck!</td>', 'this has a very odd feel to it.  those yellows come across almost the way posters and prints from the 20''s do.  not that it''s bad, but not quite sure how it would be received by the voting masses.  very interesting processing, to say the least.  good luck!', '2005-04-21 23:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312357, 161508, 32792, '<td valign="top">Now this is awesome!</td>', 'Now this is awesome!', '2005-04-21 23:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312358, 167478, 23394, '<td valign="top">that''s a beautiful sky.  not quite sure if those branches offer the best foreground/framing for the image, though.  but, if this is where you are, you sure should enjoy exploring it.  have fun!  good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'that''s a beautiful sky.  not quite sure if those branches offer the best foreground/framing for the image, though.  but, if this is where you are, you sure should enjoy exploring it.  have fun!  good luck in the challenge!', '2005-04-21 23:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312361, 167868, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors, just a shame the image could be a bit sharper.  love the perspective.  good luck!</td>', 'beautiful colors, just a shame the image could be a bit sharper.  love the perspective.  good luck!', '2005-04-21 23:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312362, 159359, 32792, '<td valign="top">The reflection on the sunglass kinda distracts the eyes (damn it also atracts me LoL). Also the sand is overexposed.</td>', 'The reflection on the sunglass kinda distracts the eyes (damn it also atracts me LoL). Also the sand is overexposed.', '2005-04-21 23:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312364, 161809, 23394, '<td valign="top">i see what you were after, but feel the composition is a bit off.  there''s just not enough interesting detail to really get the eye moving off the subject and across the image.  love the color, textures, and backlighting on the leaves.  good luck!</td>', 'i see what you were after, but feel the composition is a bit off.  there''s just not enough interesting detail to really get the eye moving off the subject and across the image.  love the color, textures, and backlighting on the leaves.  good luck!', '2005-04-21 23:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312367, 167753, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors, nice image.  i think, though, if you are going to go with a tilted horizon, you should probably tilt it a bit more so that the tilt is truly a part of the dynamic of the image, as opposed to something that appears to be an overlooked detail.  just my opinion, though.  this is a nice image, and i hope it does well for you.  good luck!</td>', 'beautiful colors, nice image.  i think, though, if you are going to go with a tilted horizon, you should probably tilt it a bit more so that the tilt is truly a part of the dynamic of the image, as opposed to something that appears to be an overlooked detail.  just my opinion, though.  this is a nice image, and i hope it does well for you.  good luck!', '2005-04-21 23:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312384, 165431, 28299, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, so simple, elegant - 10</td>', 'Beautiful, so simple, elegant - 10', '2005-04-22 00:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312416, 168292, 28299, '<td valign="top">Delicate, beautifully blended colors - 8</td>', 'Delicate, beautifully blended colors - 8', '2005-04-22 00:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312417, 167452, 32792, '<td valign="top">Colors are really hot on this one! It looks a little over saturated, but it still looks good! 8</td>', 'Colors are really hot on this one! It looks a little over saturated, but it still looks good! 8', '2005-04-22 00:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312422, 168070, 28299, '<td valign="top">Where in the world do they make squirrels like this???? If I ever saw one like this in my front yard, I''d freak!</td>', 'Where in the world do they make squirrels like this???? If I ever saw one like this in my front yard, I''d freak!', '2005-04-22 00:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312430, 161374, 32792, '<td valign="top">OMG. I have a camera just like this! But it''s broken, won''t work!<br/>The flowers look a tad over exposed! But it''s good overall!</td>', 'OMG. I have a camera just like this! But it''s broken, won''t work!The flowers look a tad over exposed! But it''s good overall!', '2005-04-22 00:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
