(1312504, 168318, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like the dress but there doesn''t seem to be enough light on the subjects face. I appears a little out of focus. I also like the pose but I wish it wasn''t blocking the light.</td>', 'I like the dress but there doesn''t seem to be enough light on the subjects face. I appears a little out of focus. I also like the pose but I wish it wasn''t blocking the light.', '2005-04-22 01:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
