(1312843, 166742, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent composition, great colors.  i have a similar entry that is getting hammered for it''s shallow dof, but, for me, mine was intentional, as is probably yours.  i like it the way it is, and imagine that that if you wanted a deeper dof, you would have done so.  beautiful work, definitely something to be proud of, regardless of the score.  good luck!</td>', 'excellent composition, great colors.  i have a similar entry that is getting hammered for it''s shallow dof, but, for me, mine was intentional, as is probably yours.  i like it the way it is, and imagine that that if you wanted a deeper dof, you would have done so.  beautiful work, definitely something to be proud of, regardless of the score.  good luck!', '2005-04-22 09:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312845, 165739, 23394, '<td valign="top">wild image, nicely seen.  i can only imagine what you had to do to set this shot up, capture it, then process it.  hope your efforts are rewarded, but, even if the score isn''t what you hoped for, you definitely have something to be proud of.  thanks for sharing.  good luck!</td>', 'wild image, nicely seen.  i can only imagine what you had to do to set this shot up, capture it, then process it.  hope your efforts are rewarded, but, even if the score isn''t what you hoped for, you definitely have something to be proud of.  thanks for sharing.  good luck!', '2005-04-22 09:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
