(1312860, 163269, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent composition, nicely seen.  could stand to be a tad sharper, but i imagine it looks just fine large.  love the colors.  really love how this gives the feeling of spring making a sleepy wake up stretch.  hope this does well for you.  good luck!</td>', 'excellent composition, nicely seen.  could stand to be a tad sharper, but i imagine it looks just fine large.  love the colors.  really love how this gives the feeling of spring making a sleepy wake up stretch.  hope this does well for you.  good luck!', '2005-04-22 09:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312863, 168184, 23394, '<td valign="top">i really like this, but wish it wasn''t so tilted.  the colors are splendid.  i wonder, though, if you could have chose a different perspective, one where the road could be seen wandering a bit more diagonally through the image rather than almost splitting it down the middle?  either way, you have a nice image.  good luck!</td>', 'i really like this, but wish it wasn''t so tilted.  the colors are splendid.  i wonder, though, if you could have chose a different perspective, one where the road could be seen wandering a bit more diagonally through the image rather than almost splitting it down the middle?  either way, you have a nice image.  good luck!', '2005-04-22 09:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312865, 167123, 23394, '<td valign="top">wow.  this is simply breath taking.  there is absolutely nothing that could be done to improve this, except for it to wind up on the front page.  excellent work, i really hope this does well for you!</td>', 'wow.  this is simply breath taking.  there is absolutely nothing that could be done to improve this, except for it to wind up on the front page.  excellent work, i really hope this does well for you!', '2005-04-22 09:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312866, 166862, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice find.  love the atmosphere that you''ve caught.  this is a part of america that most people really have no clue about.  it''s one thing to see it in pictures, it''s another to be able to just soak it in.  i envy you.  thanks for sharing.</td>', 'nice find.  love the atmosphere that you''ve caught.  this is a part of america that most people really have no clue about.  it''s one thing to see it in pictures, it''s another to be able to just soak it in.  i envy you.  thanks for sharing.', '2005-04-22 09:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
