(1313035, 166943, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice find!  what a tough shot, with the darkened sky and deep shadows.  i might suggest metering for a brighter spot and shooting at a higher f-stop.  then you can use shadow/highlight adjustments to pull the darker areas out, without losing so much detail to the blowouts.  all the same, you have a nice image here, and i hope it does well for you.  good luck!</td>', 'nice find!  what a tough shot, with the darkened sky and deep shadows.  i might suggest metering for a brighter spot and shooting at a higher f-stop.  then you can use shadow/highlight adjustments to pull the darker areas out, without losing so much detail to the blowouts.  all the same, you have a nice image here, and i hope it does well for you.  good luck!', '2005-04-22 10:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313038, 168147, 23394, '<td valign="top">killer work.  love the colors you''ve captured.  these shots are always tough, because you have no control over just what is going to happen while your shutters open.  very nicely seen and composed.  hope this does well for you.  good luck!</td>', 'killer work.  love the colors you''ve captured.  these shots are always tough, because you have no control over just what is going to happen while your shutters open.  very nicely seen and composed.  hope this does well for you.  good luck!', '2005-04-22 10:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
