(1313083, 167095, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice image.  seems to be lit just a tad too brightly, which is taking away some of the strength of the image.  i also wonder if you had taken a perspective that would have put the blooms a bit closer if the composition would have been more dynamic.  as is, i find the blooms competing for attention, as opposed to one complementing the other.  all the same, nice work.  good luck!</td>', 'nice image.  seems to be lit just a tad too brightly, which is taking away some of the strength of the image.  i also wonder if you had taken a perspective that would have put the blooms a bit closer if the composition would have been more dynamic.  as is, i find the blooms competing for attention, as opposed to one complementing the other.  all the same, nice work.  good luck!', '2005-04-22 11:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
