(1313401, 160591, 20168, '<td valign="top">IMO sharp focus would work better.  But then the camera I use could never get this close to such a cool subject as a Bald Eagle.  All the best.</td>', 'IMO sharp focus would work better.  But then the camera I use could never get this close to such a cool subject as a Bald Eagle.  All the best.', '2005-04-22 14:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
