(1313404, 167276, 22872, '<td valign="top">i love this....very cool...love the compositions, clarity, the smooth look...</td>', 'i love this....very cool...love the compositions, clarity, the smooth look...', '2005-04-22 14:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313405, 167917, 20168, '<td valign="top">BW is an excellent choice for this photo.  Cool title as well.  All the best.</td>', 'BW is an excellent choice for this photo.  Cool title as well.  All the best.', '2005-04-22 14:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313407, 165346, 20168, '<td valign="top">Monet like macro.  The contrast of the focus and bokeh poppies makes this photo sing.  Cool stuff.</td>', 'Monet like macro.  The contrast of the focus and bokeh poppies makes this photo sing.  Cool stuff.', '2005-04-22 14:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313414, 167190, 22872, '<td valign="top">those are some big honkin'' ears!! :)</td>', 'those are some big honkin'' ears!! :)', '2005-04-22 14:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313415, 168264, 20168, '<td valign="top">Excellent cropping, focusing our eyes on the woman among men.  Love the reflective buttons and focus settings.</td>', 'Excellent cropping, focusing our eyes on the woman among men.  Love the reflective buttons and focus settings.', '2005-04-22 14:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313419, 161508, 22872, '<td valign="top">wow...that is awesome!!!!</td>', 'wow...that is awesome!!!!', '2005-04-22 14:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313423, 159459, 5391, '<td valign="top">The look on the groom''s face is a little strange, which is unfortunate.  Other than that, this is a PERFECT image.  Your tonal range is beautiful and it''s what wedding photography really should always look like!  Beautiful!  8</td>', 'The look on the groom''s face is a little strange, which is unfortunate.  Other than that, this is a PERFECT image.  Your tonal range is beautiful and it''s what wedding photography really should always look like!  Beautiful!  8', '2005-04-22 14:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313425, 160297, 27562, '<td valign="top">Nice idea to crop to an extreme hozional composition as it really adds to the image.  Good Work.</td>', 'Nice idea to crop to an extreme hozional composition as it really adds to the image.  Good Work.', '2005-04-22 14:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313426, 168251, 20168, '<td valign="top">Sepia works well for this subject and the comp is fine, except the upper right corner seems unnecessary.  IMO the highest point should be the "lover''s leap" location. Great shot.  All the best.</td>', 'Sepia works well for this subject and the comp is fine, except the upper right corner seems unnecessary.  IMO the highest point should be the "lover''s leap" location. Great shot.  All the best.', '2005-04-22 14:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313431, 167276, 27562, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and tonal values, but in my opinion a liitle too much blur was used.  Good Work.</td>', 'Nice composition and tonal values, but in my opinion a liitle too much blur was used.  Good Work.', '2005-04-22 14:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313433, 165431, 20168, '<td valign="top">I''m a fan of digital "art" in photography, but IMO this P/S filter seems to overload the delicacy of the subject. The white backdrop is a good choice for focusing our attention.  All the best.</td>', 'I''m a fan of digital "art" in photography, but IMO this P/S filter seems to overload the delicacy of the subject. The white backdrop is a good choice for focusing our attention.  All the best.', '2005-04-22 14:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313435, 168307, 22872, '<td valign="top">Wow...that is too wicked!!  Great shot!</td>', 'Wow...that is too wicked!!  Great shot!', '2005-04-22 14:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313436, 161186, 27562, '<td valign="top">By far the best animal shot I''ve seen in the challenge.  Great Composition.  Good Work.</td>', 'By far the best animal shot I''ve seen in the challenge.  Great Composition.  Good Work.', '2005-04-22 14:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313437, 166683, 22872, '<td valign="top">awesome colors!!</td>', 'awesome colors!!', '2005-04-22 14:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313439, 167994, 27562, '<td valign="top">Pin sharp and nice bokeh.  I just wish the ends of the tail feathers were not out of frame.  Good work.</td>', 'Pin sharp and nice bokeh.  I just wish the ends of the tail feathers were not out of frame.  Good work.', '2005-04-22 14:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313442, 167929, 27562, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space.</td>', 'Nice use of negative space.', '2005-04-22 14:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313443, 164250, 20168, '<td valign="top">Cool BW candid.  The absence of the face detracts from the story of the photo IMO.  So much is carried by eyes.</td>', 'Cool BW candid.  The absence of the face detracts from the story of the photo IMO.  So much is carried by eyes.', '2005-04-22 14:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313447, 159527, 5391, '<td valign="top">Clever - fun, interesting shot that makes you think.  Interesting contrast between the clothespin and risque'' doodle. One of the most creative in the challenge.  10</td>', 'Clever - fun, interesting shot that makes you think.  Interesting contrast between the clothespin and risque'' doodle. One of the most creative in the challenge.  10', '2005-04-22 14:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313450, 161134, 20168, '<td valign="top">A closer crop to fill the frame with this wonder IMO would improve the power of this shot.  I like the view to the top of the hill but wouldn''t miss the uninteresting foreground.  Sepia works well.  All the best.</td>', 'A closer crop to fill the frame with this wonder IMO would improve the power of this shot.  I like the view to the top of the hill but wouldn''t miss the uninteresting foreground.  Sepia works well.  All the best.', '2005-04-22 14:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313451, 162322, 5391, '<td valign="top">Amazing lighting, beautiful shot.  10</td>', 'Amazing lighting, beautiful shot.  10', '2005-04-22 14:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313452, 167631, 20168, '<td valign="top">Great cloud-light study</td>', 'Great cloud-light study', '2005-04-22 14:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313455, 163982, 20168, '<td valign="top">Cool compositional choice.  I would love to see this same photo with brighter lighting setting off the reflective surface of the glasses.  All the best.</td>', 'Cool compositional choice.  I would love to see this same photo with brighter lighting setting off the reflective surface of the glasses.  All the best.', '2005-04-22 14:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313460, 167917, 22872, '<td valign="top">LOL...excellent shot!</td>', 'LOL...excellent shot!', '2005-04-22 14:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313462, 166567, 22872, '<td valign="top">this is awesome and has a real creepy feel to it.  Feels like the bird is looking at me.  Excellent shot!<br/>10 !</td>', 'this is awesome and has a real creepy feel to it.  Feels like the bird is looking at me.  Excellent shot!10 !', '2005-04-22 14:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313463, 166783, 20168, '<td valign="top">Cool BW art photo.  I like the profile and focus on the subject in foreground, but the story of the couple with the cityscape fading in the background.  A lot going on in this photo-story.</td>', 'Cool BW art photo.  I like the profile and focus on the subject in foreground, but the story of the couple with the cityscape fading in the background.  A lot going on in this photo-story.', '2005-04-22 14:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313473, 167422, 20168, '<td valign="top">Good composition. IMO lower left foreground loses interest with too much heavy black.  Gradient sunset is just right, calming, contemplative.</td>', 'Good composition. IMO lower left foreground loses interest with too much heavy black.  Gradient sunset is just right, calming, contemplative.', '2005-04-22 14:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313475, 168136, 5391, '<td valign="top">Interesting, clever idea.  I''m not sure about the choice of the purple background.  The cookies are quite orange colored and the clash of the contrasting colors is a bit unsettling.  I like the composition and the "thinking outside the box" subject choice, though.</td>', 'Interesting, clever idea.  I''m not sure about the choice of the purple background.  The cookies are quite orange colored and the clash of the contrasting colors is a bit unsettling.  I like the composition and the "thinking outside the box" subject choice, though.', '2005-04-22 14:38:15.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1313487, 167861, 35739, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  I would have liked it without the trees, but it does add to the photo. Very clear. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  I would have liked it without the trees, but it does add to the photo. Very clear. Well done.', '2005-04-22 14:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313489, 164586, 20168, '<td valign="top">Good story in this photo, with the refrains of the song singing in my head as I look upon this solitary fellow.  BW works very well. Bit of white haze around the subject (whether there in the original or P/S work) is good offset to heighten this guy''s isolation.  Cool shot.</td>', 'Good story in this photo, with the refrains of the song singing in my head as I look upon this solitary fellow.  BW works very well. Bit of white haze around the subject (whether there in the original or P/S work) is good offset to heighten this guy''s isolation.  Cool shot.', '2005-04-22 14:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313494, 163225, 20168, '<td valign="top">Every bird inside the frame.  The eyes are lost due to the darkness of the original or post-processing choices.  Eyes say so much in a creature.  Excellent study of flight.  All the best.</td>', 'Every bird inside the frame.  The eyes are lost due to the darkness of the original or post-processing choices.  Eyes say so much in a creature.  Excellent study of flight.  All the best.', '2005-04-22 14:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313504, 165673, 5391, '<td valign="top">Stunning, beautiful photograph.  The viewer can really feel a definite connection between the subjects and photographer.  The tonal range and saturated colors are beautiful, image is tack sharp, and the cute post of the middle child really puts it over the top.  Just an amazing piece of work.  Congratulations!  10</td>', 'Stunning, beautiful photograph.  The viewer can really feel a definite connection between the subjects and photographer.  The tonal range and saturated colors are beautiful, image is tack sharp, and the cute post of the middle child really puts it over the top.  Just an amazing piece of work.  Congratulations!  10', '2005-04-22 14:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313507, 168007, 20168, '<td valign="top">Graphicfunk-like work...and a cool creative piece.  Ahh, that nightly decision, white or red!  I like the lighting in the photo.</td>', 'Graphicfunk-like work...and a cool creative piece.  Ahh, that nightly decision, white or red!  I like the lighting in the photo.', '2005-04-22 14:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313508, 168314, 35739, '<td valign="top">I am not sure but it may have been better if the back flowers were in focus rather than the front.  They are larger and dominate most of the photo.  If the upper flowers were cropped out?</td>', 'I am not sure but it may have been better if the back flowers were in focus rather than the front.  They are larger and dominate most of the photo.  If the upper flowers were cropped out?', '2005-04-22 14:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313512, 168167, 20168, '<td valign="top">Lovely macrowork.</td>', 'Lovely macrowork.', '2005-04-22 14:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313516, 161121, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow!  A stunning piece of work.  Fantastic sharpness, lighting, sense of motion from the water drops, and composition.  Rich, saturated colors - yowza - you could make big money from this gorgeous image!  I wish I could give an 11!  10</td>', 'Wow!  A stunning piece of work.  Fantastic sharpness, lighting, sense of motion from the water drops, and composition.  Rich, saturated colors - yowza - you could make big money from this gorgeous image!  I wish I could give an 11!  10', '2005-04-22 14:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313518, 168237, 20168, '<td valign="top">Beautiful cityscape.  The triangle of darkness in lower right distracts my eye.  All the same, great capture of this city.</td>', 'Beautiful cityscape.  The triangle of darkness in lower right distracts my eye.  All the same, great capture of this city.', '2005-04-22 14:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313519, 166156, 6999, '<td valign="top">There''s some good stuff here, but the down-side is perhaps stronger I''m afraid: that hugely burnt-out sky, some lack of detail in the trees (this perhaps is as much to do with too much local contrast - note the sense of halos around the edges, which means that there is a  good deal of work for the eye to do to make anything out in the details), and strange contrast in the trunk of that nearer tree. It''s a pretty good shot of a familiar scene froom a compositional point of view, but I think your processing has let it down, and perhaps allowing that sky to get so over-exposed in your original shot.</td>', 'There''s some good stuff here, but the down-side is perhaps stronger I''m afraid: that hugely burnt-out sky, some lack of detail in the trees (this perhaps is as much to do with too much local contrast - note the sense of halos around the edges, which means that there is a  good deal of work for the eye to do to make anything out in the details), and strange contrast in the trunk of that nearer tree. It''s a pretty good shot of a familiar scene froom a compositional point of view, but I think your processing has let it down, and perhaps allowing that sky to get so over-exposed in your original shot.', '2005-04-22 14:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313521, 167687, 20168, '<td valign="top">Ahhh...one of my favorites so far.  Such subtle lines, grace, elegance, simplicity.  Great lighting choice.</td>', 'Ahhh...one of my favorites so far.  Such subtle lines, grace, elegance, simplicity.  Great lighting choice.', '2005-04-22 14:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313522, 167687, 35739, '<td valign="top">Not sure but I believe cropping out some of the lower section may improve this photo.  I like the colors and the effect.</td>', 'Not sure but I believe cropping out some of the lower section may improve this photo.  I like the colors and the effect.', '2005-04-22 14:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313526, 168286, 6999, '<td valign="top">This makes one stop and think, certainly. Your control of the blue exposure is fabulous, and the subtle tones underneath are really sensual. Very cool.</td>', 'This makes one stop and think, certainly. Your control of the blue exposure is fabulous, and the subtle tones underneath are really sensual. Very cool.', '2005-04-22 14:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313528, 165490, 20168, '<td valign="top">Grand landscape with a human drama in the middle.  This would also have done very well in the recent challenge, but I hope will also do well in this free study.  Great touch in lighting, focus, contrast.  All the best.</td>', 'Grand landscape with a human drama in the middle.  This would also have done very well in the recent challenge, but I hope will also do well in this free study.  Great touch in lighting, focus, contrast.  All the best.', '2005-04-22 14:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313530, 167226, 20168, '<td valign="top">Clever way to "frame" your beautiful subject.  Frame has problems with the lack of symmetry.  Composition inside the frame is superb.</td>', 'Clever way to "frame" your beautiful subject.  Frame has problems with the lack of symmetry.  Composition inside the frame is superb.', '2005-04-22 14:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313531, 168306, 35739, '<td valign="top">A little to dark for my taste. I like the sunset but not the horses. When you get a chance, crop out the horses and a section of the bottom, leaving the trees, alittle ground and the sun. Just a thought.</td>', 'A little to dark for my taste. I like the sunset but not the horses. When you get a chance, crop out the horses and a section of the bottom, leaving the trees, alittle ground and the sun. Just a thought.', '2005-04-22 14:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313532, 166767, 11895, '<td valign="top">love the colors, very unusual and interesting</td>', 'love the colors, very unusual and interesting', '2005-04-22 14:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313538, 166127, 6999, '<td valign="top">In my view you could certainly pull all the levels across the entire photo down a good deal: all the colours are badly washed out. The greens have become very bland, the blossom colour is almost nothing, the leaves remain almost indistinguishable. I''m not sure you have a great image even beneath that: as far as there is a main point for the eye to fall on it''s the grass - the trees seem almost secondary, partly because of that largely grey colour, partly simply your placing of them in frame. It looks like you have good light though, it''s just your capture of it - try placing those clouds of blooms on a stronger line visually, such as a diagonal from corner to corner, or a converging pair of lines that draw the eye into a focal point and out again; from what i see here, I would think a few steps forward and a few to the right, and shooting along that far line of trees, would give you a far more successful image.</td>', 'In my view you could certainly pull all the levels across the entire photo down a good deal: all the colours are badly washed out. The greens have become very bland, the blossom colour is almost nothing, the leaves remain almost indistinguishable. I''m not sure you have a great image even beneath that: as far as there is a main point for the eye to fall on it''s the grass - the trees seem almost secondary, partly because of that largely grey colour, partly simply your placing of them in frame. It looks like you have good light though, it''s just your capture of it - try placing those clouds of blooms on a stronger line visually, such as a diagonal from corner to corner, or a converging pair of lines that draw the eye into a focal point and out again; from what i see here, I would think a few steps forward and a few to the right, and shooting along that far line of trees, would give you a far more successful image.', '2005-04-22 14:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313540, 168169, 22872, '<td valign="top">great picture.....reminds me of impressionism</td>', 'great picture.....reminds me of impressionism', '2005-04-22 14:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313544, 168329, 6999, '<td valign="top">Other than some background noise which gives the impression of the thing being in front of glass, this is fine work. Good light, good capture thereof. There''s an odd sense of lacking sharpness that goes as soon as one focusses on any area, so that may only be the light: or perhaps a lack of the true black that one expects in such a technically perfect image. But excellent detail, and some sense of texture too.</td>', 'Other than some background noise which gives the impression of the thing being in front of glass, this is fine work. Good light, good capture thereof. There''s an odd sense of lacking sharpness that goes as soon as one focusses on any area, so that may only be the light: or perhaps a lack of the true black that one expects in such a technically perfect image. But excellent detail, and some sense of texture too.', '2005-04-22 15:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313545, 164213, 20168, '<td valign="top">Could this be Zoomie''s? What makes this shot a standout is the layer upon layer upon layer of tonal range.  You make Ansel proud.  The sunbreak out along the coastline in the distance, just behind the "Sentinel" trunk is glorious, as is the subtle mist among the coastal rocks.  IMO, cropping out a bit more of the grey clouds at the top of the frame would give this coastal Sentinel even fuller expression.</td>', 'Could this be Zoomie''s? What makes this shot a standout is the layer upon layer upon layer of tonal range.  You make Ansel proud.  The sunbreak out along the coastline in the distance, just behind the "Sentinel" trunk is glorious, as is the subtle mist among the coastal rocks.  IMO, cropping out a bit more of the grey clouds at the top of the frame would give this coastal Sentinel even fuller expression.', '2005-04-22 15:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313548, 164011, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great green. The clouds and the far distant hills seem artificially softened - like you could just set your depth of field to limit at about two miles! Good punchy colours, though perhaps the browns and ambers have been taken a touch too far for me. It''s the light across the middle-distance that really gives this shot it''s impact.</td>', 'Great green. The clouds and the far distant hills seem artificially softened - like you could just set your depth of field to limit at about two miles! Good punchy colours, though perhaps the browns and ambers have been taken a touch too far for me. It''s the light across the middle-distance that really gives this shot it''s impact.', '2005-04-22 15:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313549, 167631, 22689, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful sky !</td>', 'What a beautiful sky !', '2005-04-22 15:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313556, 166338, 6999, '<td valign="top">A wonderful scene, but I think let down by your processing, I''m afraid. Some noise in the sky, the highlights in the mountains, the clouds could use more contrast, the foreground hills could perhps use less ... oh hell, it sounds like I''m just being down on you, but it''s because I really think this had major potential, and more care in the processing could have put this right up the top.</td>', 'A wonderful scene, but I think let down by your processing, I''m afraid. Some noise in the sky, the highlights in the mountains, the clouds could use more contrast, the foreground hills could perhps use less ... oh hell, it sounds like I''m just being down on you, but it''s because I really think this had major potential, and more care in the processing could have put this right up the top.', '2005-04-22 15:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313557, 167310, 22689, '<td valign="top">WOOOW !</td>', 'WOOOW !', '2005-04-22 15:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313558, 167164, 6999, '<td valign="top">Are we talking class A drugs here? Slightly mad shot, more mad model :-)</td>', 'Are we talking class A drugs here? Slightly mad shot, more mad model :-)', '2005-04-22 15:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313566, 164269, 35739, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, a little out of focus on the student. It appears that the student is the main subject, however the crane dominates the picture. I wonder if you cut this photo in half? Just a thought. You would have a nice photo of the crane, clouds, buildings and a small portion of the wall. The other would be of the wall and a little section of the buidings.  The wall is what is in focus.</td>', 'Nice colors, a little out of focus on the student. It appears that the student is the main subject, however the crane dominates the picture. I wonder if you cut this photo in half? Just a thought. You would have a nice photo of the crane, clouds, buildings and a small portion of the wall. The other would be of the wall and a little section of the buidings.  The wall is what is in focus.', '2005-04-22 15:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313577, 168331, 22689, '<td valign="top">So warm and beautiful !</td>', 'So warm and beautiful !', '2005-04-22 15:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313580, 168257, 35739, '<td valign="top">A little out of focus.  Cute photo.</td>', 'A little out of focus.  Cute photo.', '2005-04-22 15:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313596, 167422, 22689, '<td valign="top">It looks unreal but I love it ! Perfect mix of colors , really a nice photo !</td>', 'It looks unreal but I love it ! Perfect mix of colors , really a nice photo !', '2005-04-22 15:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313606, 167331, 22689, '<td valign="top">Great composition , nice color with good definition ! Well done !</td>', 'Great composition , nice color with good definition ! Well done !', '2005-04-22 15:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313609, 165380, 22689, '<td valign="top">Simply dreamy !</td>', 'Simply dreamy !', '2005-04-22 15:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313625, 168121, 20168, '<td valign="top">Glorious macro! One of my favorites to win this challenge!</td>', 'Glorious macro! One of my favorites to win this challenge!', '2005-04-22 15:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313634, 163625, 20168, '<td valign="top">Wonderful interplay of subject and shadow.  I love the white background, simplifiying the focus upon the shadow.  All the best.</td>', 'Wonderful interplay of subject and shadow.  I love the white background, simplifiying the focus upon the shadow.  All the best.', '2005-04-22 15:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313637, 165688, 20168, '<td valign="top">Beautiful nature shot.</td>', 'Beautiful nature shot.', '2005-04-22 15:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313642, 168265, 20168, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus, cropping,compositon.  Great entry!</td>', 'Excellent focus, cropping,compositon.  Great entry!', '2005-04-22 15:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313647, 167269, 7711, '<td valign="top">sky looks really strange here.. the rest of the photo is vibrant, however!</td>', 'sky looks really strange here.. the rest of the photo is vibrant, however!', '2005-04-22 15:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313653, 168291, 36495, '<td valign="top">WOuld be cool in B&amp;W and crack up the contrast a bit.</td>', 'WOuld be cool in B&W and crack up the contrast a bit.', '2005-04-22 15:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313656, 167261, 7711, '<td valign="top">horizon has a slight bend to it, which might have been sorted out through a very minor rotation (1 degree or so?). Beautiful colours.</td>', 'horizon has a slight bend to it, which might have been sorted out through a very minor rotation (1 degree or so?). Beautiful colours.', '2005-04-22 15:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313707, 168272, 35804, '<td valign="top">Such pretty light and the color of the water is just beautiful...a nice serene, quiet picture.</td>', 'Such pretty light and the color of the water is just beautiful...a nice serene, quiet picture.', '2005-04-22 16:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313708, 166050, 35804, '<td valign="top">What a pretty picture, the cat seems to be made of smoke. I love the soft light.</td>', 'What a pretty picture, the cat seems to be made of smoke. I love the soft light.', '2005-04-22 16:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313709, 160330, 35804, '<td valign="top">Another awesome avian picture...this is a terriffic picture, very nicely done.</td>', 'Another awesome avian picture...this is a terriffic picture, very nicely done.', '2005-04-22 16:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313732, 160707, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame top corners look a little odd, but colours and textures of rest of photo works well, effective PP.</td>', 'Shame top corners look a little odd, but colours and textures of rest of photo works well, effective PP.', '2005-04-22 16:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313734, 168245, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not sure inclusion of car works for me, and I wish the sky had more detail/ interesting clouds.</td>', 'Not sure inclusion of car works for me, and I wish the sky had more detail/ interesting clouds.', '2005-04-22 16:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313737, 167424, 8522, '<td valign="top">Looks accidentally out-of-focus rather than deliberate. At least try and keep the eye sharp IMO. Composition doesn''t quite work for me, doesn''t seem planned. Great subject though and nice lighting. I like the arrangement of her hair.</td>', 'Looks accidentally out-of-focus rather than deliberate. At least try and keep the eye sharp IMO. Composition doesn''t quite work for me, doesn''t seem planned. Great subject though and nice lighting. I like the arrangement of her hair.', '2005-04-22 16:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313743, 165270, 8522, '<td valign="top">What an incredible building, I''m looking forward to finding out where this is.</td>', 'What an incredible building, I''m looking forward to finding out where this is.', '2005-04-22 16:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313745, 168336, 8522, '<td valign="top">Sorry, looks like an out-of-focus snapshot rather than an impressionistic arty-farty shot.</td>', 'Sorry, looks like an out-of-focus snapshot rather than an impressionistic arty-farty shot.', '2005-04-22 16:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313747, 161633, 8522, '<td valign="top">Horizon feels a little tilted. Wonderful building though, Iceland no doubt... A little over-blurred for my taste.</td>', 'Horizon feels a little tilted. Wonderful building though, Iceland no doubt... A little over-blurred for my taste.', '2005-04-22 16:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313752, 163374, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great timing and dof, but subject is too similar to background (colour, texture).</td>', 'Great timing and dof, but subject is too similar to background (colour, texture).', '2005-04-22 17:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313755, 167196, 35377, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!<br/>There is nothing that I can see wrong with this shot at all. I love it.</td>', 'Great shot!!There is nothing that I can see wrong with this shot at all. I love it.', '2005-04-22 17:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313756, 167573, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting and subtle idea. I think you need stronger blues to pull it off though.</td>', 'Interesting and subtle idea. I think you need stronger blues to pull it off though.', '2005-04-22 17:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313762, 168059, 8522, '<td valign="top">I really liked this photo at first until I noticed your shadow-effect border which really takes away from the power of the shot. I just can''t focus on the photo with that border.</td>', 'I really liked this photo at first until I noticed your shadow-effect border which really takes away from the power of the shot. I just can''t focus on the photo with that border.', '2005-04-22 17:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313763, 167917, 17291, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I give it a 10.</td>', 'Great photo. I give it a 10.', '2005-04-22 17:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313765, 161121, 17291, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I give it a 10.</td>', 'Great photo. I give it a 10.', '2005-04-22 17:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313767, 166567, 25655, '<td valign="top">Wow! Amazing!<br/>It looks like it has "thinking lines" on it''s forehead.<br/>So sharp and clear, beautiful colors and light.<br/>The best bird shot I have ever seen! 10</td>', 'Wow! Amazing!It looks like it has "thinking lines" on it''s forehead.So sharp and clear, beautiful colors and light.The best bird shot I have ever seen! 10', '2005-04-22 17:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313768, 168286, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot that I''m assuming has been inverted. Works very well here.</td>', 'Interesting shot that I''m assuming has been inverted. Works very well here.', '2005-04-22 17:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313769, 161186, 17291, '<td valign="top">This is one of favorite photos in this challenge. Great composition and color.</td>', 'This is one of favorite photos in this challenge. Great composition and color.', '2005-04-22 17:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313770, 167500, 8522, '<td valign="top">Usually works better when there is contrast between subject and background. Great lion though.</td>', 'Usually works better when there is contrast between subject and background. Great lion though.', '2005-04-22 17:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313771, 168068, 17291, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I give it a 10.</td>', 'Great photo. I give it a 10.', '2005-04-22 17:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313772, 167289, 17291, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I love it in B&amp;W. I give it a 10.</td>', 'Great photo. I love it in B&W. I give it a 10.', '2005-04-22 17:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313773, 168139, 6999, '<td valign="top">Some lens to hand-hold. The composition is good, though I do wonder if it mightn''t have been more effective to go for the full-on silhouette treatment: this feels a bit half-and-half.</td>', 'Some lens to hand-hold. The composition is good, though I do wonder if it mightn''t have been more effective to go for the full-on silhouette treatment: this feels a bit half-and-half.', '2005-04-22 17:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313776, 164671, 8522, '<td valign="top">Well carried out, great lighting. The curve of the back is perfect. Perhaps a tad too much blur for my taste... I think it could work better as it is but with a face a bit sharper.</td>', 'Well carried out, great lighting. The curve of the back is perfect. Perhaps a tad too much blur for my taste... I think it could work better as it is but with a face a bit sharper.', '2005-04-22 17:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313777, 168050, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great photo, wish the horizon was a bit straighter.</td>', 'Great photo, wish the horizon was a bit straighter.', '2005-04-22 17:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313781, 167961, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the fake sepia effect here, but I love the subject matter.</td>', 'Not sure about the fake sepia effect here, but I love the subject matter.', '2005-04-22 17:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313783, 166742, 17291, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. Great emphasis on the eyelashes. Color is also good.</td>', 'I love this photo. Great emphasis on the eyelashes. Color is also good.', '2005-04-22 17:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313791, 167633, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great tonality all through - the grass colours are excellent. The unusual composition works well. After some time one starts to see figures in the white wall; I just wonder if it wouldn''t blance better if you could have found more texture in the wall, or perhaps simply more graduation of tone, but that''s just a passing thought. Neat photography, and interesting too.</td>', 'Great tonality all through - the grass colours are excellent. The unusual composition works well. After some time one starts to see figures in the white wall; I just wonder if it wouldn''t blance better if you could have found more texture in the wall, or perhaps simply more graduation of tone, but that''s just a passing thought. Neat photography, and interesting too.', '2005-04-22 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313806, 167067, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice study. For myself, i would have toned down that edge of the leaf with some careful brush-work, and perhaps played with trying to bring the background exposure down some ... just to force the eye toward the snail that bit more strongly (those patterns and shapes there are maybe a bit too present?). Light and detail on the snail are great, the overall crop is spot-on to emphasise the location. Strong work, and those reservations really are passing thoughts only. Well done indeed.</td>', 'Nice study. For myself, i would have toned down that edge of the leaf with some careful brush-work, and perhaps played with trying to bring the background exposure down some ... just to force the eye toward the snail that bit more strongly (those patterns and shapes there are maybe a bit too present?). Light and detail on the snail are great, the overall crop is spot-on to emphasise the location. Strong work, and those reservations really are passing thoughts only. Well done indeed.', '2005-04-22 17:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313812, 168006, 6999, '<td valign="top">This cold blue toning is difficult to use properly, but you''ve achieved it here well i think. It annoys my eye that that protruding thing is out of focus: I would have thought it made a good compositional balance to the water drops, and the eye is drawn there for that reason anyway: the drops seem to cradle it. A little more care with the file size might have enabled you to show us still more detail.</td>', 'This cold blue toning is difficult to use properly, but you''ve achieved it here well i think. It annoys my eye that that protruding thing is out of focus: I would have thought it made a good compositional balance to the water drops, and the eye is drawn there for that reason anyway: the drops seem to cradle it. A little more care with the file size might have enabled you to show us still more detail.', '2005-04-22 17:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313822, 164440, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like the shapes here - it has potential as a fine shot. But ... well, processing lets it all down. over-exposed sun becomes almost nothing, the edges of the wing are blurred by compression artefacts if not actual focus. I''m certain you could have under-exposed this considerably, and brought the light back in processing, which would have caused less problems with the sun (and perhaps the lens flares), and the wing could happily have remained a silhouette - with the added advantage of confusing the viewer as to your angle relative to it.</td>', 'I like the shapes here - it has potential as a fine shot. But ... well, processing lets it all down. over-exposed sun becomes almost nothing, the edges of the wing are blurred by compression artefacts if not actual focus. I''m certain you could have under-exposed this considerably, and brought the light back in processing, which would have caused less problems with the sun (and perhaps the lens flares), and the wing could happily have remained a silhouette - with the added advantage of confusing the viewer as to your angle relative to it.', '2005-04-22 17:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313827, 168176, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great photography, great processing. One so associates this toning with a find of reminiscent, sentimental photography, and this is the perfect antidote. You won''t score well, but that''s because of subject matter, rather a lot of blur, and unconventional composition, and a largely beginner-level audience; but you do from me.</td>', 'Great photography, great processing. One so associates this toning with a find of reminiscent, sentimental photography, and this is the perfect antidote. You won''t score well, but that''s because of subject matter, rather a lot of blur, and unconventional composition, and a largely beginner-level audience; but you do from me.', '2005-04-22 17:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313830, 167637, 23614, '<td valign="top">Very nice!!!! Maybe you could have cropped on the left just to remove the small tree. Even with that, it''s very dramatic. Hope you do well.</td>', 'Very nice!!!! Maybe you could have cropped on the left just to remove the small tree. Even with that, it''s very dramatic. Hope you do well.', '2005-04-22 17:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313833, 167934, 6999, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene, not quite beautifully photographed, to my eye; you could happily have taken it darker, which would have brought so much more intensity to those colours, and richness. That would also allow you to be rid of those overhanging leaves: framing this way is not bad as such, but in this image I would think that the pelican and the horizon line and the clouds and the reflections would be enough. Lots of good stuff here, though.</td>', 'Beautiful scene, not quite beautifully photographed, to my eye; you could happily have taken it darker, which would have brought so much more intensity to those colours, and richness. That would also allow you to be rid of those overhanging leaves: framing this way is not bad as such, but in this image I would think that the pelican and the horizon line and the clouds and the reflections would be enough. Lots of good stuff here, though.', '2005-04-22 17:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313835, 160591, 31637, '<td valign="top">wow !! what a find</td>', 'wow !! what a find', '2005-04-22 17:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313838, 164000, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice light. But, composition? I''m not convinced that this is really strong - or rather, as strong as this scene could be: it might feel less likely, but a half pace to your right, and you''d have an expanse of light with your model in her beautiful light to one side quite strongly. Just a thought, but I can almost picture it.</td>', 'Nice light. But, composition? I''m not convinced that this is really strong - or rather, as strong as this scene could be: it might feel less likely, but a half pace to your right, and you''d have an expanse of light with your model in her beautiful light to one side quite strongly. Just a thought, but I can almost picture it.', '2005-04-22 17:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313839, 168275, 31637, '<td valign="top">I love Anoles....good clarity here</td>', 'I love Anoles....good clarity here', '2005-04-22 17:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313840, 167525, 31637, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot</td>', 'beautiful shot', '2005-04-22 17:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313842, 167488, 35377, '<td valign="top">This is a great newspaper shot, it tells a sad story of nature and man, but also says something about courage.</td>', 'This is a great newspaper shot, it tells a sad story of nature and man, but also says something about courage.', '2005-04-22 17:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313844, 168203, 31637, '<td valign="top">nice composition...like the color of the plant on the dull background...good focus.</td>', 'nice composition...like the color of the plant on the dull background...good focus.', '2005-04-22 17:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313853, 168322, 35739, '<td valign="top">I like the content and the reflection.  I do not like the green reflection and the yellow trees.  There is a lot you can do in PS with this picture.  the sky being yellow does not help either.  It is clear.</td>', 'I like the content and the reflection.  I do not like the green reflection and the yellow trees.  There is a lot you can do in PS with this picture.  the sky being yellow does not help either.  It is clear.', '2005-04-22 17:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313868, 167375, 35377, '<td valign="top">Looks like there is a shadow from the lens hood on the end of the metal shaving.</td>', 'Looks like there is a shadow from the lens hood on the end of the metal shaving.', '2005-04-22 17:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313878, 168288, 6999, '<td valign="top">Quite modern, I think; in the sense that your subject is not a classically gorgeous one, but is more about the real, the beauty of the mundane, the anti-beautiful, if you like, except this doesn include some more usual stuff. That very smoothness of that wate is exceptionally well done - those bubbles or whatever essential just to let us know it''s there; the tones of the grasses work well with that blue also. can''t imagine the masses going for it in any particular way, but it has appreciation from this quarter.</td>', 'Quite modern, I think; in the sense that your subject is not a classically gorgeous one, but is more about the real, the beauty of the mundane, the anti-beautiful, if you like, except this doesn include some more usual stuff. That very smoothness of that wate is exceptionally well done - those bubbles or whatever essential just to let us know it''s there; the tones of the grasses work well with that blue also. can''t imagine the masses going for it in any particular way, but it has appreciation from this quarter.', '2005-04-22 17:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313879, 163804, 35377, '<td valign="top">Sun light through a frosted bathroom window? or reflecting in water? That is a great abstract.</td>', 'Sun light through a frosted bathroom window? or reflecting in water? That is a great abstract.', '2005-04-22 17:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313888, 163573, 35377, '<td valign="top">The only problem that I have with this picture is the grass that is spliting the flowers apart.</td>', 'The only problem that I have with this picture is the grass that is spliting the flowers apart.', '2005-04-22 17:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313906, 167885, 6999, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of something this - not sure what. Something of the Frederick Evans about it, perhaps. The feel is gloriously suited to the mood and scene, though I might personally have tried to select and calm down some of the light a touch - it just goes a bit far for me on this monitor (but then the variety of viewing options is something we have to take into account). There could be debates about keeping the white wall image left, and about the height of your point of view - choices, I suppose, but not sure I could say anything else would be better.</td>', 'Reminds me of something this - not sure what. Something of the Frederick Evans about it, perhaps. The feel is gloriously suited to the mood and scene, though I might personally have tried to select and calm down some of the light a touch - it just goes a bit far for me on this monitor (but then the variety of viewing options is something we have to take into account). There could be debates about keeping the white wall image left, and about the height of your point of view - choices, I suppose, but not sure I could say anything else would be better.', '2005-04-22 17:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313911, 163048, 6999, '<td valign="top">Intersting and different. You might, in my view, happily try calming down the exposure a bit - well, more than a bit, really, and then bringing the whites back to where you want them: that would give you a lot more punch in the yellows of the stamens (or whatever they''re called), and lose some of the impact of the background.</td>', 'Intersting and different. You might, in my view, happily try calming down the exposure a bit - well, more than a bit, really, and then bringing the whites back to where you want them: that would give you a lot more punch in the yellows of the stamens (or whatever they''re called), and lose some of the impact of the background.', '2005-04-22 17:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313912, 168128, 35739, '<td valign="top">I like the bird in the photo.</td>', 'I like the bird in the photo.', '2005-04-22 17:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313921, 168270, 35377, '<td valign="top">Move to the front of the golfer, put him on the left 1/3rd line and get rid of the tree. Keep the low camera angle</td>', 'Move to the front of the golfer, put him on the left 1/3rd line and get rid of the tree. Keep the low camera angle', '2005-04-22 18:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313934, 166202, 35377, '<td valign="top">A soft focus lens or filter in PS  would make this really dreamy. her face makes this picture really good.</td>', 'A soft focus lens or filter in PS  would make this really dreamy. her face makes this picture really good.', '2005-04-22 18:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313937, 166125, 20941, '<td valign="top">hmmm... long exposure, NY, Staten Island... Verrazano... good work... ummm just an educated guess, but this looks like the fine work of RulerZigzag. Well done composition, beautiful!</td>', 'hmmm... long exposure, NY, Staten Island... Verrazano... good work... ummm just an educated guess, but this looks like the fine work of RulerZigzag. Well done composition, beautiful!', '2005-04-22 18:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313942, 163429, 35377, '<td valign="top">Good spoonbill picture, I go to Lake Martin in Lafayette Louisiana  to photograph these things.</td>', 'Good spoonbill picture, I go to Lake Martin in Lafayette Louisiana  to photograph these things.', '2005-04-22 18:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313948, 168120, 35377, '<td valign="top">The white bridgei the background is distracting.</td>', 'The white bridgei the background is distracting.', '2005-04-22 18:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313949, 168246, 6999, '<td valign="top">How to suggest that one might brighten this to give it some punch, without losing the intensity of those colours? I don''t know: maybe I''m wrong, maybe it isn''t too dark and the silhouette doesn''t need to a little more definition - but that was my immediate thought.</td>', 'How to suggest that one might brighten this to give it some punch, without losing the intensity of those colours? I don''t know: maybe I''m wrong, maybe it isn''t too dark and the silhouette doesn''t need to a little more definition - but that was my immediate thought.', '2005-04-22 18:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313953, 160581, 35377, '<td valign="top">the reflections are really cool, great picture</td>', 'the reflections are really cool, great picture', '2005-04-22 18:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313964, 164817, 35377, '<td valign="top">The rule of thirds would elimnate a lot of unnessary grass and give a better look at the sky. Placing the house off center would also help. good color.</td>', 'The rule of thirds would elimnate a lot of unnessary grass and give a better look at the sky. Placing the house off center would also help. good color.', '2005-04-22 18:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313966, 165900, 6999, '<td valign="top">Lens? I need to know what lens you''ve used for this :-) It looks slightly wider than my 18-55, and I quite like the effect foreground. Excellent composition in this shot, although i would have worked over the exposure more than this: I think you could keep that bright sense of the landscape without having to have the clouds'' edges getting overblown so much - if not in raw conversion, then simply with large-feathered selection and the usual brightness tools. Though i like the intensity of the light: it''s by no means a classical way to shoot such a scene, but it''s effective, and a little different.</td>', 'Lens? I need to know what lens you''ve used for this :-) It looks slightly wider than my 18-55, and I quite like the effect foreground. Excellent composition in this shot, although i would have worked over the exposure more than this: I think you could keep that bright sense of the landscape without having to have the clouds'' edges getting overblown so much - if not in raw conversion, then simply with large-feathered selection and the usual brightness tools. Though i like the intensity of the light: it''s by no means a classical way to shoot such a scene, but it''s effective, and a little different.', '2005-04-22 18:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313967, 163404, 35377, '<td valign="top">Looks like a great picture but it is too small on my 19in 1280x1024 screen.</td>', 'Looks like a great picture but it is too small on my 19in 1280x1024 screen.', '2005-04-22 18:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313970, 167753, 35377, '<td valign="top">is there a reason for the fence in the background?</td>', 'is there a reason for the fence in the background?', '2005-04-22 18:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313972, 161133, 35377, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to go jump in the shower.. beautiful.</td>', 'Makes me want to go jump in the shower.. beautiful.', '2005-04-22 18:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313973, 167100, 6999, '<td valign="top">Beautifully detailed, and controlled tones too. Fine work. Background just a little dominant? Could have been muted more? And I wonder if, for a dpc audience, it wouldn''t want for a little contrast - just to give a fraction more punch to the colours and the fine textures. I like it muted though - but the background, personally, I would have dealt with - just a touch, unnoticeably (hopefully).</td>', 'Beautifully detailed, and controlled tones too. Fine work. Background just a little dominant? Could have been muted more? And I wonder if, for a dpc audience, it wouldn''t want for a little contrast - just to give a fraction more punch to the colours and the fine textures. I like it muted though - but the background, personally, I would have dealt with - just a touch, unnoticeably (hopefully).', '2005-04-22 18:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313974, 164011, 35377, '<td valign="top">great picture.</td>', 'great picture.', '2005-04-22 18:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313976, 167587, 35377, '<td valign="top">the bug is too blurry. good composition, color. just back up a lil and refocus on the bug hold down the focus lock button and reshoot.</td>', 'the bug is too blurry. good composition, color. just back up a lil and refocus on the bug hold down the focus lock button and reshoot.', '2005-04-22 18:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313978, 168300, 35377, '<td valign="top">good picture. the trees in the background mess it up for me.</td>', 'good picture. the trees in the background mess it up for me.', '2005-04-22 18:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313980, 163973, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good shot - and I like the overall tonality in this too. The thing that bugs me more than anything is the sharpening halo around the figure and the island in the distance ... if this is from USM, then I might point out that it took me ages to realise that you can use values below 1 for the radius - like 0.6 - and this makes <i>so</i> much difference it''s untrue. A shame the bright bit of sky is so blown, but really hard to deal with, that stuff.</td>', 'Good shot - and I like the overall tonality in this too. The thing that bugs me more than anything is the sharpening halo around the figure and the island in the distance ... if this is from USM, then I might point out that it took me ages to realise that you can use values below 1 for the radius - like 0.6 - and this makes so much difference it''s untrue. A shame the bright bit of sky is so blown, but really hard to deal with, that stuff.', '2005-04-22 18:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313984, 167945, 35377, '<td valign="top">I thought that I was the only one with pictures of dead fish. Good picture</td>', 'I thought that I was the only one with pictures of dead fish. Good picture', '2005-04-22 18:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313995, 163429, 15002, '<td valign="top">Rosette Spoonbill, very nice capture.</td>', 'Rosette Spoonbill, very nice capture.', '2005-04-22 18:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314013, 161870, 7711, '<td valign="top">absolutely love the colour transition in this one. This will make an awesome print.</td>', 'absolutely love the colour transition in this one. This will make an awesome print.', '2005-04-22 18:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314018, 163575, 7711, '<td valign="top">the light on the right is super distracting and takes away from the story you are trying to tell. I don''t know what would have saved this shot except a lot of cloning!</td>', 'the light on the right is super distracting and takes away from the story you are trying to tell. I don''t know what would have saved this shot except a lot of cloning!', '2005-04-22 18:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314022, 168282, 7711, '<td valign="top">bg really works to set off your bug. :)</td>', 'bg really works to set off your bug. :)', '2005-04-22 18:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
