(1314109, 167114, 7711, '<td valign="top">beautifully rich colours. There is something about the texture of this photo that is very appealing!</td>', 'beautifully rich colours. There is something about the texture of this photo that is very appealing!', '2005-04-22 19:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314111, 167967, 6999, '<td valign="top">Lacking some of that real ping of sharpness - camera? processing? can''t tell - and perhaps some real sweep of tonality - seems pretty washed out, overall: those visible tops of the mountains could have more impact, to emphasise the mist, and the water could be toned down some, and it''s a shame that all detail has gone from the sky. It''s a good still scene, with real potential - but, certainly for this kind of orthodox beauty, it really needs to have that technical perfection to complete the impact.</td>', 'Lacking some of that real ping of sharpness - camera? processing? can''t tell - and perhaps some real sweep of tonality - seems pretty washed out, overall: those visible tops of the mountains could have more impact, to emphasise the mist, and the water could be toned down some, and it''s a shame that all detail has gone from the sky. It''s a good still scene, with real potential - but, certainly for this kind of orthodox beauty, it really needs to have that technical perfection to complete the impact.', '2005-04-22 19:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314117, 164084, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field effect - though perhaps, given your title, you might have wanted to deepen it a touch to include those bits that actually <i>are</i> up? I think they pull the attention from the fabulous detail of the pollen bits. Excellent combination of the abstract in the bokeh and the perfect in the detail.</td>', 'Great depth of field effect - though perhaps, given your title, you might have wanted to deepen it a touch to include those bits that actually are up? I think they pull the attention from the fabulous detail of the pollen bits. Excellent combination of the abstract in the bokeh and the perfect in the detail.', '2005-04-22 20:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314129, 168160, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think i''d have tried some selective sharpening on that house - it could usefully just pop out of the image a little more? I''m no fan of the extreme nature of your darkening of the sky - have you tried using a threshold mask to achieve this effect - it allows the joins to be so much less noticeable? marvellous composition though, and with that little extra punch to match the processing I think it might have been a contender: I think you could use more contrast and lightness in the grass, and there''s that overall sense of blurriness also. Close, but doesn''t quite do it for me.</td>', 'I think i''d have tried some selective sharpening on that house - it could usefully just pop out of the image a little more? I''m no fan of the extreme nature of your darkening of the sky - have you tried using a threshold mask to achieve this effect - it allows the joins to be so much less noticeable? marvellous composition though, and with that little extra punch to match the processing I think it might have been a contender: I think you could use more contrast and lightness in the grass, and there''s that overall sense of blurriness also. Close, but doesn''t quite do it for me.', '2005-04-22 20:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314130, 168064, 6999, '<td valign="top">This could be a stunner - but this kind of scene really needs to be as big as possible, surely, and could be 20% bigger than this at least. I think also that you could add some light and then contrast to the mountain. Has real potential, but unfortunately unrealised.</td>', 'This could be a stunner - but this kind of scene really needs to be as big as possible, surely, and could be 20% bigger than this at least. I think also that you could add some light and then contrast to the mountain. Has real potential, but unfortunately unrealised.', '2005-04-22 20:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314131, 168272, 11895, '<td valign="top">Cherry Prince I bet.  Very cool shot, got the blossoms, got the duck, got the reflections and smooth water that is clean enough to see those orange feet, nice composition, hope this does well</td>', 'Cherry Prince I bet.  Very cool shot, got the blossoms, got the duck, got the reflections and smooth water that is clean enough to see those orange feet, nice composition, hope this does well', '2005-04-22 20:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
