(1314241, 168336, 32345, '<td valign="top">I rarely do give bad comments, but if this is your best shot for a free study lasting a full month... I wish you never post a picture that you think is bad. 1</td>', 'I rarely do give bad comments, but if this is your best shot for a free study lasting a full month... I wish you never post a picture that you think is bad. 1', '2005-04-22 21:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314258, 167307, 33560, '<td valign="top">A large bird such as this needs a lot of room to stretch out; nevertheless, I wonder whether the shot might be better framed with some of the left cropped.  I would be tempeted to apply a bit more unsharp mask to get strengthen the textural contrast between the foreground and background.  The photo has much to commend it, but to me it feels very unfinished.</td>', 'A large bird such as this needs a lot of room to stretch out; nevertheless, I wonder whether the shot might be better framed with some of the left cropped.  I would be tempeted to apply a bit more unsharp mask to get strengthen the textural contrast between the foreground and background.  The photo has much to commend it, but to me it feels very unfinished.', '2005-04-22 21:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314276, 164855, 33560, '<td valign="top">Here''s one DPC voter who hopes you use some other machine to view DPC challenges and to vote: the color balance is not within a country mile of being the same as that of the camera.  <br/> <br/>I''m not finding the composition to be very inspiring.  The print is busy.  And the space depicted is cramped.  The computer is not an unusually photogenic one, nor does it have any obvious visual or functional connection with lamp, print, or table.  My opinion, for what it''s worth.  <br/> <br/>It''s a good technique to have mastered.</td>', 'Here''s one DPC voter who hopes you use some other machine to view DPC challenges and to vote: the color balance is not within a country mile of being the same as that of the camera.   I''m not finding the composition to be very inspiring.  The print is busy.  And the space depicted is cramped.  The computer is not an unusually photogenic one, nor does it have any obvious visual or functional connection with lamp, print, or table.  My opinion, for what it''s worth.   It''s a good technique to have mastered.', '2005-04-22 21:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314281, 162677, 33560, '<td valign="top">A graceful gesture, and a smile that says ''can we be done with this yet?''  It''s a very pretty photo, nicely lit, nicely composed, nicely exposed.  Quibble - I''d have cloned out the distractions near the left edge.  Very nice.</td>', 'A graceful gesture, and a smile that says ''can we be done with this yet?''  It''s a very pretty photo, nicely lit, nicely composed, nicely exposed.  Quibble - I''d have cloned out the distractions near the left edge.  Very nice.', '2005-04-22 21:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314285, 167104, 33560, '<td valign="top">First, the quibble:  the biker would appear to be just a little higher, and the photo would have just a  little more drama if the wheels were not visually touching the mountain.  This said, it''s a powerful photo  - especially with the action completely stopped and the strong silhouette.  Good framing, too.</td>', 'First, the quibble:  the biker would appear to be just a little higher, and the photo would have just a  little more drama if the wheels were not visually touching the mountain.  This said, it''s a powerful photo  - especially with the action completely stopped and the strong silhouette.  Good framing, too.', '2005-04-22 21:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314292, 167494, 33560, '<td valign="top">Interesting title; though would it not be slightly better suited to a fall foliage shot?  I love the textures and winter colors captured in this shot.  It''s a beautiful composition, well lit.</td>', 'Interesting title; though would it not be slightly better suited to a fall foliage shot?  I love the textures and winter colors captured in this shot.  It''s a beautiful composition, well lit.', '2005-04-22 21:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314306, 167276, 35739, '<td valign="top">Im confused? Learning to fly?</td>', 'Im confused? Learning to fly?', '2005-04-22 21:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314308, 162923, 33560, '<td valign="top">There is something about magenta tinged reds that makes them almost impossible to reproduce both accurately and attractively either digitallly or on film.<br/> <br/>The framing is done well. and I like the interior details of the live flower.<br/> <br/>I''m afraid that I find the background chartreuse and the foreground magenta to clash mightily.  And there edge between the two colors seems a little funky.  While I understand the reason to include a live flower and a dead one, and I applaud your effort, I''m finding the visual effect to be a little gratuitously ugly.</td>', 'There is something about magenta tinged reds that makes them almost impossible to reproduce both accurately and attractively either digitallly or on film. The framing is done well. and I like the interior details of the live flower. I''m afraid that I find the background chartreuse and the foreground magenta to clash mightily.  And there edge between the two colors seems a little funky.  While I understand the reason to include a live flower and a dead one, and I applaud your effort, I''m finding the visual effect to be a little gratuitously ugly.', '2005-04-22 21:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
