(1314368, 168250, 33560, '<td valign="top">I''m a notoriously severe critic of horse photos, but I really like this one.  The lighting, texture, composition, framing, exposure - all really nicely done.</td>', 'I''m a notoriously severe critic of horse photos, but I really like this one.  The lighting, texture, composition, framing, exposure - all really nicely done.', '2005-04-22 22:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
