(1314376, 167120, 33560, '<td valign="top">Beautiful expression, crystalline clarity of focus, nice framing.  I''m afraid the sagging background blanket creates enough of a disstracton IMO to knock the photo from extraordinary to really really good.</td>', 'Beautiful expression, crystalline clarity of focus, nice framing.  I''m afraid the sagging background blanket creates enough of a disstracton IMO to knock the photo from extraordinary to really really good.', '2005-04-22 22:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
