(1314389, 167868, 33560, '<td valign="top">The colors are lovely; and the poppies look festive against the sky.  Unfortunately it''s hard to find anything in the photo that is in focus.  And that''s a major problem.</td>', 'The colors are lovely; and the poppies look festive against the sky.  Unfortunately it''s hard to find anything in the photo that is in focus.  And that''s a major problem.', '2005-04-22 22:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
