(1314526, 163763, 4338, '<td valign="top">i think I wold have like this better with different cropping. the right edge closer to his back and more space in front of him</td>', 'i think I wold have like this better with different cropping. the right edge closer to his back and more space in front of him', '2005-04-23 00:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314552, 168183, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract, great bokeh. It bothers me though that the neck isn''t in the centre of the frame, it looks unintentional. Could do with an appropriate border.</td>', 'Interesting abstract, great bokeh. It bothers me though that the neck isn''t in the centre of the frame, it looks unintentional. Could do with an appropriate border.', '2005-04-23 00:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314554, 168129, 6668, '<td valign="top">Love the shot, but I don''t care much for this border.</td>', 'Love the shot, but I don''t care much for this border.', '2005-04-23 00:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314555, 167994, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely and clear, good light. Missing tail ruins the shot though, and I''m not convinced by the composition/ square crop.</td>', 'Lovely and clear, good light. Missing tail ruins the shot though, and I''m not convinced by the composition/ square crop.', '2005-04-23 00:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314560, 168068, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely background, but I''m not convinced by the model''s pose/attitude. Shoulders seem very tense and awkward. There''s a nasty shadow cast by her jacket... caused by off camera flash? Also some haloing around the girl which is presumably why it had to be validated.</td>', 'Lovely background, but I''m not convinced by the model''s pose/attitude. Shoulders seem very tense and awkward. There''s a nasty shadow cast by her jacket... caused by off camera flash? Also some haloing around the girl which is presumably why it had to be validated.', '2005-04-23 00:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314563, 161621, 8522, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this shot, flare has been well handled. I can''t see why you didn''t edit the dust spots off your shots though. Perhaps an approriate border could have helped a little.</td>', 'I like the feel of this shot, flare has been well handled. I can''t see why you didn''t edit the dust spots off your shots though. Perhaps an approriate border could have helped a little.', '2005-04-23 00:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314565, 168319, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours. Border doesn''t fit though, I think you needed a different colour. Perhaps black.</td>', 'Lovely colours. Border doesn''t fit though, I think you needed a different colour. Perhaps black.', '2005-04-23 00:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314566, 167190, 8522, '<td valign="top">Subject too similar in colour to background. Animals typically need to look into most of the shot for good composition, here the left of the rabbit is completely superfluous since the subject is looking in the other direction.</td>', 'Subject too similar in colour to background. Animals typically need to look into most of the shot for good composition, here the left of the rabbit is completely superfluous since the subject is looking in the other direction.', '2005-04-23 00:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314567, 166050, 8522, '<td valign="top">Effective PP. Texture of the moss is a little distracting though and competes for point of focus.</td>', 'Effective PP. Texture of the moss is a little distracting though and competes for point of focus.', '2005-04-23 00:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314571, 163628, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful juxtaposition of warm and cool colours. Trees aren''t sharp enough though.</td>', 'Wonderful juxtaposition of warm and cool colours. Trees aren''t sharp enough though.', '2005-04-23 00:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314572, 168196, 8522, '<td valign="top">Direct sunlight is usually not the best way to capture flowers. Composition is also too chaotic and not imaginative enough. Decide what you want the point of focus to be.</td>', 'Direct sunlight is usually not the best way to capture flowers. Composition is also too chaotic and not imaginative enough. Decide what you want the point of focus to be.', '2005-04-23 00:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314573, 167258, 8522, '<td valign="top">Don''t care for the green tone, which looks like sepia gone mouldy.</td>', 'Don''t care for the green tone, which looks like sepia gone mouldy.', '2005-04-23 00:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314576, 167130, 8522, '<td valign="top">Sun is badly placed, causing distracting highlights in hair. Uncomfortable expression, and nothing appears to be sharp. Would be more flattering if hair was not tucked behind ears. Background is wonky. Subject placed to one side works well, but it might work better to completely crop out the writing on the t-shirt.</td>', 'Sun is badly placed, causing distracting highlights in hair. Uncomfortable expression, and nothing appears to be sharp. Would be more flattering if hair was not tucked behind ears. Background is wonky. Subject placed to one side works well, but it might work better to completely crop out the writing on the t-shirt.', '2005-04-23 00:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314577, 167187, 8522, '<td valign="top">There are some very strange greens in this photo, which needs straightening. Burnt out sky makes the colours look particularly odd.</td>', 'There are some very strange greens in this photo, which needs straightening. Burnt out sky makes the colours look particularly odd.', '2005-04-23 00:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314579, 160330, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''ve not seen photos of an owl flying like this before. Shame the background is so cluttered and with similar colours to your subject.</td>', 'Wow, I''ve not seen photos of an owl flying like this before. Shame the background is so cluttered and with similar colours to your subject.', '2005-04-23 00:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314580, 167216, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but your border seems to have gone a bit mad.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but your border seems to have gone a bit mad.', '2005-04-23 00:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314581, 167331, 8522, '<td valign="top">Would be much better if the butterfly was facing into the frame.</td>', 'Would be much better if the butterfly was facing into the frame.', '2005-04-23 00:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314583, 161186, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, I wish the frame was wider though with 35mm dimensions. You nailed the exposure. One of my favourites so far this challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful shot, I wish the frame was wider though with 35mm dimensions. You nailed the exposure. One of my favourites so far this challenge.', '2005-04-23 00:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314584, 164251, 6668, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking!!!</td>', 'Breathtaking!!!', '2005-04-23 00:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314585, 164008, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative and unusual skiing photo. I like it very much.</td>', 'Very imaginative and unusual skiing photo. I like it very much.', '2005-04-23 00:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314586, 159452, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not really convinced by your white balance here. I like the lens flare/ filter effect.</td>', 'Not really convinced by your white balance here. I like the lens flare/ filter effect.', '2005-04-23 00:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314588, 167525, 8522, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning. Great composition.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning. Great composition.', '2005-04-23 00:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
