(1314778, 166961, 18932, '<td valign="top">7. It would have been much better without the log, not that you can do much about it. The eye is led up the waterfall and then hits the log across the water.</td>', '7. It would have been much better without the log, not that you can do much about it. The eye is led up the waterfall and then hits the log across the water.', '2005-04-23 04:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314780, 163225, 18932, '<td valign="top">Whoa. Enough said. 10. I love how nearly all the birds are in different positions. Very very nice.</td>', 'Whoa. Enough said. 10. I love how nearly all the birds are in different positions. Very very nice.', '2005-04-23 04:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314783, 166431, 18932, '<td valign="top">If the photo wasn''t too busy I would have given this 20 out of 10. The texture on the wings and the general sharpness is stunning. As it is definitely an 8.</td>', 'If the photo wasn''t too busy I would have given this 20 out of 10. The texture on the wings and the general sharpness is stunning. As it is definitely an 8.', '2005-04-23 04:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
