(1314812, 163804, 12243, '<td valign="top">pretty harsh on the eyes. What is it?</td>', 'pretty harsh on the eyes. What is it?', '2005-04-23 05:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314821, 162284, 6999, '<td valign="top">Light, tones, detail, and a composition that works strongly. Nothing to criticise, really. Just enough light into eyes to bring out colour.</td>', 'Light, tones, detail, and a composition that works strongly. Nothing to criticise, really. Just enough light into eyes to bring out colour.', '2005-04-23 06:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314825, 164269, 6999, '<td valign="top">This has strengths - real strengths that I suspect will get overlooked. Strong compositionally, strong tonality. Did you try it with a b/w or toned conversion? I would have thought it would allow the blokcy shapes of the walls and skyline to be less confised by their colours, and would not have harmed the magic in the sky. Love the balance of this composition.</td>', 'This has strengths - real strengths that I suspect will get overlooked. Strong compositionally, strong tonality. Did you try it with a b/w or toned conversion? I would have thought it would allow the blokcy shapes of the walls and skyline to be less confised by their colours, and would not have harmed the magic in the sky. Love the balance of this composition.', '2005-04-23 06:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314868, 167541, 8522, '<td valign="top">Would be stronger if the bird wasn''t flying out of the frame. Left to right is usually slightly more effective.</td>', 'Would be stronger if the bird wasn''t flying out of the frame. Left to right is usually slightly more effective.', '2005-04-23 08:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314870, 162436, 8522, '<td valign="top">Colours seem a little dull, I''d have made them a tad more vibrant in PS. Great mood though.</td>', 'Colours seem a little dull, I''d have made them a tad more vibrant in PS. Great mood though.', '2005-04-23 08:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314871, 167796, 8522, '<td valign="top">White balance lets this down. Nice sense of context in the background, but shame that man on right has been cropped in half.</td>', 'White balance lets this down. Nice sense of context in the background, but shame that man on right has been cropped in half.', '2005-04-23 08:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314872, 164724, 8522, '<td valign="top">I''m really sorry, but this just made me laugh out loud. It''s just too much!</td>', 'I''m really sorry, but this just made me laugh out loud. It''s just too much!', '2005-04-23 08:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314873, 167315, 9780, '<td valign="top">I personally would like to see it in colors.... 7</td>', 'I personally would like to see it in colors.... 7', '2005-04-23 08:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314875, 167123, 8522, '<td valign="top">They key to successful desert shots is simplicity. Although you have some lovely colours, if I was there I''d have taken out a tele lens and found a way to make the composition much more striking. There''s too much happening on the horizon in this shot. The most interesting texture here is that of the sand in the foreground and I''d have made more of this.</td>', 'They key to successful desert shots is simplicity. Although you have some lovely colours, if I was there I''d have taken out a tele lens and found a way to make the composition much more striking. There''s too much happening on the horizon in this shot. The most interesting texture here is that of the sand in the foreground and I''d have made more of this.', '2005-04-23 08:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314878, 165996, 8522, '<td valign="top">Composition just looks messy/ chaotic. Appearance of sky doesn''t seem thought out. No clear point of focus.</td>', 'Composition just looks messy/ chaotic. Appearance of sky doesn''t seem thought out. No clear point of focus.', '2005-04-23 08:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314880, 168006, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract which I find difficult to focus on because the border keeps pulling my eye away.</td>', 'Interesting abstract which I find difficult to focus on because the border keeps pulling my eye away.', '2005-04-23 08:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314882, 167100, 8522, '<td valign="top">Stunningly sharp. Not particularly imaginative composition though.</td>', 'Stunningly sharp. Not particularly imaginative composition though.', '2005-04-23 08:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314883, 165719, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not sure what you wanted to achieve with this photo. I can only see chaos.</td>', 'Not sure what you wanted to achieve with this photo. I can only see chaos.', '2005-04-23 08:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314884, 166988, 8522, '<td valign="top">Looks like a wonderful personality, obviously at ease with the photograher. Focus is not on the eyes though which is one of the first things to look for in a portrait.</td>', 'Looks like a wonderful personality, obviously at ease with the photograher. Focus is not on the eyes though which is one of the first things to look for in a portrait.', '2005-04-23 08:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314887, 167074, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not sure that is the best title, the eyes have it but the mouth doesn''t. Tones need more contrast, looks a little washed out to me at the moment. Cropping the arms off really lets this potentially good photo down. Nice lighting and catchlights.</td>', 'Not sure that is the best title, the eyes have it but the mouth doesn''t. Tones need more contrast, looks a little washed out to me at the moment. Cropping the arms off really lets this potentially good photo down. Nice lighting and catchlights.', '2005-04-23 08:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314888, 165107, 8522, '<td valign="top">Flash seems a bit harsh, and shame you just cropped a bit of the wing off.</td>', 'Flash seems a bit harsh, and shame you just cropped a bit of the wing off.', '2005-04-23 08:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314889, 166994, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great idea, don''t like the selective desat though.</td>', 'Great idea, don''t like the selective desat though.', '2005-04-23 08:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314890, 165638, 8522, '<td valign="top">Centered composition doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Centered composition doesn''t work for me.', '2005-04-23 08:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
