(1314893, 161870, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but what is it with these thick white borders that don''t let you enjoy the photo as they keep pulling your eye away? It really does make a difference and it''s sad that I feel the need to take points away because it spoils the photo.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but what is it with these thick white borders that don''t let you enjoy the photo as they keep pulling your eye away? It really does make a difference and it''s sad that I feel the need to take points away because it spoils the photo.', '2005-04-23 08:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
