(1314904, 159100, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful PP, curious to see the steps involved. Great model, lovely colours and textures. Perfect exposure (Not purrfect, that would make you groan).</td>', 'Wonderful PP, curious to see the steps involved. Great model, lovely colours and textures. Perfect exposure (Not purrfect, that would make you groan).', '2005-04-23 08:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
