(1314912, 167164, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, great point of view, lighting, style, lens. Model seems too awkward though, rather than moody with attitude, she just looks bored and the hands look uncomfortable.</td>', 'Wow, great point of view, lighting, style, lens. Model seems too awkward though, rather than moody with attitude, she just looks bored and the hands look uncomfortable.', '2005-04-23 08:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
