(1314936, 163625, 8522, '<td valign="top">Love the shadow which looks like it has a life of it''s own. Striking composition, but wish it was in landscape orientation with plenty of negative space to the left.</td>', 'Love the shadow which looks like it has a life of it''s own. Striking composition, but wish it was in landscape orientation with plenty of negative space to the left.', '2005-04-23 09:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
