(1316146, 168068, 23471, '<td valign="top">weird expression on the model...to the point that it makes me wonder if the model is even necessary in this shot.</td>', 'weird expression on the model...to the point that it makes me wonder if the model is even necessary in this shot.', '2005-04-23 23:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
