(1316160, 167872, 26756, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.  That pavement / cobblestone is great. I like how he''s walking right down the center of the street, and how the distortion from the lens makes the buildings look like they are closing in over the pedestrians.  Really a beautiful image. 9</td>', 'Love this shot.  That pavement / cobblestone is great. I like how he''s walking right down the center of the street, and how the distortion from the lens makes the buildings look like they are closing in over the pedestrians.  Really a beautiful image. 9', '2005-04-23 23:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316163, 166813, 26756, '<td valign="top">Kill that thing before it winds up on your leg.  Beautiful macro literally bursting with color.  Lighting is almost too harsh but still very effective.</td>', 'Kill that thing before it winds up on your leg.  Beautiful macro literally bursting with color.  Lighting is almost too harsh but still very effective.', '2005-04-24 00:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
