(1316182, 167331, 10848, '<td valign="top">WOW ! This is outstanding! The detail is amazing, and the colors are wonderful. A well deserved 10</td>', 'WOW ! This is outstanding! The detail is amazing, and the colors are wonderful. A well deserved 10', '2005-04-24 00:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316188, 166155, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous! Wonderful angle, and your highlights in the bottom of the sun are perfect. Great shot!</td>', 'This is gorgeous! Wonderful angle, and your highlights in the bottom of the sun are perfect. Great shot!', '2005-04-24 00:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316192, 161112, 10848, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture. Actually makes me dizzy to look at it! Fantastic!</td>', 'Wonderful capture. Actually makes me dizzy to look at it! Fantastic!', '2005-04-24 00:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316194, 167727, 33560, '<td valign="top">I am amazed by this photo.  At first it struck me as being a sort of a snap shot.  But a split second later I noticed the blue eyes, thn theway they echoed the blue in the frock and other subtle blues in the photo.  Next I noticed the porecelain quality of the skin and the soft, glowing light.  And finally I noticed that all the colors were muted and had a subtle cyan cast.  Even the skin had greenish tinges in places.  That'' s normally a pet peeve but because all of the photo is subtly that color it works.  I''m not crazy about the water; but maybe that wasn''t optional.     Beautiful shot.</td>', 'I am amazed by this photo.  At first it struck me as being a sort of a snap shot.  But a split second later I noticed the blue eyes, thn theway they echoed the blue in the frock and other subtle blues in the photo.  Next I noticed the porecelain quality of the skin and the soft, glowing light.  And finally I noticed that all the colors were muted and had a subtle cyan cast.  Even the skin had greenish tinges in places.  That'' s normally a pet peeve but because all of the photo is subtly that color it works.  I''m not crazy about the water; but maybe that wasn''t optional.     Beautiful shot.', '2005-04-24 00:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316196, 166262, 30490, '<td valign="top">Not a compelling or interesting subject when compared to the 500 other entries.  Keep trying though</td>', 'Not a compelling or interesting subject when compared to the 500 other entries.  Keep trying though', '2005-04-24 00:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316198, 162516, 30490, '<td valign="top">Nice photo of the rose, but the other flowers are distracting</td>', 'Nice photo of the rose, but the other flowers are distracting', '2005-04-24 00:33:25.000000', NULL, 1);
