(1317008, 168151, 36628, '<td valign="top">The only suggestion that I might make about this is to move it a little farther from the center of the frame. As it is now I feel like alot of the foliage around the dandelion is ignored because the eye goes straight to the middle and gets stuck there.<br/> <br/>Technically I think it''s right on with exposure and contrast, becasue the flower definitely stands out.</td>', 'The only suggestion that I might make about this is to move it a little farther from the center of the frame. As it is now I feel like alot of the foliage around the dandelion is ignored because the eye goes straight to the middle and gets stuck there. Technically I think it''s right on with exposure and contrast, becasue the flower definitely stands out.', '2005-04-24 04:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
