(1317215, 167505, 6999, '<td valign="top">The detailing around the shaded part of the bonnet is very good - smoothness of texture, and interesting graphic elements; I really think you would score better if you''d found a way to fill the frame with the truck, rather than having that small area of background present - it''s that that stops this from being a study of shapes and lines, and makes it become partly something else - confuses the image.</td>', 'The detailing around the shaded part of the bonnet is very good - smoothness of texture, and interesting graphic elements; I really think you would score better if you''d found a way to fill the frame with the truck, rather than having that small area of background present - it''s that that stops this from being a study of shapes and lines, and makes it become partly something else - confuses the image.', '2005-04-24 06:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317217, 168169, 32608, '<td valign="top">wow.  very nice.</td>', 'wow.  very nice.', '2005-04-24 06:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
