(1317223, 167868, 36299, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, the air is a bit noisy, but still a nice shot.</td>', 'Nice colours, the air is a bit noisy, but still a nice shot.', '2005-04-24 06:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317224, 164724, 36299, '<td valign="top">I like the softening effect, but I like eyes that are clear and sharp.</td>', 'I like the softening effect, but I like eyes that are clear and sharp.', '2005-04-24 06:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317225, 164955, 36299, '<td valign="top">More of th face showing would make this a beutiful photo.  The pink top would still stand out.</td>', 'More of th face showing would make this a beutiful photo.  The pink top would still stand out.', '2005-04-24 06:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317228, 167963, 36299, '<td valign="top">To me, more seperation between flower and back ground would be very nice, as in a different tone of white.</td>', 'To me, more seperation between flower and back ground would be very nice, as in a different tone of white.', '2005-04-24 06:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317229, 168336, 36299, '<td valign="top">Very out of focus.  Not sure what it is to convey.</td>', 'Very out of focus.  Not sure what it is to convey.', '2005-04-24 06:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317231, 168050, 6999, '<td valign="top">Compositionally strong - that open space leads into the lagoon and the mountain nicely. The slight wide-angle element really helpes this - a classic approach, but always effective. A minor point, but I wonder if you couldn''t have framed things a little better - take the mountain more to the left of frame say, and perhaps that foreground lump to the right, to add a diagonal line to the image as well? What this sufferes from, to my mind, is a lack of detail, and that hurts it quite a bit: whether it''s from re-sizing, or your camera, or compression, or over-sharpening, or just the original image is impossible to tell, but something has made most of the foreground very blocky (small blocks, but still ...) and that would be the element you need to add to get this shot seriously amongst the high scores. It''s odd, because the sky feels like it still has good detail. I think you''ve pushed the exposure <i>just</i> too far, also - the highlights have ''gone'', and that might well be contributing to that lack of detail also. It''s good though - despite those points - and without more information impossible to really suggest how things might be improved.</td>', 'Compositionally strong - that open space leads into the lagoon and the mountain nicely. The slight wide-angle element really helpes this - a classic approach, but always effective. A minor point, but I wonder if you couldn''t have framed things a little better - take the mountain more to the left of frame say, and perhaps that foreground lump to the right, to add a diagonal line to the image as well? What this sufferes from, to my mind, is a lack of detail, and that hurts it quite a bit: whether it''s from re-sizing, or your camera, or compression, or over-sharpening, or just the original image is impossible to tell, but something has made most of the foreground very blocky (small blocks, but still ...) and that would be the element you need to add to get this shot seriously amongst the high scores. It''s odd, because the sky feels like it still has good detail. I think you''ve pushed the exposure just too far, also - the highlights have ''gone'', and that might well be contributing to that lack of detail also. It''s good though - despite those points - and without more information impossible to really suggest how things might be improved.', '2005-04-24 06:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317237, 168280, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like this very much, though something has gone very strange with the progression of tones across his face - it seems to have that grey/black high contrast, rather than the evenness of movement there is in his jacket. Great moment, and nice capture.</td>', 'I like this very much, though something has gone very strange with the progression of tones across his face - it seems to have that grey/black high contrast, rather than the evenness of movement there is in his jacket. Great moment, and nice capture.', '2005-04-24 06:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317239, 168336, 32108, '<td valign="top">If this is meant to be blurred then the effect does not work for me.</td>', 'If this is meant to be blurred then the effect does not work for me.', '2005-04-24 06:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
