(1318284, 167922, 7560, '<td valign="top">I think I recognize this shot. I have one strangly similar. ;) Excellent sky, I love the subtle graduated color. Nice motion blur on the cars as well. Gets the sense of a busy night in DC.  Shame that the USPS can''t get that stretch of the mall looking nicer though. Might be worth cropping in a bit on the ground so you cant see the dirt spots. Then again, maybe not. :) The important question- where''s the bottle? ;) 8</td>', 'I think I recognize this shot. I have one strangly similar. ;) Excellent sky, I love the subtle graduated color. Nice motion blur on the cars as well. Gets the sense of a busy night in DC.  Shame that the USPS can''t get that stretch of the mall looking nicer though. Might be worth cropping in a bit on the ground so you cant see the dirt spots. Then again, maybe not. :) The important question- where''s the bottle? ;) 8', '2005-04-24 12:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
