(1322980, 163558, 8860, '<td valign="top">''After NeatImage'' might be a good title! Actually, despite the sweeping use of it, this is quite emotive and the application has possibly made this more impactful than the original, which looks like a pretty decent shot underneath it all.</td>', '''After NeatImage'' might be a good title! Actually, despite the sweeping use of it, this is quite emotive and the application has possibly made this more impactful than the original, which looks like a pretty decent shot underneath it all.', '2005-04-25 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
