(1323008, 166562, 23394, '<td valign="top">while i''m sure this was a moment to appreciate, i''m at odds with the image.  there is too much competition for my interest:  if i am to be interested in the sunset, the barn is blocking my view.  if i am to be interested in the barn, there''s not enough detail to satisfy me.  i think if you had backed off a bit from the barn, you could have managed a composition that would have allowed you to define your subject, and allow the other elements of the image to work together in a complimentary fashion.</td>', 'while i''m sure this was a moment to appreciate, i''m at odds with the image.  there is too much competition for my interest:  if i am to be interested in the sunset, the barn is blocking my view.  if i am to be interested in the barn, there''s not enough detail to satisfy me.  i think if you had backed off a bit from the barn, you could have managed a composition that would have allowed you to define your subject, and allow the other elements of the image to work together in a complimentary fashion.', '2005-04-25 09:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
