(1323445, 167971, 2764, '<td valign="top">What is supposed to draw my eye here?  what is the main subject?  the water? am i supposed to notice that it is dirty? polluted? or is it the little bush in front?  if so, why include all the other beanches and leaves also?  cant quite figure out the point here</td>', 'What is supposed to draw my eye here?  what is the main subject?  the water? am i supposed to notice that it is dirty? polluted? or is it the little bush in front?  if so, why include all the other beanches and leaves also?  cant quite figure out the point here', '2005-04-25 11:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
