(1323481, 166961, 4517, '<td valign="top">Thats a great waterfall. I`m guessing this was hand held but a longer exposure on a tripod would have blurred the water for a better effect. Still a nice shot if a touch dark. 7</td>', 'Thats a great waterfall. I`m guessing this was hand held but a longer exposure on a tripod would have blurred the water for a better effect. Still a nice shot if a touch dark. 7', '2005-04-25 11:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323498, 167289, 4517, '<td valign="top">I love infrared so this automatically gets a 10. Perfect sky you got. What camera is this with?</td>', 'I love infrared so this automatically gets a 10. Perfect sky you got. What camera is this with?', '2005-04-25 11:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323501, 165071, 4517, '<td valign="top">Very clean and sharp.</td>', 'Very clean and sharp.', '2005-04-25 11:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323533, 168298, 23394, '<td valign="top">i like the basic idea here, but would probably like it more if the focus was even through out, or if the focus was something of a gradient dof.  as is, isolating on one area of the entire frame doesn''t hold my interest.  just my opinion, though.  good luck!</td>', 'i like the basic idea here, but would probably like it more if the focus was even through out, or if the focus was something of a gradient dof.  as is, isolating on one area of the entire frame doesn''t hold my interest.  just my opinion, though.  good luck!', '2005-04-25 11:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323540, 167271, 23394, '<td valign="top">i like the basic idea, but am a little undone by the flash.  it looks like it could be an interesting shot to attempt.  good luck!</td>', 'i like the basic idea, but am a little undone by the flash.  it looks like it could be an interesting shot to attempt.  good luck!', '2005-04-25 11:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323546, 168155, 23394, '<td valign="top">very pleasant image.  sometimes, images need to be seen as they are, simple landscapes as opposed to a picture of ''something''.  i can appreciate it as it is, but, unfortunately, i know from experience that the voters prefer to see pictures of ''something''.  good luck, thanks for sharing!</td>', 'very pleasant image.  sometimes, images need to be seen as they are, simple landscapes as opposed to a picture of ''something''.  i can appreciate it as it is, but, unfortunately, i know from experience that the voters prefer to see pictures of ''something''.  good luck, thanks for sharing!', '2005-04-25 11:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323557, 168320, 23394, '<td valign="top">love this very dynamic composition, but find the lighting just a hair too strong.</td>', 'love this very dynamic composition, but find the lighting just a hair too strong.', '2005-04-25 11:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323562, 164671, 23394, '<td valign="top">this has a lot of potential.  love the pose and expression, but find the lighting just a bit uneven.  good luck!</td>', 'this has a lot of potential.  love the pose and expression, but find the lighting just a bit uneven.  good luck!', '2005-04-25 11:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323568, 167955, 23394, '<td valign="top">while this is very cute, it probably isn''t the strongest image for a free-study challenge, where voters expect to be wowed.  maybe a different perspective might have given the image more of an engaging dynamic, something to hold the viewer''s interest.  also, the large white disk really competes with the dog for visual attention.  good luck!</td>', 'while this is very cute, it probably isn''t the strongest image for a free-study challenge, where voters expect to be wowed.  maybe a different perspective might have given the image more of an engaging dynamic, something to hold the viewer''s interest.  also, the large white disk really competes with the dog for visual attention.  good luck!', '2005-04-25 11:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323575, 167092, 13879, '<td valign="top">Would look good on a calender! might look nice in B&amp;W as well.</td>', 'Would look good on a calender! might look nice in B&W as well.', '2005-04-25 11:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323576, 168259, 13879, '<td valign="top">superb lighting</td>', 'superb lighting', '2005-04-25 11:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323586, 167230, 23394, '<td valign="top">sorry, but my initial reaction is that this is just too over-processed for my taste.  it''s fine as a piece of artwork, but as a photograph, it doesn''t really reach me.  i can''t say if it''s the blown out sky or how close to centered the horizon is, or if it''s just the overall softness.  i''m sure it was a wonderful moment to experience, and that your processing is right in line with what you envisioned creating when you snapped it, but, all the same, it doesn''t flip me (probably the same way my blurry taxis don''t appeal to my wife).  but, i''m just one opinion, and, as long as you like it, nothing else really matters.</td>', 'sorry, but my initial reaction is that this is just too over-processed for my taste.  it''s fine as a piece of artwork, but as a photograph, it doesn''t really reach me.  i can''t say if it''s the blown out sky or how close to centered the horizon is, or if it''s just the overall softness.  i''m sure it was a wonderful moment to experience, and that your processing is right in line with what you envisioned creating when you snapped it, but, all the same, it doesn''t flip me (probably the same way my blurry taxis don''t appeal to my wife).  but, i''m just one opinion, and, as long as you like it, nothing else really matters.', '2005-04-25 11:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323587, 167619, 13879, '<td valign="top">I really like this one, Incredible sense of depth. shame the lighthouse(?) is so dark, but i guess you used a graduated filter</td>', 'I really like this one, Incredible sense of depth. shame the lighthouse(?) is so dark, but i guess you used a graduated filter', '2005-04-25 11:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
