(1324086, 168333, 14620, '<td valign="top">Heh heh, what a quirky idea!!!  This is great, love the colors especially how the red pops.</td>', 'Heh heh, what a quirky idea!!!  This is great, love the colors especially how the red pops.', '2005-04-25 14:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
