(1324097, 162575, 22046, '<td valign="top">What a great face this girl has. I think it was a great idea to do this in sepia too. Made the center of attention her face rather than her shirt which I bet is colorful. Good choice.</td>', 'What a great face this girl has. I think it was a great idea to do this in sepia too. Made the center of attention her face rather than her shirt which I bet is colorful. Good choice.', '2005-04-25 14:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
