(1324102, 168295, 22046, '<td valign="top">Great focus and good choice to do black and white. For me this is too tight a crop. I''d have liked to have seen more of her ears and whiskers. Still it''s a tood study of this lovely cat.</td>', 'Great focus and good choice to do black and white. For me this is too tight a crop. I''d have liked to have seen more of her ears and whiskers. Still it''s a tood study of this lovely cat.', '2005-04-25 14:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
