(1324145, 168169, 22046, '<td valign="top">Wow! Yes this does feel like a cathedral. I love the way the marks on the trees form a line down to the end of the row. Of course the colors are what really make this stand out. Very special image.</td>', 'Wow! Yes this does feel like a cathedral. I love the way the marks on the trees form a line down to the end of the row. Of course the colors are what really make this stand out. Very special image.', '2005-04-25 14:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
