(1324541, 166742, 20315, '<td valign="top">Lush color and textures. I love the way you framed the subject a bit askew.</td>', 'Lush color and textures. I love the way you framed the subject a bit askew.', '2005-04-25 15:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324543, 167481, 21714, '<td valign="top">Love the depth, detail and colours in this one. The atmosphere is captured well. You are drawn in and asked to explore and I like that. Well done.</td>', 'Love the depth, detail and colours in this one. The atmosphere is captured well. You are drawn in and asked to explore and I like that. Well done.', '2005-04-25 15:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324546, 166262, 20315, '<td valign="top">Very simple and clean but speaks volumes. Nice light and DOF which makes the cedar frawn, although taking up the smallest portion of the frame, really stand out.</td>', 'Very simple and clean but speaks volumes. Nice light and DOF which makes the cedar frawn, although taking up the smallest portion of the frame, really stand out.', '2005-04-25 15:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324548, 168252, 15129, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but it seems to have a bluish cast to it.</td>', 'Very nice, but it seems to have a bluish cast to it.', '2005-04-25 15:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324549, 166483, 20315, '<td valign="top">Vibrant and bold color. Nice composition and framing of the subject askew in the frame. 10</td>', 'Vibrant and bold color. Nice composition and framing of the subject askew in the frame. 10', '2005-04-25 15:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324550, 168249, 21714, '<td valign="top">Magnificent. To me the birds the feathers look like a mess and the positioning of the legs make me wonder if it''s about to land.  There''s a nice balance between what it''s carrying and the shape of the bird too. I like it a lot.</td>', 'Magnificent. To me the birds the feathers look like a mess and the positioning of the legs make me wonder if it''s about to land.  There''s a nice balance between what it''s carrying and the shape of the bird too. I like it a lot.', '2005-04-25 15:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324551, 167535, 20315, '<td valign="top">Wonderful texture and color. Mushrooms, although nice to eat don''t always come off as intersting as these morels, which I attribute to your capture. 10</td>', 'Wonderful texture and color. Mushrooms, although nice to eat don''t always come off as intersting as these morels, which I attribute to your capture. 10', '2005-04-25 15:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324552, 167945, 21714, '<td valign="top">Not too keen on the colour of the border, but I think it''s a superb shot and your processing is most excellent. Great work.</td>', 'Not too keen on the colour of the border, but I think it''s a superb shot and your processing is most excellent. Great work.', '2005-04-25 15:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324553, 161186, 20315, '<td valign="top">Fabulous exposure, nice off center composition. Rich and creamy color. 10</td>', 'Fabulous exposure, nice off center composition. Rich and creamy color. 10', '2005-04-25 15:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324555, 166380, 20315, '<td valign="top">Excellent color and action. Nice detail and crispness. 10</td>', 'Excellent color and action. Nice detail and crispness. 10', '2005-04-25 15:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324558, 167963, 24212, '<td valign="top">To me, the backlighting looks a bit too harsh.  I''d perhaps like to see it toned down a bit.</td>', 'To me, the backlighting looks a bit too harsh.  I''d perhaps like to see it toned down a bit.', '2005-04-25 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324561, 168259, 20315, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subtle light. The centered subject, which I usually think of as a ''no'', is a ''yes'' in this image. I love the detail of the and the moody light.</td>', 'Beautiful subtle light. The centered subject, which I usually think of as a ''no'', is a ''yes'' in this image. I love the detail of the and the moody light.', '2005-04-25 15:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324562, 166567, 32221, '<td valign="top">The detail and lighting is amazing!</td>', 'The detail and lighting is amazing!', '2005-04-25 15:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324565, 168155, 24212, '<td valign="top">To me, the horizon looks a little tilted and I feel that perhaps it''s a little too centred in the frame.</td>', 'To me, the horizon looks a little tilted and I feel that perhaps it''s a little too centred in the frame.', '2005-04-25 15:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324568, 163558, 24212, '<td valign="top">A stunningly atmospheric shot. I love the way that the seagull stands out.</td>', 'A stunningly atmospheric shot. I love the way that the seagull stands out.', '2005-04-25 15:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324569, 165272, 20315, '<td valign="top">This image is really beautiful. From the subject, light, compsition and exposure, it''s a 10. It reminds me of a botantical print.</td>', 'This image is really beautiful. From the subject, light, compsition and exposure, it''s a 10. It reminds me of a botantical print.', '2005-04-25 15:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324570, 161381, 811, '<td valign="top">I love this shot!  I would not change a thing.  One of those that makes me go, "Dang, I wish I had done that."</td>', 'I love this shot!  I would not change a thing.  One of those that makes me go, "Dang, I wish I had done that."', '2005-04-25 15:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324573, 167123, 811, '<td valign="top">This is a shot worthy of a texture study.  Awesome capture</td>', 'This is a shot worthy of a texture study.  Awesome capture', '2005-04-25 15:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324575, 166567, 24212, '<td valign="top">I particularly like the lighting here. Great capture.</td>', 'I particularly like the lighting here. Great capture.', '2005-04-25 15:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324577, 167100, 20315, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and exposure.</td>', 'Beautiful light and exposure.', '2005-04-25 15:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324578, 161508, 811, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and elegant</td>', 'Beautiful and elegant', '2005-04-25 15:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324581, 161870, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really like the way that one can almost see the wind here in both the clouds and the branches of the tree.</td>', 'I really like the way that one can almost see the wind here in both the clouds and the branches of the tree.', '2005-04-25 15:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
