(1324586, 168081, 24212, '<td valign="top">The lighting''s great. I really like the way that the frame is filled.</td>', 'The lighting''s great. I really like the way that the frame is filled.', '2005-04-25 15:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324587, 162964, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the angry sky and the ground.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the angry sky and the ground.', '2005-04-25 15:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324588, 163973, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the sharpness here, although I think I might be able to detect a hint of haloing around the figure.</td>', 'I like the sharpness here, although I think I might be able to detect a hint of haloing around the figure.', '2005-04-25 15:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324589, 168336, 13879, '<td valign="top">the out of focus blur is a bit too over the top for my tastes, but is an intruiging effect. I think the child should be the focal point of the image shame they are half cropped out.</td>', 'the out of focus blur is a bit too over the top for my tastes, but is an intruiging effect. I think the child should be the focal point of the image shame they are half cropped out.', '2005-04-25 15:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324590, 161043, 32221, '<td valign="top">Amazing! I hope you explain how it was done after the challenge</td>', 'Amazing! I hope you explain how it was done after the challenge', '2005-04-25 15:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324591, 168054, 24212, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully sharp. Great viewpoint.</td>', 'Wonderfully sharp. Great viewpoint.', '2005-04-25 15:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324593, 167535, 13879, '<td valign="top">great texture, complimented via the lighting.</td>', 'great texture, complimented via the lighting.', '2005-04-25 15:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324594, 161186, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really like the off-centre composition and the simplicity.</td>', 'I really like the off-centre composition and the simplicity.', '2005-04-25 15:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324596, 167444, 24212, '<td valign="top">I find the colours particularly attractive here. Very sharp too.</td>', 'I find the colours particularly attractive here. Very sharp too.', '2005-04-25 15:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324598, 168202, 13879, '<td valign="top">This makes me feel very uneasy (in a good way!) like a hitchcock film! the chairs... are LOOKING at me...<br/> <br/>Interesting shot. 8</td>', 'This makes me feel very uneasy (in a good way!) like a hitchcock film! the chairs... are LOOKING at me... Interesting shot. 8', '2005-04-25 16:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324600, 168336, 811, '<td valign="top">Soft focus I can handle, but this seems to be obliterated totally.  A couple of things might have made a difference for me -- if the person (?) in red wasn''t cut out of the picture and more prominent, it wouldn''t draw the eyes out of the frame.  Or if either the red person or slide was cropped out.  As it is, the two red objects compete for the attention of my eyes.<br/> <br/>That said, I can only assume this looks like you wanted it to look, so good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Soft focus I can handle, but this seems to be obliterated totally.  A couple of things might have made a difference for me -- if the person (?) in red wasn''t cut out of the picture and more prominent, it wouldn''t draw the eyes out of the frame.  Or if either the red person or slide was cropped out.  As it is, the two red objects compete for the attention of my eyes. That said, I can only assume this looks like you wanted it to look, so good luck in the challenge!', '2005-04-25 16:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324601, 167592, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think it''s great how the house stands out from the hazy background. The additional splash of colour from the chairs really sets it all off.</td>', 'I think it''s great how the house stands out from the hazy background. The additional splash of colour from the chairs really sets it all off.', '2005-04-25 16:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324604, 168182, 811, '<td valign="top">The framing/composition is a bit static to me because of the centered subject.  On the one hand that kinda suits the subject well, because it is obviously not serving a purpose anymore (or doesn''t seem to be), but on the other, it doesn''t make for a very interesting or dynamic picture.</td>', 'The framing/composition is a bit static to me because of the centered subject.  On the one hand that kinda suits the subject well, because it is obviously not serving a purpose anymore (or doesn''t seem to be), but on the other, it doesn''t make for a very interesting or dynamic picture.', '2005-04-25 16:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324605, 167074, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting here, with the face slightly more bright than the rest of the subject. The thoughtful expression is quite intriguing as well.</td>', 'I really like the lighting here, with the face slightly more bright than the rest of the subject. The thoughtful expression is quite intriguing as well.', '2005-04-25 16:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324608, 165107, 24212, '<td valign="top">What a marvellous capture. The beak, perhaps, looks a little soft, but that''s a minor thing.</td>', 'What a marvellous capture. The beak, perhaps, looks a little soft, but that''s a minor thing.', '2005-04-25 16:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324609, 167500, 32221, '<td valign="top">Excelent, nice DOF</td>', 'Excelent, nice DOF', '2005-04-25 16:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324612, 161121, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really like the expression and the way that the droplets have been captured.</td>', 'I really like the expression and the way that the droplets have been captured.', '2005-04-25 16:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324613, 164257, 6388, '<td valign="top">v coole.  i''m really enjoying this at the moment.  yes.  picture me, sitting in my chair, enjoying this photo.  cuz that''s what i''m doing.  normally i''d say that a 20+ pixel border would detract froma photo, but I don''t believe it does in this case.  The high key background really emphasizes the spectator.  nice sharpness, though the USM (or whatever you used to sharpen it) caused a bit of pixellation in the sweater and the chair)  i might have tried sharpening a duplicate layer on top of the original, then erasing the parts that show the pixellation.  But that''s just me...you might like it exactly as is :)<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'v coole.  i''m really enjoying this at the moment.  yes.  picture me, sitting in my chair, enjoying this photo.  cuz that''s what i''m doing.  normally i''d say that a 20+ pixel border would detract froma photo, but I don''t believe it does in this case.  The high key background really emphasizes the spectator.  nice sharpness, though the USM (or whatever you used to sharpen it) caused a bit of pixellation in the sweater and the chair)  i might have tried sharpening a duplicate layer on top of the original, then erasing the parts that show the pixellation.  But that''s just me...you might like it exactly as is :) Pedro', '2005-04-25 16:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324617, 166539, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the way that there''s the hint of a shadow at the base of the jar. I think that without it, the whole subject may look like it''s hanging in space, if you see what I mean.</td>', 'I like the way that there''s the hint of a shadow at the base of the jar. I think that without it, the whole subject may look like it''s hanging in space, if you see what I mean.', '2005-04-25 16:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324622, 168226, 13879, '<td valign="top">Has a nice warm feel, i can almost smell the beans MMmmm.....<br/>Its a sham the top of the grind is a bit out of focus, a smaller aperature (larger F-number, maybe F4) wouls sort this out.  Is a bit too dark, but I think a dark feel adds to the feel of the shot.  Good effort!</td>', 'Has a nice warm feel, i can almost smell the beans MMmmm.....Its a sham the top of the grind is a bit out of focus, a smaller aperature (larger F-number, maybe F4) wouls sort this out.  Is a bit too dark, but I think a dark feel adds to the feel of the shot.  Good effort!', '2005-04-25 16:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324629, 163197, 24212, '<td valign="top">A great capture. If anything, I''d perhaps like to see all the petals in focus, but I guess that would be asking for a bit too much with a close-up such as this. Also, the background seems to have a dark patch at the upper left which is maybe a little distracting.</td>', 'A great capture. If anything, I''d perhaps like to see all the petals in focus, but I guess that would be asking for a bit too much with a close-up such as this. Also, the background seems to have a dark patch at the upper left which is maybe a little distracting.', '2005-04-25 16:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
