(1324950, 168275, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait of an anolis lizard (American Chameleon). I used to keep these as pets and lovely pets they were too. You''ve got a great pose, lovely focus, light and colour. Fantastic.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait of an anolis lizard (American Chameleon). I used to keep these as pets and lovely pets they were too. You''ve got a great pose, lovely focus, light and colour. Fantastic.', '2005-04-25 17:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
