(1324959, 164008, 13879, '<td valign="top">effective use of grain, I love the idea, but feel the subject doesnt really suit the technique - the ski-lift spoils it for me, has a great "turn of the century" feel to it.</td>', 'effective use of grain, I love the idea, but feel the subject doesnt really suit the technique - the ski-lift spoils it for me, has a great "turn of the century" feel to it.', '2005-04-25 17:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
