(1325002, 167488, 8860, '<td valign="top">Amazing observation - I can''t imagine this Canada goose surviving unharmed so exposed. Hope it and its family will be OK. People won''t like this on an aesthetic level but I think your photojournalism deserves plenty of credit here.</td>', 'Amazing observation - I can''t imagine this Canada goose surviving unharmed so exposed. Hope it and its family will be OK. People won''t like this on an aesthetic level but I think your photojournalism deserves plenty of credit here.', '2005-04-25 17:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
