(1325031, 166709, 13879, '<td valign="top">Shame its a bit dark in the bottom half of the frame (lens too close?) But its a very crisp &amp; a lovely vibrant green.</td>', 'Shame its a bit dark in the bottom half of the frame (lens too close?) But its a very crisp & a lovely vibrant green.', '2005-04-25 17:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
