(1325033, 166125, 13879, '<td valign="top">might have looked nice as a Black &amp; white. Interesting photo none the less, looks very clean there!</td>', 'might have looked nice as a Black & white. Interesting photo none the less, looks very clean there!', '2005-04-25 17:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325034, 160041, 30392, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an amazing sky, I don''t how much is real and how much is PS, but it doesn''t look overprocessed to me. The horizon is not perfectly level and that bugs me though!</td>', 'Wow, what an amazing sky, I don''t how much is real and how much is PS, but it doesn''t look overprocessed to me. The horizon is not perfectly level and that bugs me though!', '2005-04-25 17:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325037, 168203, 25742, '<td valign="top">I like this. the new sprig seems to come out the arms of the old tree, as if it was cradling it. good colourwork in post.prod.<br/>good luck /8</td>', 'I like this. the new sprig seems to come out the arms of the old tree, as if it was cradling it. good colourwork in post.prod.good luck /8', '2005-04-25 17:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325038, 166767, 22734, '<td valign="top">A great strong visual as a graphical representation but imho less processing and staying more withing its natural colors would have yielded a more highly exciting entry. Bumping from 5 to 6.</td>', 'A great strong visual as a graphical representation but imho less processing and staying more withing its natural colors would have yielded a more highly exciting entry. Bumping from 5 to 6.', '2005-04-25 17:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
