(1325056, 165380, 30392, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the exposure is timed just right. I love the orange tones, but I don;t think the border works for this shot 8</td>', 'Great shot, the exposure is timed just right. I love the orange tones, but I don;t think the border works for this shot 8', '2005-04-25 17:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
