(1325354, 168331, 8860, '<td valign="top">While the colours are wonderful and the scene''s sky is very strong, I feel that there was more potential here than is captured. I''d like to see more of those rocks to give a real sense of depth and distance - especially if you''d shot it low down witha deep DOF. As it stands, the scene is doing most of the work for you while you simply clicked the shutter from a fairly ordinary viewpoint.<br/> <br/>Image is crisp and clear with great saturation.</td>', 'While the colours are wonderful and the scene''s sky is very strong, I feel that there was more potential here than is captured. I''d like to see more of those rocks to give a real sense of depth and distance - especially if you''d shot it low down witha deep DOF. As it stands, the scene is doing most of the work for you while you simply clicked the shutter from a fairly ordinary viewpoint. Image is crisp and clear with great saturation.', '2005-04-25 18:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
