(1325361, 165956, 7711, '<td valign="top">lighting seems very low here, so the whole shot appears underexposed. Also, the colours are all very similar tonally. Did you consider some post-processing to create a bit of pop? Perhaps dodging and burning (this is advanced editting right?) Or even a little creative levels and saturation!</td>', 'lighting seems very low here, so the whole shot appears underexposed. Also, the colours are all very similar tonally. Did you consider some post-processing to create a bit of pop? Perhaps dodging and burning (this is advanced editting right?) Or even a little creative levels and saturation!', '2005-04-25 19:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325362, 168228, 7599, '<td valign="top">So simple yet it holds my interest at the same time. I think you have done a fantastic job with the composition.. I might have played with the contrast in PS a little  only because the image is a little flat and could possibly have had more pop</td>', 'So simple yet it holds my interest at the same time. I think you have done a fantastic job with the composition.. I might have played with the contrast in PS a little  only because the image is a little flat and could possibly have had more pop', '2005-04-25 19:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325364, 167740, 36091, '<td valign="top">Very nice, maybe a little too much softness on the face.</td>', 'Very nice, maybe a little too much softness on the face.', '2005-04-25 19:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325365, 168133, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good viewpoint and use of slow shutter. Image is a tad too oversharpened and you could have benefited from directional light (would need an ND filter though). Nice movement and a lovely place.</td>', 'Good viewpoint and use of slow shutter. Image is a tad too oversharpened and you could have benefited from directional light (would need an ND filter though). Nice movement and a lovely place.', '2005-04-25 19:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325370, 167963, 8860, '<td valign="top">Not a riveting photo but a good, successful experiment which could yield some great results for you.</td>', 'Not a riveting photo but a good, successful experiment which could yield some great results for you.', '2005-04-25 19:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325372, 163808, 30392, '<td valign="top">Incredible colors!!! I hope there''s not too much photoshop involved. 10</td>', 'Incredible colors!!! I hope there''s not too much photoshop involved. 10', '2005-04-25 19:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325374, 166813, 7711, '<td valign="top">how vibrant! I love it. The water droplets are so crisp, and the colour is gorgeous and bright. Enough so that the shadows don''t distract. Eww on the tick, but nicely captured!</td>', 'how vibrant! I love it. The water droplets are so crisp, and the colour is gorgeous and bright. Enough so that the shadows don''t distract. Eww on the tick, but nicely captured!', '2005-04-25 19:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325375, 161043, 36091, '<td valign="top">very nice contrast and composition</td>', 'very nice contrast and composition', '2005-04-25 19:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325377, 167123, 7711, '<td valign="top">the fade into the foreground to black is just perfect.</td>', 'the fade into the foreground to black is just perfect.', '2005-04-25 19:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325378, 168312, 7599, '<td valign="top">There is definite potential here. It does look like the colour is a little off; did you adjust your levels at all? There looks too be too much green and purple.</td>', 'There is definite potential here. It does look like the colour is a little off; did you adjust your levels at all? There looks too be too much green and purple.', '2005-04-25 19:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325380, 168181, 36091, '<td valign="top">Great detail on the fur.</td>', 'Great detail on the fur.', '2005-04-25 19:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325381, 167631, 30392, '<td valign="top">Holy crap, this looks scary. Tornado alley? Excellent shot</td>', 'Holy crap, this looks scary. Tornado alley? Excellent shot', '2005-04-25 19:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325383, 168160, 8860, '<td valign="top">Go easy on your editing - this looks over processed. Your scene looks great though but it''s a shame you couldn''t get closer.</td>', 'Go easy on your editing - this looks over processed. Your scene looks great though but it''s a shame you couldn''t get closer.', '2005-04-25 19:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325388, 165018, 7711, '<td valign="top">the addition of this border makes this photo look like a postcard. I think I like that about this. :)</td>', 'the addition of this border makes this photo look like a postcard. I think I like that about this. :)', '2005-04-25 19:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325389, 163558, 17851, '<td valign="top">Very nice :) love the blue tones and the overall effect ......probably one of the more artsy shots in this challenge so I hope its not getting knocked down...best of luck :)</td>', 'Very nice :) love the blue tones and the overall effect ......probably one of the more artsy shots in this challenge so I hope its not getting knocked down...best of luck :)', '2005-04-25 19:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325390, 167753, 30392, '<td valign="top">Very springy shot! It''s a shame the sky''s a bit washed out</td>', 'Very springy shot! It''s a shame the sky''s a bit washed out', '2005-04-25 19:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325391, 165018, 7599, '<td valign="top">Great colours, composition and I have to say for once I actually like a border! It would have been nice if the flowers in focus had a bit more detail to them in the white parts. I cant tell if it was a focus issue or a colour adjustment/neat image step. Other than that I wouldnt change a thing.</td>', 'Great colours, composition and I have to say for once I actually like a border! It would have been nice if the flowers in focus had a bit more detail to them in the white parts. I cant tell if it was a focus issue or a colour adjustment/neat image step. Other than that I wouldnt change a thing.', '2005-04-25 19:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325393, 164941, 6532, '<td valign="top">Nice Panoramic.......</td>', 'Nice Panoramic.......', '2005-04-25 19:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325394, 167367, 30392, '<td valign="top">Could be a poster, well done!</td>', 'Could be a poster, well done!', '2005-04-25 19:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325396, 167929, 7711, '<td valign="top">absolutely elegant in its simplicity. Its got all the drama it needs without clutter.</td>', 'absolutely elegant in its simplicity. Its got all the drama it needs without clutter.', '2005-04-25 19:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325397, 161043, 6532, '<td valign="top">Would love to see his face..........</td>', 'Would love to see his face..........', '2005-04-25 19:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325398, 160314, 30392, '<td valign="top">Didn''t get the title until the photo finished loading, funny! And good shot too</td>', 'Didn''t get the title until the photo finished loading, funny! And good shot too', '2005-04-25 19:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325399, 164188, 7711, '<td valign="top">most of this photo is shrouded in too much darkness to appreciate the composition. The colours that are there (the water and sunset sky) are pretty.</td>', 'most of this photo is shrouded in too much darkness to appreciate the composition. The colours that are there (the water and sunset sky) are pretty.', '2005-04-25 19:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325400, 167120, 7599, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus! The cats head is perfect. Its unfortunate that he blends so well into the background. If the background had been a different colour, I think the cat would have looked real enough to pet.</td>', 'Excellent focus! The cats head is perfect. Its unfortunate that he blends so well into the background. If the background had been a different colour, I think the cat would have looked real enough to pet.', '2005-04-25 19:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325401, 167994, 6532, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity, dof and detail.</td>', 'Nice clarity, dof and detail.', '2005-04-25 19:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325402, 165900, 8860, '<td valign="top">This looks like Scotland or the Lakes - a wonderful place and a good vantage point. A few blow outs in the sky but this is very evocative for me and I just want to walk to the top.</td>', 'This looks like Scotland or the Lakes - a wonderful place and a good vantage point. A few blow outs in the sky but this is very evocative for me and I just want to walk to the top.', '2005-04-25 19:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325404, 167500, 7711, '<td valign="top">i like the space you''ve left above the lion. It really works for the shot.</td>', 'i like the space you''ve left above the lion. It really works for the shot.', '2005-04-25 19:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325405, 167092, 6532, '<td valign="top">What is your subject?</td>', 'What is your subject?', '2005-04-25 19:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325406, 167488, 30392, '<td valign="top">Well spotted!  Poor bird, a long way from the wild...</td>', 'Well spotted!  Poor bird, a long way from the wild...', '2005-04-25 19:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325408, 159259, 7711, '<td valign="top">whoa! Nice composition, too much magenta though. A more naturally coloured shot would look gorgeous.</td>', 'whoa! Nice composition, too much magenta though. A more naturally coloured shot would look gorgeous.', '2005-04-25 19:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325409, 163982, 7711, '<td valign="top">beautiful concept. :) But you need to boost brightness or do something about the underexposed-ness.</td>', 'beautiful concept. :) But you need to boost brightness or do something about the underexposed-ness.', '2005-04-25 19:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325411, 166994, 30392, '<td valign="top">Extremely original, could be a winner! 10</td>', 'Extremely original, could be a winner! 10', '2005-04-25 19:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325415, 163429, 30392, '<td valign="top">Just briilant! Top 10 for sure and a 10 from me</td>', 'Just briilant! Top 10 for sure and a 10 from me', '2005-04-25 19:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325416, 161870, 8860, '<td valign="top">A beautiful tree which captures the essence of Bonsai - the discovery and emulation of a full size tree is the inspiration behind the art. The centering works well - sky is a touch overcooked - but the light is great. Love it.</td>', 'A beautiful tree which captures the essence of Bonsai - the discovery and emulation of a full size tree is the inspiration behind the art. The centering works well - sky is a touch overcooked - but the light is great. Love it.', '2005-04-25 19:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325418, 166539, 16241, '<td valign="top">class</td>', 'class', '2005-04-25 19:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325419, 168280, 8860, '<td valign="top">Well spotted, great light, clarity, focus and comp. Not a ''wow'' shot but an accomplished one.</td>', 'Well spotted, great light, clarity, focus and comp. Not a ''wow'' shot but an accomplished one.', '2005-04-25 19:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325420, 167092, 9668, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and composition. I wish more of the foreground was shown.</td>', 'Lovely colors and composition. I wish more of the foreground was shown.', '2005-04-25 19:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325421, 168320, 7599, '<td valign="top">Very nice, almost a strong girl glamour shot if there is such a thing. The only thing I can think to suggest improvement on is that her arms look a bit too soft and lack detail  makes them look airbrushed. Thats a minor thing to mention though because the image really is fantastic.</td>', 'Very nice, almost a strong girl glamour shot if there is such a thing. The only thing I can think to suggest improvement on is that her arms look a bit too soft and lack detail  makes them look airbrushed. Thats a minor thing to mention though because the image really is fantastic.', '2005-04-25 19:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325423, 159259, 9668, '<td valign="top">Interesting coloration, looks really off, but that makes it different. I like the simplicity</td>', 'Interesting coloration, looks really off, but that makes it different. I like the simplicity', '2005-04-25 19:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325425, 160808, 8860, '<td valign="top">Cute, crisp and clear. Excellent portrait with a natural expression too - and filling the frame was a good choice.</td>', 'Cute, crisp and clear. Excellent portrait with a natural expression too - and filling the frame was a good choice.', '2005-04-25 19:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325427, 164008, 30392, '<td valign="top">I really like the photo, the grain and the sepia tones work very well imo. I don''t care much for the title though and I don''t get the link with the ski lift, but still a powerful and very original shot. 8</td>', 'I really like the photo, the grain and the sepia tones work very well imo. I don''t care much for the title though and I don''t get the link with the ski lift, but still a powerful and very original shot. 8', '2005-04-25 19:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325428, 168089, 7599, '<td valign="top">Totally different, I love it. Only one thing I would have liked to change and that would be the background on the right side with the lines. Other then that I think this is a funky, original shot!</td>', 'Totally different, I love it. Only one thing I would have liked to change and that would be the background on the right side with the lines. Other then that I think this is a funky, original shot!', '2005-04-25 19:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325433, 166460, 30392, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape, perhaps a bit too saturated</td>', 'Nice landscape, perhaps a bit too saturated', '2005-04-25 19:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325434, 166015, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot of a wonderful, noisy scene! You have some sharpen halos though, so next time leave the sharpening until you''ve resized your shot for 640px then convert to lab colour and sharpen the ''lightness'' channel (and fade as appropriate). Works a treat.</td>', 'Lovely shot of a wonderful, noisy scene! You have some sharpen halos though, so next time leave the sharpening until you''ve resized your shot for 640px then convert to lab colour and sharpen the ''lightness'' channel (and fade as appropriate). Works a treat.', '2005-04-25 19:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325440, 159259, 30392, '<td valign="top">First reaction: WOW, then :colors don''t look right, something''s wrong. Curious to see how this pic will place</td>', 'First reaction: WOW, then :colors don''t look right, something''s wrong. Curious to see how this pic will place', '2005-04-25 19:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325441, 167100, 8860, '<td valign="top">What a little puffball poppet! You''ve captured this flawlessly - love it. Should''ve retouched the speck though. (Doh!)</td>', 'What a little puffball poppet! You''ve captured this flawlessly - love it. Should''ve retouched the speck though. (Doh!)', '2005-04-25 19:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325448, 167337, 30392, '<td valign="top">Great landscape and dramatic sky but I find the foreground boulders too much, they draw the eye away from the mountains and sky...</td>', 'Great landscape and dramatic sky but I find the foreground boulders too much, they draw the eye away from the mountains and sky...', '2005-04-25 19:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325451, 167563, 8860, '<td valign="top">Cute pic - just needed a bit more space around the subject at the bottom. Love the captured ripples and cute orange feet.</td>', 'Cute pic - just needed a bit more space around the subject at the bottom. Love the captured ripples and cute orange feet.', '2005-04-25 19:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325453, 168259, 30392, '<td valign="top">This looks suspiciously like marijuana, nice dark shot though, I like the contrast between the green and the background 8</td>', 'This looks suspiciously like marijuana, nice dark shot though, I like the contrast between the green and the background 8', '2005-04-25 19:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325454, 167727, 15002, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of all the entries.  I''m not usually a big kid,kitten,flower fan.  But this is exceptional work.  Soft skin tone, bright eyes, stopped motion... Nice work.</td>', 'This is my favorite of all the entries.  I''m not usually a big kid,kitten,flower fan.  But this is exceptional work.  Soft skin tone, bright eyes, stopped motion... Nice work.', '2005-04-25 19:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325455, 160446, 6405, '<td valign="top">Trees behind the head are distracting,they look like extension of her hair.<br/>Eyes must be visible on portraits,not to be in the shadow.</td>', 'Trees behind the head are distracting,they look like extension of her hair.Eyes must be visible on portraits,not to be in the shadow.', '2005-04-25 19:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325457, 168319, 16965, '<td valign="top">Another incredible Sunrise shot from Coronado?  BradP? :)</td>', 'Another incredible Sunrise shot from Coronado?  BradP? :)', '2005-04-25 19:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325462, 167276, 30392, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot, I don''t get the title but it doesn''t matter 10</td>', 'Stunning shot, I don''t get the title but it doesn''t matter 10', '2005-04-25 19:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325501, 161112, 8860, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot - and very sad that you''ve had to explain in the title, but I understand why. I think the motion blur filter should be banned from this site.<br/> <br/>I do find her stance quite ungainly though - therefore a  it unaesthetic. Well composed.</td>', 'Excellent shot - and very sad that you''ve had to explain in the title, but I understand why. I think the motion blur filter should be banned from this site. I do find her stance quite ungainly though - therefore a  it unaesthetic. Well composed.', '2005-04-25 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325507, 161508, 8860, '<td valign="top">Never seen that before - amazing! Looks a little artificially soft in places but it''s a great view and very dynamic.</td>', 'Never seen that before - amazing! Looks a little artificially soft in places but it''s a great view and very dynamic.', '2005-04-25 19:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325514, 167885, 8860, '<td valign="top">Wonderful scene - very well spotted. Shame about the distortion so I''d have addressed this in PP, but this is a beautiful exposure.</td>', 'Wonderful scene - very well spotted. Shame about the distortion so I''d have addressed this in PP, but this is a beautiful exposure.', '2005-04-25 19:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325516, 165380, 8860, '<td valign="top">Wonderful view. Love those trees.</td>', 'Wonderful view. Love those trees.', '2005-04-25 19:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325522, 167687, 8860, '<td valign="top">Yes, ''tis beautiful and needs protecting.</td>', 'Yes, ''tis beautiful and needs protecting.', '2005-04-25 19:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325527, 163429, 8860, '<td valign="top">Expert capture. Great angle and detail.</td>', 'Expert capture. Great angle and detail.', '2005-04-25 19:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325528, 163404, 20066, '<td valign="top">hmm it would have been ok if it was a litle bit larger!<br/>Difficult to vote for it properly so small when it is not possible to see it properly.  But I think the original wasn''t bad at all.</td>', 'hmm it would have been ok if it was a litle bit larger!Difficult to vote for it properly so small when it is not possible to see it properly.  But I think the original wasn''t bad at all.', '2005-04-25 19:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325535, 168006, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great colour and viewpoint.</td>', 'Great colour and viewpoint.', '2005-04-25 19:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325536, 166567, 30392, '<td valign="top">Maybe a ribbon, top 10 for sure</td>', 'Maybe a ribbon, top 10 for sure', '2005-04-25 19:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325547, 168276, 9906, '<td valign="top">I love to do existing light photography like this!  This is a nicely detailed shot.  I''m assuming that you used a tripod here.  My only question is what color was the structure during the daytime?  The yellow tint doesn''t seem to be quite natural...<br/>TC</td>', 'I love to do existing light photography like this!  This is a nicely detailed shot.  I''m assuming that you used a tripod here.  My only question is what color was the structure during the daytime?  The yellow tint doesn''t seem to be quite natural...TC', '2005-04-25 19:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325549, 160288, 28108, '<td valign="top">Truly awsome shot. Amazing color match, the model is simply beautiful. Nice shot! - In my final top 3!</td>', 'Truly awsome shot. Amazing color match, the model is simply beautiful. Nice shot! - In my final top 3!', '2005-04-25 19:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325550, 166567, 28108, '<td valign="top">Whoa! Very nice. I love the pose. The light reveals the feathers in a very nice way. - In my final top 3!</td>', 'Whoa! Very nice. I love the pose. The light reveals the feathers in a very nice way. - In my final top 3!', '2005-04-25 19:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325558, 161186, 28108, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture. The composition is perfect! The colors are very smooth on the eyes and the model packs personality! Good luck!</td>', 'Wonderful picture. The composition is perfect! The colors are very smooth on the eyes and the model packs personality! Good luck!', '2005-04-25 19:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325564, 168331, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is definately one of the more dramatic sunsets that I''ve seen in a while.  The problem with many sunset shot is that there really is no subject to draw your eye to.  Even though the sunset is dramatic, it''s only sky.  To make it really sing, it needs something to give visual reference to...<br/>TC</td>', 'This is definately one of the more dramatic sunsets that I''ve seen in a while.  The problem with many sunset shot is that there really is no subject to draw your eye to.  Even though the sunset is dramatic, it''s only sky.  To make it really sing, it needs something to give visual reference to...TC', '2005-04-25 19:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325576, 164860, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nicely simple.  Great use of the designs leading lines.  Nicely off centered.  Nice use of a splash of color.  I think of shots like this as great study shots.  Awesome for learning the basics of composition, but there isn''t a lot here to make me say, ''I can''t wait to see this one again!''  I almost forgot to say you have some jaggies on the right most part of the outer circle.  Trying slightly different sizes might help eliminate this.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nicely simple.  Great use of the designs leading lines.  Nicely off centered.  Nice use of a splash of color.  I think of shots like this as great study shots.  Awesome for learning the basics of composition, but there isn''t a lot here to make me say, ''I can''t wait to see this one again!''  I almost forgot to say you have some jaggies on the right most part of the outer circle.  Trying slightly different sizes might help eliminate this.TC', '2005-04-25 19:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325577, 165987, 28108, '<td valign="top">I''ve posted one with similar sky condition and I''m being picked on by that. I hope they weren''t too hard on you. It''s a beautiful picture. I love the curved lines and the shadow actually give it more levels. Like I said, I like the negative space created by the calm sky. Best of luck!</td>', 'I''ve posted one with similar sky condition and I''m being picked on by that. I hope they weren''t too hard on you. It''s a beautiful picture. I love the curved lines and the shadow actually give it more levels. Like I said, I like the negative space created by the calm sky. Best of luck!', '2005-04-25 19:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325580, 167427, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great bokeh!<br/>TC</td>', 'Great bokeh!TC', '2005-04-25 19:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325582, 168259, 28108, '<td valign="top">Very nice display of... hibiscus ;-)  Man, I''m hungry...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-26 00:43:05.</i></td>', 'Very nice display of... hibiscus ;-)  Man, I''m hungry...', '2005-04-25 19:57:22.000000', '2005-04-26 01:43:05.000000', 1),
(1325589, 163981, 23394, '<td valign="top">wonderful image, really love all the tones.  looks like you could reach out and touch those clouds.  hope this does well for you!</td>', 'wonderful image, really love all the tones.  looks like you could reach out and touch those clouds.  hope this does well for you!', '2005-04-25 19:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325595, 168230, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice job with the lighting and focus.  can''t say i''m too keen on the centered composition, though.  a bit more of a diagonal, with the bud either closer to the left or right, and this really would have rocked.  hope it does well for you.  good luck!</td>', 'nice job with the lighting and focus.  can''t say i''m too keen on the centered composition, though.  a bit more of a diagonal, with the bud either closer to the left or right, and this really would have rocked.  hope it does well for you.  good luck!', '2005-04-25 19:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325600, 167123, 28108, '<td valign="top">The sky has beautiful colors that blends remarkably well. The shadows accentuates the texture in the sand. I love how the light source is visible from the top left corner, it creates a good harmony with the foreground. Solid, good luck!</td>', 'The sky has beautiful colors that blends remarkably well. The shadows accentuates the texture in the sand. I love how the light source is visible from the top left corner, it creates a good harmony with the foreground. Solid, good luck!', '2005-04-25 20:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325601, 167445, 23394, '<td valign="top">very strong image.  love the lines and textures.  hope this does well for you.  good luck!</td>', 'very strong image.  love the lines and textures.  hope this does well for you.  good luck!', '2005-04-25 20:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325603, 164269, 23394, '<td valign="top">the colors and contrast in the background are great, but the focus on your subject is a bit soft.  the lighting on the walls facing the sun are a bit washed out--this must have been a trip to meter.  you might consider slightly burning them in.  hope this does well for you.  good luck!</td>', 'the colors and contrast in the background are great, but the focus on your subject is a bit soft.  the lighting on the walls facing the sun are a bit washed out--this must have been a trip to meter.  you might consider slightly burning them in.  hope this does well for you.  good luck!', '2005-04-25 20:02:01.000000', NULL, 1);
