(1325636, 168202, 23394, '<td valign="top">i usually take whatever i get out of the camera, and maybe fiddle with it some (you know, the basics).  every now and then, though, i find an image i have to set aside because i know it''s going to need a bit more work than what i can do in a few hurried minutes.  the point?  i think this image could really use some distortion correction.  i don''t know how involved that process is, but this image just doesn''t appeal to me as is.  hopefully others will think it''s really cool.</td>', 'i usually take whatever i get out of the camera, and maybe fiddle with it some (you know, the basics).  every now and then, though, i find an image i have to set aside because i know it''s going to need a bit more work than what i can do in a few hurried minutes.  the point?  i think this image could really use some distortion correction.  i don''t know how involved that process is, but this image just doesn''t appeal to me as is.  hopefully others will think it''s really cool.', '2005-04-25 20:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
