(1325685, 166202, 28108, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture. Too bad the other kid comes in the frame. He certainly bursts my bubble, but that can be cloned out. But still very nice work, great moment. Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice picture. Too bad the other kid comes in the frame. He certainly bursts my bubble, but that can be cloned out. But still very nice work, great moment. Good luck!', '2005-04-25 20:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325686, 168053, 23394, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful palce to be.  this looks like an interesting image.  i''m having a tough time with the beach, though.  i can see sunlight in the fronds, and i see the shadow, but there''s hardly any texture to the beach.  i like the composition, how the trees are balanced by the clouds, and the primary subject is pushed just off-center.  hope this does well for you.  good luck!</td>', 'what a beautiful palce to be.  this looks like an interesting image.  i''m having a tough time with the beach, though.  i can see sunlight in the fronds, and i see the shadow, but there''s hardly any texture to the beach.  i like the composition, how the trees are balanced by the clouds, and the primary subject is pushed just off-center.  hope this does well for you.  good luck!', '2005-04-25 20:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325688, 167226, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good picture... bag the frame.</td>', 'Good picture... bag the frame.', '2005-04-25 20:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325692, 165589, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting image.  don''t know if that''s the strongest composition for your subject or not, though.  it''s a bit too centered, and there''s really nothing to the left or right to either contribute to it or to balance it out.  the bw treatment is a nice touch, and i do like how it doesn''t feel over-processed.  hope this does well for you.  good luck!</td>', 'interesting image.  don''t know if that''s the strongest composition for your subject or not, though.  it''s a bit too centered, and there''s really nothing to the left or right to either contribute to it or to balance it out.  the bw treatment is a nice touch, and i do like how it doesn''t feel over-processed.  hope this does well for you.  good luck!', '2005-04-25 20:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325697, 160330, 6600, '<td valign="top">I absolutley love owls, but have never gotten close enough to get any shot would compare to this.  Great capture!   I also like the others (that I assume were yours) posted in the past.</td>', 'I absolutley love owls, but have never gotten close enough to get any shot would compare to this.  Great capture!   I also like the others (that I assume were yours) posted in the past.', '2005-04-25 20:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
