(1325949, 166125, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting image.  the lights are just a hair too strong, taking away from what could be a very inviting atmosphere.  this looks like it could offer a lot of shooting opportunities, especially to capture some reflections off the water at night.  good luck!</td>', 'interesting image.  the lights are just a hair too strong, taking away from what could be a very inviting atmosphere.  this looks like it could offer a lot of shooting opportunities, especially to capture some reflections off the water at night.  good luck!', '2005-04-25 21:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325951, 161826, 23394, '<td valign="top">lovely colors, nice capture.  you can almost feel the wind whipping across the image.</td>', 'lovely colors, nice capture.  you can almost feel the wind whipping across the image.', '2005-04-25 21:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325954, 168276, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice capture.  must have been a real treat, metering this.  love the curves, angles, lines, and details you''ve managed to bring out.  good work.  hope this does well for you.  good luck!</td>', 'nice capture.  must have been a real treat, metering this.  love the curves, angles, lines, and details you''ve managed to bring out.  good work.  hope this does well for you.  good luck!', '2005-04-25 21:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
