(1325963, 168144, 23394, '<td valign="top">absolutely beautiful capture.  not too keen on the treatment of the clouds, though.  this might have been a more dynamic image if you had cropped in tighter to the falls, leaving out the sky altogether.  just a suggestion, hope this does well for you.  good luck!</td>', 'absolutely beautiful capture.  not too keen on the treatment of the clouds, though.  this might have been a more dynamic image if you had cropped in tighter to the falls, leaving out the sky altogether.  just a suggestion, hope this does well for you.  good luck!', '2005-04-25 21:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325964, 159893, 6532, '<td valign="top">dark - seems idea is there - composition could be improved....</td>', 'dark - seems idea is there - composition could be improved....', '2005-04-25 21:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325970, 160330, 27847, '<td valign="top">This is just a great photo, it''s a very sharp photo with good focus on the face and nice motion on the wings. Hope you didn''t spend all day waiting for this one but it''s was worth it. Good Luck.</td>', 'This is just a great photo, it''s a very sharp photo with good focus on the face and nice motion on the wings. Hope you didn''t spend all day waiting for this one but it''s was worth it. Good Luck.', '2005-04-25 21:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325974, 164775, 6532, '<td valign="top">the line of the giraffe works nicely in the composition....  maybe to crop it a bit tighter would have improved overall....</td>', 'the line of the giraffe works nicely in the composition....  maybe to crop it a bit tighter would have improved overall....', '2005-04-25 21:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325978, 168305, 13772, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture. It has a calming feel to it. The only thing that I might change is the tree limb in the front. I find it a bit distracting. Good luck!</td>', 'I really like this picture. It has a calming feel to it. The only thing that I might change is the tree limb in the front. I find it a bit distracting. Good luck!', '2005-04-25 21:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325984, 167784, 27847, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple I''m usually up for those but this one just doesn''t say much to me. Here''s how I would have improved on this photo (yes I know it''s too late but...) I would have offset the leaves to the right since the leaves are bending towards the left (they basically would be moving into the frame) the centre composition just doesn''t work here. Also really too bad the top of the leave was cut off a step back and/or two would have caught the whole things nicely and last but not least I find that the leaves are over-exposed from the sun ... almost white. Remember it is must my humble opinion only nothing more... good luck with the challenge.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-26 00:15:08.</i></td>', 'Nice and simple I''m usually up for those but this one just doesn''t say much to me. Here''s how I would have improved on this photo (yes I know it''s too late but...) I would have offset the leaves to the right since the leaves are bending towards the left (they basically would be moving into the frame) the centre composition just doesn''t work here. Also really too bad the top of the leave was cut off a step back and/or two would have caught the whole things nicely and last but not least I find that the leaves are over-exposed from the sun ... almost white. Remember it is must my humble opinion only nothing more... good luck with the challenge.', '2005-04-25 21:45:02.000000', '2005-04-26 01:15:08.000000', 1),
(1325990, 168292, 6532, '<td valign="top">Nice pastel affect - good dof....</td>', 'Nice pastel affect - good dof....', '2005-04-25 21:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325992, 166859, 7992, '<td valign="top">While the sun is just a bit "hot" (blown), this is hard to avoid. The overall shot is lovely, and I enjoyed the sunset in this different range of color and sky.</td>', 'While the sun is just a bit "hot" (blown), this is hard to avoid. The overall shot is lovely, and I enjoyed the sunset in this different range of color and sky.', '2005-04-25 21:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325995, 164431, 2764, '<td valign="top">wow - my first 10 of the bunch - timeless scene - subtle colors</td>', 'wow - my first 10 of the bunch - timeless scene - subtle colors', '2005-04-25 21:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325997, 168063, 27847, '<td valign="top">That''s just too cute, I mean it! I see a couple of Tyger''s (that''s my cat''s name) family in this shot they look just like he did when he was young. Very nice composition too on the whole however the kittens are a little soft to my linking but what can you do. Good Luck on this challenge.</td>', 'That''s just too cute, I mean it! I see a couple of Tyger''s (that''s my cat''s name) family in this shot they look just like he did when he was young. Very nice composition too on the whole however the kittens are a little soft to my linking but what can you do. Good Luck on this challenge.', '2005-04-25 21:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326001, 166994, 16879, '<td valign="top">Creative use of reflections</td>', 'Creative use of reflections', '2005-04-25 21:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326005, 166902, 16879, '<td valign="top">Sums up spring very nicely</td>', 'Sums up spring very nicely', '2005-04-25 21:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326008, 167196, 27847, '<td valign="top">What a great composition you have here, very beautiful view and framing in the photo. Nothing beats a natural frame for a photo, hard to find but once in a while you get lucky. Only thing I would have changes is maybe ducked down a little more to get more of the sky instead of the foreground grass/straw/hay... Excellent otherwise, good luck!</td>', 'What a great composition you have here, very beautiful view and framing in the photo. Nothing beats a natural frame for a photo, hard to find but once in a while you get lucky. Only thing I would have changes is maybe ducked down a little more to get more of the sky instead of the foreground grass/straw/hay... Excellent otherwise, good luck!', '2005-04-25 21:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326011, 163628, 16879, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary lighting</td>', 'Extraordinary lighting', '2005-04-25 21:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326014, 161419, 16879, '<td valign="top">but with an interesting twist</td>', 'but with an interesting twist', '2005-04-25 21:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326016, 161508, 27847, '<td valign="top">Very enchanting photograph; almost surreal and quite beautiful. It fills the photo very nicely and I love how the head is so sharp as opposed to the rest of the body. Pat on the shoulder is deserve, good luck!</td>', 'Very enchanting photograph; almost surreal and quite beautiful. It fills the photo very nicely and I love how the head is so sharp as opposed to the rest of the body. Pat on the shoulder is deserve, good luck!', '2005-04-25 21:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326017, 163225, 25742, '<td valign="top">nice barnacles. good to have them all in more or less good focus. maybe a bit too crowded for my taste, less is more. or if they were all in the same rythm. well, can''t be helped with wildlife.<br/>good luck</td>', 'nice barnacles. good to have them all in more or less good focus. maybe a bit too crowded for my taste, less is more. or if they were all in the same rythm. well, can''t be helped with wildlife.good luck', '2005-04-25 21:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
