(1326113, 167100, 23394, '<td valign="top">how cute is this!  and, once you get past the cute factor, you realize, hey, this is a good image as well.  very nicely done.  soft where it needs to be, but not so much as to lose the detail that give the textures life.  hope this does well for you.  good luck!</td>', 'how cute is this!  and, once you get past the cute factor, you realize, hey, this is a good image as well.  very nicely done.  soft where it needs to be, but not so much as to lose the detail that give the textures life.  hope this does well for you.  good luck!', '2005-04-25 22:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326118, 167258, 23394, '<td valign="top">this looks like a place that has potential, but, honestly, your treatment kinda wrecks it for me.  those colors are anything but inviting.  good luck with everyone else.</td>', 'this looks like a place that has potential, but, honestly, your treatment kinda wrecks it for me.  those colors are anything but inviting.  good luck with everyone else.', '2005-04-25 22:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326123, 166015, 23394, '<td valign="top">nicely seen and observed.  the detail is fantastic, considering the size limitations.  i can only begin to imagine what this would look like large.  very impressive capture.  thanks for sharing.  hope this does well for you.  good luck!</td>', 'nicely seen and observed.  the detail is fantastic, considering the size limitations.  i can only begin to imagine what this would look like large.  very impressive capture.  thanks for sharing.  hope this does well for you.  good luck!', '2005-04-25 22:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
