(1326582, 161121, 22734, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites. I would have reduced the red in the hand holding the umbrella. outside of this the image projects great charm and the sense of rain with a vibrant smile peeking out.</td>', 'One of my favorites. I would have reduced the red in the hand holding the umbrella. outside of this the image projects great charm and the sense of rain with a vibrant smile peeking out.', '2005-04-26 00:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
