(1326845, 165107, 19936, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments and nice things you had to say.  Spent about 2 hours standing about 10 feet from the feeder on my deck and took about 20 shots to get this.  The sun angle just was not right for me to get him from the front with his red throat without having my house in the background instead of the beautiful blus sky that day.  Thanks again to all.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments and nice things you had to say.  Spent about 2 hours standing about 10 feet from the feeder on my deck and took about 20 shots to get this.  The sun angle just was not right for me to get him from the front with his red throat without having my house in the background instead of the beautiful blus sky that day.  Thanks again to all.', '2005-04-26 01:11:46.000000', NULL, 0),
