(1326891, 168272, 31534, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the wonderful comments and since this was my first challenge I feel very encouraged and ready to join in again.<br/> <br/>To all who let me know this was a drake, yes I knew... But Cherry Prince didn''t sound right...<br/>I also had a duck who decided to close his eyes just when he was exactly where I wanted him to be. No easy feat since I was chasing his little DA to get the shot. This is why I could not get any detail on the ducks head. <br/> <br/>Not much done to the picture, cropped out some branches, added some saturation, and dodged and burned the wake.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks for all the wonderful comments and since this was my first challenge I feel very encouraged and ready to join in again. To all who let me know this was a drake, yes I knew... But Cherry Prince didn''t sound right...I also had a duck who decided to close his eyes just when he was exactly where I wanted him to be. No easy feat since I was chasing his little DA to get the shot. This is why I could not get any detail on the ducks head.  Not much done to the picture, cropped out some branches, added some saturation, and dodged and burned the wake. ', '2005-04-26 01:25:51.000000', NULL, 0),
