(1327092, 167100, 19959, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the kind comments. I was a little lazy with this shot (didn''t think it would do that well) and didn''t remove the speck or enhance the catchlights in his eyes<br/> <br/>I have an altered version on my site:<br/><a href="//www.pixelstate.com/cgi-bin/detail.pl?folder=pictures&amp;category=Flora%20and%20Fauna&amp;page=0&amp;count=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.pixelstate.com/cgi-bin/detail.pl?folder=pictures&amp;category=Flora%20and%20Fauna&amp;page=0&amp;count=1</a> <br/> <br/>Chris<br/> <br/>PS/ for those wondering it is actually a gosling, I just thought chick was more spring like!</td>', 'Thanks for all the kind comments. I was a little lazy with this shot (didn''t think it would do that well) and didn''t remove the speck or enhance the catchlights in his eyes I have an altered version on my site://www.pixelstate.com/cgi-bin/detail.pl?folder=pictures&category=Flora%20and%20Fauna&page=0&count=1  Chris PS/ for those wondering it is actually a gosling, I just thought chick was more spring like!', '2005-04-26 02:58:06.000000', NULL, 0),
