(1327097, 168169, 25355, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your 4th placing. This photo brings mixed feelings - when I first saw the thumbnail, I thought, "Wow, I mustn''t miss scoring this one." (I only managed 63% voting). On seeing it full-size, it somehow gives a strong feeling of claustrophobia. On the other hand, it''s a place a would like to go walking through. Anyway, I gave it 9. I like the colours.</td>', 'Congratulations on your 4th placing. This photo brings mixed feelings - when I first saw the thumbnail, I thought, "Wow, I mustn''t miss scoring this one." (I only managed 63% voting). On seeing it full-size, it somehow gives a strong feeling of claustrophobia. On the other hand, it''s a place a would like to go walking through. Anyway, I gave it 9. I like the colours.', '2005-04-26 03:00:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1327103, 168291, 36324, '<td valign="top">I still love this image. Was one of my favorites and still is, think it should have finished much, much higher...</td>', 'I still love this image. Was one of my favorites and still is, think it should have finished much, much higher...', '2005-04-26 03:04:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1327106, 168169, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well I was impressed by the processing on this before I looked at the original - but sheesh - that''s some serious ps wizardry. Great composition too. Well done, congrats ont he great score.</td>', 'Well I was impressed by the processing on this before I looked at the original - but sheesh - that''s some serious ps wizardry. Great composition too. Well done, congrats ont he great score.', '2005-04-26 03:05:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1327118, 167444, 22781, '<td valign="top">12th place, not bad, not bad at all.<br/>Congratulations on a good score with a very different photo.</td>', '12th place, not bad, not bad at all.Congratulations on a good score with a very different photo.', '2005-04-26 03:08:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1327136, 165380, 30857, '<td valign="top">This is just how I imagine it would be a sunset in Africa, those colours we have seen on the movies so often ... can''t wait to be there for real :)) Congrats for a wonderful picture :))</td>', 'This is just how I imagine it would be a sunset in Africa, those colours we have seen on the movies so often ... can''t wait to be there for real :)) Congrats for a wonderful picture :))', '2005-04-26 03:16:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1327138, 163935, 15032, '<td valign="top">Great job and congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'Great job and congrats on the ribbon!', '2005-04-26 03:16:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1327169, 167092, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great composition Robert.<br/>Your PP done turned this into a fine painting!</td>', 'Great composition Robert.Your PP done turned this into a fine painting!', '2005-04-26 03:28:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1327171, 166567, 7473, '<td valign="top">Nice Imagineer!</td>', 'Nice Imagineer!', '2005-04-26 03:29:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1327176, 166567, 5705, '<td valign="top">One of the most STUNNING photo''s I have seen in DPC!<br/>WOW to the 3rd Power.</td>', 'One of the most STUNNING photo''s I have seen in DPC!WOW to the 3rd Power.', '2005-04-26 03:30:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1327182, 166567, 13879, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! awesome picture</td>', 'Congratulations! awesome picture', '2005-04-26 03:36:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1327187, 167592, 36299, '<td valign="top">The shadow behind the chairs and the curtains in the windows, offset the sharpness of the rest of the picture.  The umbrella to the left seems to sharp when compared to the rest of the photo at that depth.</td>', 'The shadow behind the chairs and the curtains in the windows, offset the sharpness of the rest of the picture.  The umbrella to the left seems to sharp when compared to the rest of the photo at that depth.', '2005-04-26 03:40:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1327188, 166567, 19708, '<td valign="top">I had to come back a second time Jon.<br/>I am simply astounded at the pose and 3D feel this shot has.<br/>It defies a 2-dimensional plane and has so much depth to it. I doubt this could be reproduced in the best of studios or controlled environments.<br/></td>', 'I had to come back a second time Jon.I am simply astounded at the pose and 3D feel this shot has.It defies a 2-dimensional plane and has so much depth to it. I doubt this could be reproduced in the best of studios or controlled environments.', '2005-04-26 03:40:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1327189, 166567, 30392, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a fantastic picture and a giant score!</td>', 'Congratulations on a fantastic picture and a giant score!', '2005-04-26 03:41:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(1327190, 160330, 30392, '<td valign="top">What an amazing shot, congrats on top 10, should have been higher!</td>', 'What an amazing shot, congrats on top 10, should have been higher!', '2005-04-26 03:43:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(1327195, 161508, 25946, '<td valign="top">This is just beautiful.  Added to favorites.  Contratulations on your 8th place finish.  Renee :)</td>', 'This is just beautiful.  Added to favorites.  Contratulations on your 8th place finish.  Renee :)', '2005-04-26 03:47:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1327207, 167592, 22970, '<td valign="top">To Me, Absolutely stunning, I love it. Your photograph has great range, the lighting is spot on and not one blown highlight. But it goes beyond that. You are showing us were they sit to see a wonderful view instead of showing us the view itself. Very inviting to see a photograph such meaning. And the colors, I cannot say how much I love the contrast between the chairs themselves and the house. If I would of got to this photograph during voting I would of given it a 8. If I could have had the access to what the chairs were there for and the view one could see from them it would of scored a 10. I wish it would of scored higher because there is more in this picture than meets the eye. IMO you picked the right photograph. Congratulations and get a print of this one. <br/>Scott W. <br/></td>', 'To Me, Absolutely stunning, I love it. Your photograph has great range, the lighting is spot on and not one blown highlight. But it goes beyond that. You are showing us were they sit to see a wonderful view instead of showing us the view itself. Very inviting to see a photograph such meaning. And the colors, I cannot say how much I love the contrast between the chairs themselves and the house. If I would of got to this photograph during voting I would of given it a 8. If I could have had the access to what the chairs were there for and the view one could see from them it would of scored a 10. I wish it would of scored higher because there is more in this picture than meets the eye. IMO you picked the right photograph. Congratulations and get a print of this one. Scott W. ', '2005-04-26 03:54:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(1327214, 168249, 25355, '<td valign="top">I thought this would have placed higher, it''s such an unusual perspective.</td>', 'I thought this would have placed higher, it''s such an unusual perspective.', '2005-04-26 04:07:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(1327215, 165452, 25355, '<td valign="top">I concur with Steve, it should have placed higher.</td>', 'I concur with Steve, it should have placed higher.', '2005-04-26 04:08:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1327244, 166567, 31637, '<td valign="top">an 8 !! so deserved. This is one of the best photos ive ever seen !</td>', 'an 8 !! so deserved. This is one of the best photos ive ever seen !', '2005-04-26 04:24:26.000000', NULL, 0);
