(1327587, 168336, 35044, '<td valign="top">I liked it - gave you a 5.  Thought it captured a memory-type image quite well.  However, for swings, I think that the viewpoint needed to be lower (child height), that is if you were going for the "fading childhood memory  thing that I think that you were.</td>', 'I liked it - gave you a 5.  Thought it captured a memory-type image quite well.  However, for swings, I think that the viewpoint needed to be lower (child height), that is if you were going for the "fading childhood memory  thing that I think that you were.', '2005-04-26 08:14:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(1327591, 167130, 24890, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all of you for your comments. Especially skiprow, I see what you mean! I do like it better cropped like that. I am still new at this so to think to crop it short like that never occurred to me.  :( Wish it had!<br/> <br/>I entered this just because I thought it was a pretty good *pure* candid that fit in the dates. I didn''t set any of this up, I was just snapping shots while my husband had the girls fishing. My daughter hadn''t caught anything, so her expression reflects that.<br/> <br/>The only comment that I was taken back by was that, and I quote - "be more flattering without the hair behind the ears". All I can say to that is that the picture wouldn''t reflect my daughter at all then. She always has her hair behind her ears and I think that is adorable.<br/></td>', 'Thanks to all of you for your comments. Especially skiprow, I see what you mean! I do like it better cropped like that. I am still new at this so to think to crop it short like that never occurred to me.  :( Wish it had! I entered this just because I thought it was a pretty good *pure* candid that fit in the dates. I didn''t set any of this up, I was just snapping shots while my husband had the girls fishing. My daughter hadn''t caught anything, so her expression reflects that. The only comment that I was taken back by was that, and I quote - "be more flattering without the hair behind the ears". All I can say to that is that the picture wouldn''t reflect my daughter at all then. She always has her hair behind her ears and I think that is adorable.', '2005-04-26 08:19:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1327600, 166567, 24925, '<td valign="top">You did really well.  I''m glad a photo like this won, it actually contains emotion instead of just being a nice graphic.  Good work!</td>', 'You did really well.  I''m glad a photo like this won, it actually contains emotion instead of just being a nice graphic.  Good work!', '2005-04-26 08:26:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1327609, 166567, 4482, '<td valign="top">I''m still deaming of the 8 club!!! Congrats on an outstanding image!! Great post-processing!!!</td>', 'I''m still deaming of the 8 club!!! Congrats on an outstanding image!! Great post-processing!!!', '2005-04-26 08:28:53.000000', NULL, 0),
