(1327814, 168145, 35044, '<td valign="top">Technically excellent.  Flower looks a little lopsided to me as top petal is folded back (don''t know if that is the way they come).  Petal on RHS flower breaks into the DoF of the main subject matter and could be a distraction.  Quite a central composition - could lose the LHS.<br/> <br/>Image lacks a "wow" factor that the top photos have.  The image is a little bit cliched: it would have to be a perfect example to do very well (and even then, would lack the challenge of some of the top ranked shots, which will lead to lower scoring). <br/> <br/>Having said that, this has not been "slammed" - you have a majority of 5 (I read: good, but no more), 2nd ranked 6 (I read: better than average) and more 7s and 8s than 3s, and more 9s and 10s than 1s and 2s.  A fair result for a picture that is technically excellent, with subject that is pretty, but not captivating. <br/> <br/>I gave you a 6.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-26 08:50:20.</i></td>', 'Technically excellent.  Flower looks a little lopsided to me as top petal is folded back (don''t know if that is the way they come).  Petal on RHS flower breaks into the DoF of the main subject matter and could be a distraction.  Quite a central composition - could lose the LHS. Image lacks a "wow" factor that the top photos have.  The image is a little bit cliched: it would have to be a perfect example to do very well (and even then, would lack the challenge of some of the top ranked shots, which will lead to lower scoring).  Having said that, this has not been "slammed" - you have a majority of 5 (I read: good, but no more), 2nd ranked 6 (I read: better than average) and more 7s and 8s than 3s, and more 9s and 10s than 1s and 2s.  A fair result for a picture that is technically excellent, with subject that is pretty, but not captivating.  I gave you a 6.', '2005-04-26 09:46:23.000000', '2005-04-26 09:50:20.000000', 0),
