(1327833, 166567, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Gratitude Update</b> <br/> <br/>Thanks indeed for the compliments from a great many people I respect here - you''re all too kind. It''ll take me a month of Sunbdays to respond individually but I''ll try to do some profile vists later !<br/> <br/>... and Gordon I''m used to drinking Guinness so I''m no stranger to patience. Lucky? Hmmm - looking at some of the images in this challenge I think you''re right Mike...<br/>: )</td>', 'Gratitude Update  Thanks indeed for the compliments from a great many people I respect here - you''re all too kind. It''ll take me a month of Sunbdays to respond individually but I''ll try to do some profile vists later ! ... and Gordon I''m used to drinking Guinness so I''m no stranger to patience. Lucky? Hmmm - looking at some of the images in this challenge I think you''re right Mike...: )', '2005-04-26 09:54:15.000000', NULL, 0),
