(1328066, 168333, 34247, '<td valign="top">On a gut-feeling level, the pic shouts about something joyous, and makes people want to speculate on what it''s all about. I like the lighting, the ball shapes, the art gallery in blue and red. Was there some burning done on the suit, on the area below the art gallery sign? Anyway, I like this lots.</td>', 'On a gut-feeling level, the pic shouts about something joyous, and makes people want to speculate on what it''s all about. I like the lighting, the ball shapes, the art gallery in blue and red. Was there some burning done on the suit, on the area below the art gallery sign? Anyway, I like this lots.', '2005-04-26 11:29:04.000000', NULL, 0),
