(1328176, 168054, 7786, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the good comments. <br/> <br/>This picture was taken on a snowboardtrip in Chamonix,France. There was little thought put into this shot. I saw this hole formation in a serac and snap two shots of it while still standing on my snowboard and then rushed to catch up with the rest of my group. Guess there is luck in photography too. <br/> <br/>Postprocess was a sharpening and adjusted contrast/brightness.</td>', 'Thanks for all the good comments.  This picture was taken on a snowboardtrip in Chamonix,France. There was little thought put into this shot. I saw this hole formation in a serac and snap two shots of it while still standing on my snowboard and then rushed to catch up with the rest of my group. Guess there is luck in photography too.  Postprocess was a sharpening and adjusted contrast/brightness.', '2005-04-26 12:07:29.000000', NULL, 0),
