(1328800, 165619, 15207, '<td valign="top">I think there was some confusion about the shallow DOF here and the background (My fault for not relating this in the title). I didn''t do any editing to create the blurred effect - it was all done in the camera. This is actually an image of a peacock through its own feathers (the background and the foreground are all feathers, not leaves or foilage). I can see why it would be confusing and now that I see the scores, etc. I should have submitted another similar image of the same peacock but with a more detailed DOF. Thank you to everyone who voted and commented - it''s much appreciated!</td>', 'I think there was some confusion about the shallow DOF here and the background (My fault for not relating this in the title). I didn''t do any editing to create the blurred effect - it was all done in the camera. This is actually an image of a peacock through its own feathers (the background and the foreground are all feathers, not leaves or foilage). I can see why it would be confusing and now that I see the scores, etc. I should have submitted another similar image of the same peacock but with a more detailed DOF. Thank you to everyone who voted and commented - it''s much appreciated!', '2005-04-26 15:09:10.000000', NULL, 0),
