(1329174, 165380, 20066, '<td valign="top">Thankyou for all comments and voting, takk fyrir!<br/> <br/>I do more or less agree with you who say this picture shows a beautiful sunset as it was one of the most beautiful sunsets I have ever seen.  <br/> <br/>But since I was there with a group of people and some dangerous animals not so far away, I could not have the composition as I perhaps wanted to.  So I more or less agree with all of you and thanks, it scored much higher than I exepected when I submitted it.</td>', 'Thankyou for all comments and voting, takk fyrir! I do more or less agree with you who say this picture shows a beautiful sunset as it was one of the most beautiful sunsets I have ever seen.   But since I was there with a group of people and some dangerous animals not so far away, I could not have the composition as I perhaps wanted to.  So I more or less agree with all of you and thanks, it scored much higher than I exepected when I submitted it.', '2005-04-26 17:41:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1329204, 161870, 27220, '<td valign="top"><b>Beautiful Full Frame! </b>You should definately visit the tree again when it is leaf, it could become a series/pairing. <i>Excellent subject and composition. </i>Well done!</td>', 'Beautiful Full Frame! You should definately visit the tree again when it is leaf, it could become a series/pairing. Excellent subject and composition. Well done!', '2005-04-26 17:55:07.000000', NULL, 0),
