(1329459, 163404, 7343, '<td valign="top">OK, the picture was a bit small....  I guess I''ll have to read that tutorial on how to resize it properly.  Getting the side to a max of 640 was killing me.  A bit frustrating but I will learn.</td>', 'OK, the picture was a bit small....  I guess I''ll have to read that tutorial on how to resize it properly.  Getting the side to a max of 640 was killing me.  A bit frustrating but I will learn.', '2005-04-26 19:36:21.000000', NULL, 0),
