(1329468, 168218, 25655, '<td valign="top">What?!? 499 ?!? This is so under-rated!!!<br/>I''m sure it is only due to the large amount of DPCers who has too dark screens.<br/>If they missed that tiny light halo above the girl''s shoulder, they missed the entire photo.<br/> <br/>I think it''s beautiful. <br/>A little more light behind the people, to make their outlines stand out a little more would make this photo better, but I still like this one.<br/>I like the shallow DOF, the tones, the silhouettes and the idea behind the photo.</td>', 'What?!? 499 ?!? This is so under-rated!!!I''m sure it is only due to the large amount of DPCers who has too dark screens.If they missed that tiny light halo above the girl''s shoulder, they missed the entire photo. I think it''s beautiful. A little more light behind the people, to make their outlines stand out a little more would make this photo better, but I still like this one.I like the shallow DOF, the tones, the silhouettes and the idea behind the photo.', '2005-04-26 19:42:43.000000', NULL, 0),
