(1329580, 163558, 10268, '<td valign="top">Did you neat image this at all?<br/> <br/>There are weird spos in the image where it looks completely like there was noise reduction, then there are other spots where there''s a ton of noise.  It''s kind of odd.<br/> <br/>It''s such a beautiful image, but I think it could use more grain.  Parts look to smooth.  Still a really awesome photo, and should''ve place higher.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-26 19:17:17.</i></td>', 'Did you neat image this at all? There are weird spos in the image where it looks completely like there was noise reduction, then there are other spots where there''s a ton of noise.  It''s kind of odd. It''s such a beautiful image, but I think it could use more grain.  Parts look to smooth.  Still a really awesome photo, and should''ve place higher.', '2005-04-26 20:15:45.000000', '2005-04-26 20:17:17.000000', 0),
(1329583, 164671, 35021, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments!!!  I am so happy that I had such a great response and only 19 people scored it below a 5.  =) <br/> <br/>I do have to give a very special THANK YOU to Scott - he helped position me for this shot and gave me the idea for the white sheet.  =)  Of course, he let the sheet reveal more than I wanted it to... next time I''ll get a woman to assist me. haha.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments!!!  I am so happy that I had such a great response and only 19 people scored it below a 5.  =)  I do have to give a very special THANK YOU to Scott - he helped position me for this shot and gave me the idea for the white sheet.  =)  Of course, he let the sheet reveal more than I wanted it to... next time I''ll get a woman to assist me. haha.', '2005-04-26 20:17:03.000000', NULL, 0),
