(1330861, 161133, 23458, '<td valign="top">Hehehehe... I''m glad I didn''t submit mine to the free study then :). <br/> <br/>Though I have to say, there''s no way I could have done mine without a tripod - them''s some ridiculously sturdy hands you''ve got yourself. <br/> <br/>As for the photo itself, I really like the warm feel and the diffused effect your processing gives it (or was that just camera shake induced blur :P).</td>', 'Hehehehe... I''m glad I didn''t submit mine to the free study then :).  Though I have to say, there''s no way I could have done mine without a tripod - them''s some ridiculously sturdy hands you''ve got yourself.  As for the photo itself, I really like the warm feel and the diffused effect your processing gives it (or was that just camera shake induced blur :P).', '2005-04-27 03:39:38.000000', NULL, 0),
