(1334666, 162238, 8637, '<td valign="top">Frank thanks for your very nice comments.  I actually told my wife that I liked your shot better...I really like the angle you had with the bus as the greater part of the image (regardless of what others may have said).  If your shot was on the 1st of April, then we were there different days...I was there on the 13th (I believe)..visiting from Atlanta.  But it was still wet and cold (of course).  I envy you living in such a beuatiful place and the Seattle area is one of our favorite places.<br/> <br/>Take care and happy shooting.<br/> <br/>tom</td>', 'Frank thanks for your very nice comments.  I actually told my wife that I liked your shot better...I really like the angle you had with the bus as the greater part of the image (regardless of what others may have said).  If your shot was on the 1st of April, then we were there different days...I was there on the 13th (I believe)..visiting from Atlanta.  But it was still wet and cold (of course).  I envy you living in such a beuatiful place and the Seattle area is one of our favorite places. Take care and happy shooting. tom', '2005-04-27 19:11:22.000000', NULL, 0),
