(1342649, 166567, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Gratitude Update</b> <br/> <br/>Thanks again for some kind words - and spending the time to view and consider the photo.<br/> <br/>- Peterish, the shot was softly backlit with natural light and there was a lot of shadow on his front side. All I have done is lift some of that gloom with curves and levels. I also deepened the background (which was linear plank panels) to knock them right back and leave him to loom out of the darkness. <br/> <br/>That is how I wanted him to look - and how it felt at the time.</td>', 'Gratitude Update  Thanks again for some kind words - and spending the time to view and consider the photo. - Peterish, the shot was softly backlit with natural light and there was a lot of shadow on his front side. All I have done is lift some of that gloom with curves and levels. I also deepened the background (which was linear plank panels) to knock them right back and leave him to loom out of the darkness.  That is how I wanted him to look - and how it felt at the time.', '2005-04-29 12:31:34.000000', NULL, 0),
