(1344085, 168239, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a precious image and I have to agree with you on the focus.  It would totally change the photo if the focus was on the baby.  The soft focus is complimented by the soft pastel colors and the feeling of tender love the mother is protraying. You have satified all of the classic rules (ie. rule of thirds) and at the same time, taken a cvutting edge photo.  This is also an image that might have suffered a little from the 2 second rule.  It takes a little time to see all of the little nuances. <br/> <br/>I am sure this is a photo that will become a family heirloom and I hope you gave her a framed copy to put next to her wedding photo.  Very well done and you should be very proud.</td>', 'This is a precious image and I have to agree with you on the focus.  It would totally change the photo if the focus was on the baby.  The soft focus is complimented by the soft pastel colors and the feeling of tender love the mother is protraying. You have satified all of the classic rules (ie. rule of thirds) and at the same time, taken a cvutting edge photo.  This is also an image that might have suffered a little from the 2 second rule.  It takes a little time to see all of the little nuances.  I am sure this is a photo that will become a family heirloom and I hope you gave her a framed copy to put next to her wedding photo.  Very well done and you should be very proud.', '2005-04-29 19:17:54.000000', NULL, 0),
