(1347114, 163935, 29451, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Rissa:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bryanbrazil:</b></div><hr/><i> Hey, nice to see a fellow northern Californian win! I''ve taken a lot of photos at the SF Zoo, but never of this hawk. Did you shoot this through a metal cage? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks!  I shot this about four feet away from the hawk, who was out in the open tethered to a post.  So no cages involved.  It was in the children''s zoo area, where they sometimes have birds out on display. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Originally posted by Rissa: Originally posted by bryanbrazil: Hey, nice to see a fellow northern Californian win! I''ve taken a lot of photos at the SF Zoo, but never of this hawk. Did you shoot this through a metal cage?   Thanks!  I shot this about four feet away from the hawk, who was out in the open tethered to a post.  So no cages involved.  It was in the children''s zoo area, where they sometimes have birds out on display. ', '2005-04-30 16:48:51.000000', NULL, 0),
