(1357047, 168169, 34659, '<td valign="top">I posted a comment earlier, but needed to share with you my renewed ambition to achieve higher scores - thanks to your submission &amp; your comments about your AVR.  My current AVR is in between 4-5 in my 3 submissions so far.  At first I was very discouraged, but knew that through perserverence and some self-congratulations on relatively good shots (albeit not suited for challenge material at that particular time), I could come up with a winner too.<br/> <br/>I guess I just wanted to say again how much I have enjoyed your photo and how much encouragement your comments have given me.  Thank you.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I posted a comment earlier, but needed to share with you my renewed ambition to achieve higher scores - thanks to your submission & your comments about your AVR.  My current AVR is in between 4-5 in my 3 submissions so far.  At first I was very discouraged, but knew that through perserverence and some self-congratulations on relatively good shots (albeit not suited for challenge material at that particular time), I could come up with a winner too. I guess I just wanted to say again how much I have enjoyed your photo and how much encouragement your comments have given me.  Thank you. ', '2005-05-03 22:38:24.000000', NULL, 0),
