(1403036, 162322, 1531, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by TooCool:</b></div><hr/><i> I demand to know how you lit this.  This is the most incredible environmental portrait I''ve seen on this site yet!<br/>TC </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>One studio flash from each side. On our left there was a flash with a big softbox and on our right (a bit further away) I had another one with a reglular reflector which gives this hard effect on her shoulder for example. In addition to that my friend held a silver reflector between me and the flash on the left side.<br/> <br/>Cheers,<br/>Steinar Hugi</td>', 'Originally posted by TooCool: I demand to know how you lit this.  This is the most incredible environmental portrait I''ve seen on this site yet!TC   One studio flash from each side. On our left there was a flash with a big softbox and on our right (a bit further away) I had another one with a reglular reflector which gives this hard effect on her shoulder for example. In addition to that my friend held a silver reflector between me and the flash on the left side. Cheers,Steinar Hugi', '2005-05-21 22:04:49.000000', NULL, 0),
