(1447150, 165643, 7570, '<td valign="top">it might be the angle, for i dont think the building is rotated in your photo. it may have been better if i can see more of the building''s details rather than the boring sky (which simply serves for effects in this shot). the cropping needs some work, eg the base of the building is badly cropped, and too little photo estate after the building''s tallest point. should have left some extra room there. if u have the original with you, maybe i can show u wat sort of cropping i''m talking about.</td>', 'it might be the angle, for i dont think the building is rotated in your photo. it may have been better if i can see more of the building''s details rather than the boring sky (which simply serves for effects in this shot). the cropping needs some work, eg the base of the building is badly cropped, and too little photo estate after the building''s tallest point. should have left some extra room there. if u have the original with you, maybe i can show u wat sort of cropping i''m talking about.', '2005-06-11 06:05:14.000000', NULL, 0),
