(1614174, 168272, 37005, '<td valign="top">I stumbled upon this again and have to say that I just really am surprised this didn''t get ranked higher.  After having been away from here for awhile I started restoring my faith in DPC but seeing that some really great photos don''t do well makes me very sad.  <br/> <br/>Anyway, I just wanted to echo what I had said in the past, this is a great shot and the only thing that is issue for me is that you can''t see the ducks'' eye(s).  To me that is a very small part of an already great shot.  Great composition, phenomenol (it looks spelled wrong, I can never spell it right) coloring.  I really dig this shot.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I stumbled upon this again and have to say that I just really am surprised this didn''t get ranked higher.  After having been away from here for awhile I started restoring my faith in DPC but seeing that some really great photos don''t do well makes me very sad.   Anyway, I just wanted to echo what I had said in the past, this is a great shot and the only thing that is issue for me is that you can''t see the ducks'' eye(s).  To me that is a very small part of an already great shot.  Great composition, phenomenol (it looks spelled wrong, I can never spell it right) coloring.  I really dig this shot. ', '2005-08-16 09:01:15.000000', NULL, 0),
