(1899847, 167592, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has such interest for me.  The "all in a row" sense of it is great.  The varied colors of the chairs is a nice splash of contrast. It''s like "who sat there," or something like that.  This is a great image. The geometry of the architecture with the curve of the chairs makes for some nice eye candy. Isn''t it amazing how such an ordinary subject can be so emotive? Well, you pulled it off for sure.</td>', 'This has such interest for me.  The "all in a row" sense of it is great.  The varied colors of the chairs is a nice splash of contrast. It''s like "who sat there," or something like that.  This is a great image. The geometry of the architecture with the curve of the chairs makes for some nice eye candy. Isn''t it amazing how such an ordinary subject can be so emotive? Well, you pulled it off for sure.', '2005-11-27 11:22:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(1907158, 160746, 13759, '<td valign="top">Parabéns! Grande foto. Sou um curitibano morando hoje em Porto Alegre. Acho muito bacana encontrar bons fotógrafos brasileiros aqui no DPC.<br/>[In English]<br/>Congratulations! Great picture. I´m a curitibano (born at Curitiba), living at Porto Alegre at now. Is a pleasure to me to find good brazilian fotographers at here on DPC.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-11-30 09:55:49.</i></td>', 'Parabéns! Grande foto. Sou um curitibano morando hoje em Porto Alegre. Acho muito bacana encontrar bons fotógrafos brasileiros aqui no DPC.[In English]Congratulations! Great picture. I´m a curitibano (born at Curitiba), living at Porto Alegre at now. Is a pleasure to me to find good brazilian fotographers at here on DPC.', '2005-11-30 09:53:04.000000', '2005-11-30 09:55:49.000000', 0),
