(2276028, 163935, 39850, '<td valign="top">Apt that I make a comment on this now after <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=17851" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">elsapo</a>''s tribute to you, <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=307824" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Tribute to Rissa</a> in the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_results.php?CHALLENGE_ID=468" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Deja Vu II</a> Challenge.  This is still one of my favorite DPC photographs, and one of the first I added to my Favorites.  The centered composition and simple coloring coupled with the straight down the barrel stare, make this such an excellent photograph.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Apt that I make a comment on this now after elsapo''s tribute to you, Tribute to Rissa in the Deja Vu II Challenge.  This is still one of my favorite DPC photographs, and one of the first I added to my Favorites.  The centered composition and simple coloring coupled with the straight down the barrel stare, make this such an excellent photograph. ', '2006-03-31 09:06:22.000000', NULL, 0),
