(3350302, 167945, 65522, '<td valign="top">Has anyone bought this print yet, lol?  Hmm, bad use of punctuation, I''m not asking if I''m laughing.  My view of photography is: "You''ve taken a great shot if it raises emotion out of your viewer".  I think this is a great shot.  The contrast, the brightness levels; they all work for this picture.  Plus, it''s something everyone can relate to.  Who hasn''t seen a dead fish on the bank of a river or lake?</td>', 'Has anyone bought this print yet, lol?  Hmm, bad use of punctuation, I''m not asking if I''m laughing.  My view of photography is: "You''ve taken a great shot if it raises emotion out of your viewer".  I think this is a great shot.  The contrast, the brightness levels; they all work for this picture.  Plus, it''s something everyone can relate to.  Who hasn''t seen a dead fish on the bank of a river or lake?', '2007-02-10 10:01:25.000000', NULL, 0),
